<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="GEN" style="id">Seemtirnak</book>
  <para style="h">Seemtirnak</para>
  <para style="toc1">Seemtirnak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Seemtirnak</para>
  <para style="mt">Seemtirnak</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A hmaisabik ah Pathian in lei le van tla a seemsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei cu pianhmang nei lo thlahawmpi lawng a rak si. Thimnak in ti thukpi cu a khuh ih, Pathian ih Thlarau cu tipi parah a leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Tleunak um seh,” ti ah a ti ih tleunak cu a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in a zoh tikah a ṭha a ti. Cun Pathian in tleunak cu thimnak ihsin a ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tleunak cu “Sun,” ti ah a ko ih thimnak cu “Zan,” ti ah a ko. Zanlam a liam ih zinglam a suak, ni khatnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Tidai ṭhentu ah vankuumpi um seh, hmun dangdang ah tidai cu um hai seh,” ti ah a ti. A ti bangtuk in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vankuumpi cu Pathian in a tuah ih a hnuai tidai le a tlun tidai cu a ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian in vankuumpi cu, “Van,” ti ah a ko. Zanlam a liam ih zinglam a suak, ni hnihnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Leicar a langnak dingah van hnuai ih tidai tla cu hmunkhat ah khawm-aw hai seh,” ti ah a ti. A ti bangtuk in a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in leicaar cu, “Leilung,” ti ah a ko ih hmunkhatih a kom-awmi tidai cu, “Tifinriat,” ti ah a ko. Pathian in a tuah ciami a zoh tikah a ṭha a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Leilung in thingkung hramkung a phunphun, ci a neimi le rah a neimi, suah seh,” ti ah a ti. A ti bangtuk in an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah ci a neimi le rah a neimi thingkung hramkung phunkim leilung in a suahter. Cun Pathian in a tuah ciami a zoh tikah a ṭha a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Zanlam a liam ih zinglam a suak, ni thumnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Sun le zan ṭhentu dingah, ni le thla le kum ṭhentu dingah, le nithla relnak ah van ah khin tleunak tla um hai seh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Van ah an vaang ding ih leilung ah tleunak an pe ding,” ti ah a ti. A ti vekin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuticun Pathian in tleunak tumpi pahnih a tuah: sun caan reltu-ah ni a tuah ih zan caan reltu-ah thlapi a tuah. Arsi pawl khal a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leilung tleutertu dingah hi tleunak pawl tla cu Pathian in van ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sun le zan uktu dingah le tleunak le thimnak ṭhentu dingah an si. Pathian in a tuah ciami a zoh tikah a ṭha, ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Zanlam a liam ih zinglam a suak, ni linak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Ti sungih a nungmi sahring a phunphun tidai in suah seh, leitlun thli lak khalah vate tla zam hai seh,” ti ah a ti. A ti vekin an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah ti sungih ṭihnungza sahring tumpipi Pathian in a seemter, ti sungih a um a nungmi sahring a phunphun tla a seemter; cun vate a phunphun khal a seemter. Pathian in a tuah ciami a zoh tikah a ṭha, ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Ti sungih a nungmi sahring pawl cu pungzai uhla tipithuanthum khat ṭheh uh, vate pawl khal pungzai uhla leitlunah khat ṭheh uh,” ti ah thluasuah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zanlam a liam ih zinglam a suak, ni nganak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Innzuat sumhnam a phunphun le hramlakih ramsa a tum siseh, a fate siseh, a bokvakmi phunzakip leilung in suah seh,” ti ah a ti. A ti bangtuk in an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun Pathian in innzuat sumhnam a phunphun le hramlak ramsa a tum siseh, a fate siseh, bokvak ih a caang theimi hmuahhmuah tla a tuah. Pathian in a tuah ciami a zoh tikah a ṭha, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun Pathian in, “Milai tuah thlang uhsi; kanmah ih hmuihmel kengin kanmah bangin kan tuah pei. Ti sung um nga le vanih a zammi vate tlunah siseh, innzuat sumhnam le hramlak ramsa a tum a seen parah siseh, bokvak ih a caang theimi tlun khalah siseh, thu an nei pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuticun Pathian in milai cu a seemsuah; Pathian in amah ih hmuihmel vekin a seemsuah. Pathian in mipa le nunau a seemsuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun Pathian in an hnenah thluasuah a pek ih, “Fa tampi nei in pungzai uhla leilung hi nan luahkhat pei ih nan thuthu in nan umter pei. Ti sungih nga siseh, lei parih a vakmi ramsa tinkim a tum a seen le vanih vate hmuahhmuah tlun khalah siseh, thuneihnak ka lo pe,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Pathian in, “Leilung tlunah thlaici a phunphun le thingtheirah a phunphun nan ei dingah ka lo pe a si;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />vate phunzakip le ramsa tum le te phunzakip, a bokvak theimi ih an rawl dingah hramhring le thingrah ka pe a si,” ti ah a ti. A ti bangtuk in an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun Pathian in a tuah ciami hmuahhmuah a zoh tikah a ṭha ngaingai ti ah a ti. Zanlam a liam ih zinglam a suak, ni ruknak a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuticun leilung siseh van tla siseh, lei parih a ummi hmuahhmuah le van ih a ummi hmuahhmuah thawn Pathian in a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni ruk sungah Pathian in a hnaṭuan cu a ṭheh ih ni sarih ni ah a hnaṭuannak ihsin a cawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hnaṭuanmi a ṭheh ih a ni sarihnak ah a colh ruangah Pathian in cuih ni cu thluasuah a pek ih ni sunglawi ah a canter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lei le van a tuahnak thuhla cu cubangtuk in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa Pathian in lei le van a tuah ṭheh tikah lei parah thing le hrampi a um lo; thlaici keuh ding khal a um hrih lo; ziangahtile Pathian in ruah a surter hrih lo. Leiram ṭuantu dingah milai khal an um hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ruah a sur hrih lo nan leilung sungin ti a put ih leilung cu a hnawngter ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Bawipa Pathian in leidip a lak ih milai ah a tuah. A hnar sungah nunnak thaw a vun thawt ih minung ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Bawipa Pathian in nisuahnak lamih a ummi Eden ah hmuan a tuah ih acuih hmuanah cun a tuahmi minung cu a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rah ṭha a rahmi le a mawi zetzetmi thingkung a phunphun acuih hmuanah cun a keuhter. Hmuan laifangah nunnak thingkung, a ṭha le a sia theihthiamnak thingkung khal a keuhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun hmuan hnawngtertu dingah Eden ihsin tiva pakhat a luang ih hmuan leng a thlen tikah tiva pali ah a ṭhek aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pakhatnak tiva ih hmin cu Pishon a si ih Havilah ram kimvelah a luang. Havilah ram ahcun sui a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Havilah ram ih sui cu sui phun ṭha a si ih thingthling mankhung le Oniks lungvar sen tla an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pahnihnak tiva cu Gihon a si ih Kush ram kimvel ah a luang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pathumnak tiva cu Tigris a si ih Assiria ram nisuahnak lamah a luang. A palitnak tiva cu Eufrates a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Bawipa Pathian in a seemsuah mi pa cu loram ṭuantu le kilkhawitu dingin Eden hmuan ahcun a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian in a hnenah, “Hmuan sungih a ummi thingrah hmuahhmuah na ei thei;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />asinain a ṭha le a sia theihthiamnak thingkung ih rah cu na ei hrimhrim lo pei. Na ei asile na ei ni in na thi ding,” ti ah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Bawipa Pathian in, “Minung hi amah lawngih a um ding cu a rem lo; amah bawmtu ah rualpi ka tuahsak ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cule Pathian in leilung a lak ih ramsa a phunphun le vate a phunphun ah a tuah ih ziangtin a ko pei ti ah cu pa hnenah cun a fehpi hai. Cule cu pa in hmin a rak sak ciar vekin an hmin ah a cangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuticun cu pa in hramlak ramsa siseh, innzuat sumhnam le van ih a zammi vate hmuahhmuah siseh hmin a sak hai a si. Sikhalsehla amah ih hrangah bawmtu le rualpi a um hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa Pathian in cu pa cu ihhmuh thawzetin a itthatter ih a ihthat sungah a hnakruh pakhat a lak ih a titsa in a phih sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi pa sung ihsin a lakmi hnakruh cun nunau a tuah ih mi pa hnenah a ratpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih mi pa cun, “Atu lawngah maw keimah vek minung, Ka ruh in tuahmi ruh, Ka titsa in tuahmi titsa ka ton. Mi pa sungin lakmi a si ruangah, Mi nu tiin kawh siseh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah mipa in a nu le a pa a taanta ih a nupi thawn an kom-aw. Cutiin tisa khatah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An pahnih in lawngfangkheh in an um naón ningzah an thiam lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Pathian ih tuahmi hmuahhmuah lakah rulpi cu a hrokhrawl bikmi ramsa a si. Rulpi cun nunau hnenah, “Hmuan sungih thingkung pakhatkhat ih rah nan ei lo pei ti ah Pathian in a lo ti ngaingai maw?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nunau nu cun, “Hmuan sungih thingrah hmuahhmuah kan ei thei ko;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />asinain hmuan laifangih a ummi thingrah cu kan ei thei lo, ziangahtile acuih thingrah cu ‘Nan ei lo pei; a tham khal nan tham lo pei, nan ei asile nan thi ding a si,’ ti ah Pathian in in ti,” ti ah rulpi cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rulpi cun, “Cutin a si lo, nan thi hrimhrim lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nan ei asile nan ei ni in nan mit a vaang ding ih amah Pathian vekin a ṭha le a sia theihthiamnak nan nei ding, ti kha Pathian in a theih cia ruangah a lo khamnak a si,” ti ah nunau hnenah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cuticun nunau nu in hmuan laifangih thingkung mawizia le a rah thawt dingzia cu a hmu ih fim cu ziang tluk duhnungza so a si ding, tiin a ruat. Curuangah thingrah cu a lo ih a ei. Cuih hnuah a pasal a pek ih anih khal in a ei ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thingrah an ei ṭheh vete in an mit vaangin theihtheinak an nei ih lawngte ih um an si kha an thei aw. Curuangah theipi hnah an ṭhitkhawm ih an hup aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A cuih zanlam simneem ah Bawipa Pathian cu hmuan sungah a ra. A rat thawm an theih tikah a hnen ihsin hmuan sungih thingruul lakah an relh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa Pathian in mi pa cu a ko ih, “Khui lamah so na um?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cupa in, “Hmuan ih na rat thawm ka theih ih ka lawngfangkheh ka si ruangah ka thin a phang ih ka relh a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Zo in so lawngfangkheh ih na um cu a lo sim? Thingrah ei hlah aw ka lo timi na ei maw si?” ti ah Pathian in a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi pa in, “Ka hrangih na tuahmi nunau nu in thingrah cu i pek ih ka ei a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Bawipa Pathian in nunau nu hnenah, “Zianghrangah hiti in thil na tuah?” ti ah a sut. Cun nunau nu in, “Rulpi in i bum ih ka rak ei a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun rulpi hnenah Bawipa Pathian in, “Nunau nu na bum ruangah cawhkuan ka lo pe; Ramsa hmuahhmuah lakah nangmah lawng in hi camsiatnak hi na tuar ding; Atu thokin a bokin na vak ding ih, Na nunsung hmuahhmuah na ei ding rawl cu leidip a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunau thawn ka lo raal awter ding ih, Nan tesinfa tiangin nan raal aw ding. Na lu a lo subeek ding ih, Nang in a kedil na cuk ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Pathian in nunau hnenah, “Fa na vun tikih na harnak cu ka ṭhanter ding, Na hrin tikih a natnak cu ka karhter ding. Cu cingin na pasal cu na duh thotho ding ih, A lo uktu a si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Pathian in mi pa hnenah, “Na nupi thu na ngai sawn ih, Ei lo ding ka timi thingrah na ei ruangah, Leiram cu nangmah ruangah siatserh a si; Na pumcawmnak ah zonzai zetin, Na nunsung hmuahhmuah hna na ṭuan ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Leilung in hling le so le hrampi a phunphun a suah pei ih, Culak ih a keuhmi hramrawl na ei pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leidip in tuahmi na si ih, Leilung ih na can sal tiang, Na nunnak hrangah na thlanhriput in hna na ṭuan ding. Leidip in tuahmi na si ih, Leidip ah na cang sal ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun mi pa in a nupi cu minung hmuahhmuah ih nu a si hrangah Evi ti ah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Bawipa Pathian in Adam le a nupi hrangah savun hnipuan a tuahsak ih a hrukter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Bawipa Pathian in, “Minung cu a ṭha le a sia thleidan a thiam zo hrangah kanmah vek a si zo. Nunnak thingkung ih rah ei sal in kumkhua in a nung pang ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Curuangah Bawipa Pathian in minung cu a seemnak leilung thlo dingin Eden hmuan ihsin a dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian in minung cu a dawisuak ih nunnak thingkung kiangih zohman rat ngam lonak dingah hmuan ih nisuahnak lamah Cherubim le a tle zukzo ih a her-aw luailomi ralnam a ret.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Adam le a nupi Evi cu an pawl-aw ih Evi cu nau a keng. Fapa a nei ih, “ Bawipa ih bomnak in fapa ka nei a si,” ti ah a ti. Cuhrangah a hmin ah Kain a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a naupa Abel a hring sal. Abel cu tuukhal a si ih Kain cu lothlo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Caan a hung rei deuh tikah Kain cun a lo sungih a suakmi rawl pawl kha Bawipa a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Abel khal in a tuu faate suak hmaisa bik pawl a that ih a sa ṭhatnak bik Bawipa a pek ve. Abel tlun le a pekmi parah Bawipa cu a lung a kimzet;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />asinain Kain le a pekmi parah Bawipa cu a lung a kim lo. Cutikah Kain cu a thin a heng ih a mithmai a sia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Kain hnenah, “Ziangah so na thin a heng? Ziangah so na mithmai a siat?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A ṭhami tuah cila cohlan na si ko ding; sikhalsehla a ṭha lomi na tuah ruangah sualnak in nangmah neh dingah sahrang bangin sangka in a lo bawh; uk a lo tum; asinain na neh hrimhrim a ṭul ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Kain in a naupa Abel hnenah, “Hramlak ah feh uhsi,” ti ah a ti. Hramlak an thlen tikah Kain in Abel cu a zon ih a thah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Kain cu Bawipa in, “Na nau Abel khui-ah so a si?” ti ah a sut. Kain in, “Ka thei lo. Ka nau kilkhawitu-ah zo in so i tuah?” ti ah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in, “Zianghrangah hivek ṭihnungza thil hi na tuah? Phuhlam duh ih a aumi aw bangin na naupa ih thisen in leilung ihsin i hun ko rero a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu-ah nang cu camsiat na si ih hi na umnak hmun ihsin dawihlo na si ding; ziangahtile na kut ih na suahmi na nau ih thisen cu kaa ang tahratih donmi vekin leilung in a hawp zo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rawl na ciin khalle leilung in zianghman a suah lo ding ih umnak inn nei loin mivakvai na si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Kain in Bawipa hnenah, “Hremnak i pekmi cu a na tuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hi ram le na hmaika in i dawihlo ih tlunah lei parah hin inn nei lo le mivakvai ka si ding ih i hmutu pohpoh in in that ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Bawipa in, “Cutin a si lo; nangmah a lo thattu cu a letsarih ih phulak a si ding,” ti ah a ti. Cuhrangah Kain cu a hmutu pohpoh ih an thah lonak dingah Bawipa in a parah hminsinnak a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Kain cu Bawipa ih hmaika in a tlan ih Eden hmuan ih nisuahnak lam Nod, timi ramah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kain le a nupi an pawl-aw ih a nupi cu nau a keng. Fapa a hring ih a hminah Enok a sak. Cule Kain cun khawpi pakhat a toh ih a fapa hmin suangin Enok a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Enok in fapa a nei ih a hminah Irad a sak; Irad ih fapa cu Mehujael a si; Mehujael ih fapa cu Methushael a si; Methushael ih fapa cu Lamek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lamek cun nupi pahnih a nei; pakhat cu Adah a si ih pakhat cu Zillah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Adah in fapa a nei ih Jabal ti ah a ko. Jabal cu cawkhal pawl le puanthlam ih a ummi pawl cithlahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A naupa cu Jubal a si ih tingrisit le phirivau tumtu pawl cithlahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Zillah in fapa a nei ih Tubal-Kain a si. Tubal-Kain cu thir le dar soser pawl cithlahtu a si. Tubal-Kain ih farnu cu Naamah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Lamek in a nupi pawl ih hnenah, “Ka nupi Adah le Zillah, i ngaihnik uh, I thawi ruangah tleirawl pakhat ka that; I tuahmawh ruangah mi ka that a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kain a thattu parah letsarih ih phuhlam a si ahcun, Kei i tuahmawhtu cu let sawmsarih let sarih in phulak a si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun Adam le a nupi cu an pawl-aw sal ih fapa pakhat an nei. “Kain in Abel a that ih a ai-ah Pathian in fapa i pe a si,” ti ah Evi in a ti ih a hminah Seth a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Seth in fapa a run nei ih Enosh ti ah an ko. A cuih thokin minung pawl in Bawipa cu a hmin ko in an biak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tanglam pawl cu Adam ih tesinfa an si. Pathian in minung a sersiam tikah amah Pathian hmuihmel kengin a sersiam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in mipa le nunau a tuah ih seemsuah an si ni ih thokin thluasuah a pek ih, “Minung,” ti ah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Adam cu kum za le sawmthum a kim tikah amah ih hmuihmel kengin fapa a nei ih a hmin ah Seth a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zariat a nung lai. Fanu le fapa dangdang tla a nei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />kum zakua le sawmthum a ti ah Adam cu a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Seth cu kum za le kum nga a ti tikah fapa Enosh a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zariat le kum sarih a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kum zakua le kum hleihnih a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Enosh cu kum sawmkua a ti tikah fapa Kenan a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zariat le kum hleinga a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kum zakua le kum nga a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kenan cu kum sawmsarih a si tikah fapa Mahalalel a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zariat le sawmli a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amah cu kum zakua le kum hra a kim ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahalalel cu kum sawmruk le kum nga a si ah fapa Jared a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zariat le sawmthum a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kum zariat sawmkua le kum nga a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jared cu kum za le sawmruk le kum hnih a si ah fapa Enok a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zariat a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kum za kua sawmruk le kum hnih a ti tikah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Enok cu kum sawmruk le kum nga ah fapa Methuselah a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Pathian thawn pawlkom aw-in kum zathum a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Enok cu kum zathum sawmruk le kum nga a nung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian thawn pawlkom-aw in a nung ih a hlota, ziangahtile Pathian in a lak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Methuselah cu kum za le sawmriat le kum sarih a si tikah fapa Lamek a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum za sarih sawmriat le kum hnih a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kum zakua sawmruk le kum khua a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun Lamek cu kum za le sawmriat le kum hnih a si ah fapa a nei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“ Bawipa ih siatserhmi leilung par hrimhrim ahhin hi fapa cu kan zonzaihnak sung ihsin in suahtu a si ding,” ti ah a ti ih a hmin ah Noah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Lamek cu kum zanga sawmkua le kum nga a nung ih faate dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kum zasarih sawmsarih le kum sarih a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cun Noah cu kum zanga a si tikah fapa pathum a nei: Shem, Ham le Jafet an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leilung pumpuluk ah milai cu an karhzai vivo ih fanu tampi tla an hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian ih fapa pawl in acuih fala pawl an mawizia an hmuh tikah an duhmi an hril ih an ṭhit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Milai hnenah ka thlarau cu kumkhua cun ka umter lo pei, ziangahtile taksa neimi an si. Atu thok ihsin kum za le kum kul hnakih tam an nung lo pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A cuih san le cuih hnu san hmanah Pathian ih fapa pawl le milai ih fanu pawl an pawl-aw ih an hrinmi faale pawl cu mikei vekih a tum zetzetmi an si. Anmah tla cu khuahlan san ih mi hminthang le mi ralṭhazet pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian cun leilung par milai hmuahhmuah cu an ṭha lozet ih an thinlung ah ruahnak siava lawnglawng a khat ti kha a hmuh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />leilung parih milai a tuah cu a sir-aw sal ih a riah a siazet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuhrangah, “Ka tuah ciami milai pohpoh, khuitawkih an um khalle ka siat thluh ding. Ramsa hmuahhmuah le vate hmuahhmuah khal, a bokvakmi tiangin ka siat thluh ding, ka rak tuah cu ka sir-aw a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Noah parah cun Bawipa cu a lung a awi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Noah ih faale pawl cu hi pawl hi an si: fapa pathum a nei ih Shem, Ham le Jafet an si. Noah cu mi ṭhazet a si ih acuih san ahcun amah pakhat lawnglawng Pathian ih lungkimmi a si. Pathian thawn a umtlangmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sikhalsehla midang hmuahhmuah cu Pathian ih mithmai ah an siavazet ih an siatnak cu khuazakip ah a zai vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Pathian in leilung cu ṭha lozet in a hmu, ziangahtile mi hmuahhmuah ṭhatlonak in an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Pathian in Noah hnenah, “Milai cu leilung par ihsin cemter dingah ka ruat zo a si. Ka siatsuah thluh ding, ziangahtile leilung hi an sualtuahnak in a khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah ih hrangah saipras thing ṭha phun in tangphawlawng tuah aw. A sungah khaan tampi tuah awla, a sunglam le a lenglam hmuahhmuah ah farthling hnih aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A cuih lawng cu pi zali sawmnga sau, pi sawmsarih pi nga kau, pi sawmli pi nga saangin tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A khuh tuah awla a khuh le a phar karlak kha zung hleiriat zuah aw. Cun dot thum in tuah awla a siir-ah sangka tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leilung parah tilik ka thlenter ding ih a nungmi hmuahhmuah a siatsuah thluh ding. Leilung parih a nungmi hmuahhmuah an thi ṭheh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nangmah thawn thukamnak ka tuah ding. Na nupi le na fapa pawl le an nupi pawl thawn lawng sungah nan lut ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An nun venak dingah ramsa tinkim in a nu le a pa, khuahkhat fingfing, lawng sungah na khum pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Vate phun tinkim sungin pahnih ciar, ramsa sungin a tum siseh a fate siseh pahnih ciar, an nun suaknak dingah lawng sungah na luhpi pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ei ṭha tirawl phunkim na khawl pei ih, nanmah le an hrangah na ret pei. Himi cu lawng sungih nan ei dingmi a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian ih thupekmi vek cekci in Noah cun a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Noah hnenah Bawipa in, “Nan sungte in lawng sungah lut uh; ziangahtile leilung mi hmuahhmuah lakah nangmah pakhat lawng ka mithmuh ah a dingmi na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Saram thiang ei ṭha phunkim in phunkhat ah khuah sarih ciar keng aw; asinain a thiang lo ramsa cu phunkhat ah a nu le a pa khuah khat ciar lawng la aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vate khal a phunkim in phunkhat ah khuah sarih ciar in keng aw. Himi pawl cu leilung ih cithlah saaltu dingah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuih hnu ni sarih ah leilung parah ni sawmli le zan sawmli sung ruah ka surter ding ih ka tuah cia a nungmi hmuahhmuah a siatsuah thluh ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Bawipa ih thupekmi vek cekci in Noah cun a tuah ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tilik a thawh tikah Noah cu kum zaruk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A nupi le a fapa pawl le an nupi pawl thawn tilik ihsin him dingah lawng sungah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ramsa le vate a thiang siseh thiang lo siseh a phunkim in a nu pakhat le a pa pakhat ciar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ih thupek vekin Noah thawn lawng sungah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni sarih hnuah leilung tlunah tilik a tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Noah kum zaruk a kim hnu thla hnihnak ni hleisarih ni ah, leilung hnuai ih tipi cu hmunkip in an put ciamco; cun van tukvirh hmuahhmuah a ong-aw ih ruah a thlet in a thle aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />cuticun leilung parah ni sawmli le zan sawmli ruah cat loin a sur thlurthlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih ni ah Noah le a nupi, a fapa pathum Shem, Ham le Jafet le an nupi pawl cu lawng sungah an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Anmah thawn hmun khatah hramlak ramsa siseh, innzuat ṭilva siseh, a vak thiammi hmuahhmuah le vate a phunphun tla an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ramsa a phunkim in, a nu le a pa ciar in, Noah thawn lawng sungah Pathian ih thupekmi vekin an lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Noah a luh ngah in Bawipa in sangka a khar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ni sawmli ti a lik hnu ah tidai a tam dutdo deuhdeuh ih an lawng cu tidai in a phuanter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tidai a thuk deuhdeuh ih tidai parah lawng cu a phuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tilik cu a thuk sinsin ih tlang saangbik pawl khal a khuh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih tlunah tidai cu tlangzim tlunah pi kul hluannga a kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leilung parih a nungmi hmuahhmuah, minung siseh, ramsa le vate siseh, cucik kharbok tiangin an thi thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leilung parih nunnak a neimi hmuahhmuah in an thi thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilung parih a vak thiammi hmuahhmuah - minung le ramsa le vate a fate bik tiangin Bawipa in a thihter thluh. Siatsuah lomi cu Noah le amah thawn lawng sungih a ummi lawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tidai cu lei parah ni za le ni sawmnga sung ṭum loin a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian cun Noah le amah thawn lawng sungih a ummi ramsa tinkim cu a thei ringring. Curuangah leilung tlunah thli a hranter ih tidai cu a kang vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leilung hnuai ih tipi ihsin a hung putmi tidai pawl le van ihsin ruah a rung surnak van tukvirh pawl cu an kharphit aw thluh. Vanruah a han ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />tidai cu a kang vivo. Ni za le sawmnga hnuah tidai a ṭum deuhdeuh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />thla sarihnak ni hleisarih ni ah, lawng cu Ararat ram ih tlangpar ah a taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tidai cu a ṭum deuh vivo ih thla hranak ni khat ni ah tlangzim pawl an lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ni sawmli hnuah Noah cun lawng ih tukvirh a ong ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tlang-ak pakhat a thlah. Tlang-ak cu a ra kir lo, leilung parih tidai a kaan thluh hlan lo a suk le a so ah a zam rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Noah in tidai a kang ngaingai maw ti thei dingah thuro pakhat a thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain tidai in leilung a khuh thluh lai thotho ruangah thuro cu futnak a hmu thei lo. Cutikah Noah cun a kut a hei suah ih thuro cu lawng sungah a lak sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ni sarih a hngah hnu ah thuro cu a thlah sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A cuih zanlam ah thuro cu a ra kir ih a hmur in Oliv thinghnah hring a rak thiar kha Noah in a hmu. Cutikah tidai a kang ngaingai zo ti ah Noah in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Noah in ni sarih a hngak sal ih thuro cu a thlah sal lala. Cuih ṭum cu a ra kir sal nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noah kum zaruk le kum khat a ti kum, thla hmaisa bik, ni khatnak ni ah leilung parih tidai cu a kang thluh. A lawngkhuh a ong ih a zoh tikah leilung a ro thluh kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thla hnihnak, ni kul hluansarih ni ah leilung cu a ro ngah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in Noah hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Na nupi, na fapa pawl le an nupi pawl thawn lawng sung ihsin suak uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ramsa hmuahhmuah, vate, innzuat sumhnam le a vak theimi hmuahhmuah tiangin hruai thluh awla, leilung parah an ci zaih in pungzai hai seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuticun Noah cu a nupi le a fapa le an nupi pawl thawn lawng sung ihsin an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun hramlak ramsa siseh, innzuat sumhnam siseh, vate le a vak theimi hmuahhmuah tiangin, anmah an phun ciar a burbur in lawng sung ihsin an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Noah cun Bawipa ih hrangah biakṭheng a don ih a thiangmi ramsa le vate tla phunkhat in pakhat ciar a lak ih meisa biakṭheng parah Pathian hrangah mei-ur thawinak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Noah ih pekmi rimthaw cu Bawipa in a theih tikah a thinlung in, “Minung ih thiltuahmi ruangah leilung cu siat ka serh nawn lo pei. Minung cu an no lai ihsin ṭhatlonak lawnglawng an ruat ti ka thei. Sikhalsehla atuih ṭum bangtuk in ziangtik hmanah a nungmi pawl ka siatsuah nawn lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leilung a him sung hmuahhmuah, Thlaici tuh caan le rawl lak caan a um ding; Khawsik le khuahlum, fur le ṭhal caan a um ding; Sun le zan a um ding ih, A cem nawn lo pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Pathian in Noah le a fapa pawl cu a thluasuah ih an hnenah, “Fa tampi nei in pungzai uhla, leilung khuazakip ah nan tesinfa pawl khat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lei parih a um ramsa hmuahhmuah, vate le nga pawl, lei parih a vak theimi ramsa fatebik tiangin an lo ṭih ding. Na kuthnuai ah ret thluh an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule ramsa a nungmi hmuahhmuah le hanghnah hangrah pawl na ei ding; na rawl hrangah ka lo pe a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain a sa sungih a thi a um laiah cun na ei lo pei, ziangahtile thi cu nunnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun mi a thattu cu thah a si ve ding. Mi a siatsuahtu ramsa cu siatsuah a si ve ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi a thattu cu Mi kutin a thi ve ding. Ziangahtile milai cu Pathian in amah bangin a tuahmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule fa tampi nan nei ding ih nan tesinfa pawl cu leitlun khuazakip ah an khat ding ih an karhzai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Pathian in Noah le a fapa pawl hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Atu-ah thu ka lo kam; nanmah le nan tesinfa pawl hnenah siseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nanmah thawn lawng sung ihsin a suakmi ramsa hmuahhmuah, vate le innzuat ṭilva le hramlak ramsa zate hnenah siseh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />thukamnak ka tuah: ziangtik hmanah leilung parih nunnak a neimi hmuahhmuah tilik in a siatsuah nawn lo pei. Tilik in leilung cu a siatsuah nawn lo pei, tiin ka lo kam,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule Pathian in, “Nangmah le na hnenih a ummi ramsa hmuahhmuah hnenih kumkhua daih ka thukammi hminsinnak ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mero lakah vangro ka ret, Ka thukammi theihternak ah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lei parih mero a zaam tinte in, Mero parah vangro nan hmu ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Leilung ih nunnak a neimi hmuahhmuah cu tilik ih siatsuah nawn lo dingin nangmah le ramsa pawl hmuahhmuah hnenih ka thukam cu ka ciing ringring ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keimah le leilung parih a nungmi hmuahhmuah karlakih ka thukammi cu mero lakih vangro a langtinte in ka ciing ringring ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Noah hnenah Pathian in, “Himi cu leilung par nunnak a neimi hmuahhmuah hnenih thu ka kammi hminsinnak a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lawng sung ihsin a suakmi Noah ih fapa pawl cu Shem, Ham le Jafet an si. (Ham cu Kanaan ih pa a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi Noah ih fapa pathum cu leilung milai hmuahhmuah cithlahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Noah cu lothlo a si ih hmaisa bik sabit hmuan tuahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Voikhat cu sabit a in hnuah a ri ih lawngfangkheh in a thlam sungah a it.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cumi cu Kanaan ih pa Ham in a hmuh tikah a unau an pahnih in a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Shem le Jafet cun puan an lak ih an liang dungah zaar tahratin an pa lawngte ih a ummi zoh ngam lo ah dungsip in thlam sungah an pan ih an pa cu an puan kenmi in an vung khuh. Kaa dang an hoi ruangah an pa lawngfangkheh ih a um cu an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Noah cu a ritnak in a fim sal ih a fapa nauta bik in a parih a tuahmi a theih tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />“Kanaan cu camsiatmi siseh, A unau pawl ih sal ah cang seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Shem ih Pathian cu thangṭhat si ko seh, Kanaan cu Shem ih salah cang seh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Pathian in Jafet cu ṭhangso pungzaiter seh, A tefa pawl cu Shem ih milai pawl thawn umtlang hai seh; Kanaan cu Jafet ih sal siseh!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tilik hnuah Noah cu kum zathum le sawmnga a nung ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />kum zakua le sawmnga a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tilik a tlun hnu, Noah ih fapa Shem, Ham le Jafet tla-ih hrinmi tefa pawl cu a hnuailam vekin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jafet ih fapa pawl cu Gomer, Magog, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Meshek le Tiras tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gomer ih fapa pawl cu Ashkenaz, Rifath le Togarmah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Javan ih fapa pawl cu Elishah, Tarshish, Kit mi le Dodan mi pawl tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anmah cu tipikap le tikulh parih a ummi miphun pawl cithlahtu an si. Jafet ih tesinfa an si ih an hrin ciar in anmah ih ṭong ciar hmangin ram dangdang ah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Ham ih fapa pawl cu Kush, Izipt, Libia le Kanaan an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kush ih fapa pawl cu Seba, Havilah, Sabtah, Raamah le Sabteka an si. Raamah ih fapa cu Sheba le Dedan tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kush ih fapa pakhat cu Nimrod a si ih amah cu leilung tlunah a hmaisa bik minehtu hminthang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipa ih bomnak in amah cu sakap hminthang ah a cang ih, curuangah mi in, “Nimrod bangin Bawipa in sakap hminthang ah lo tuah seh,” an ti ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimrod ih a ukmi ram hmaisa bik pawl cu Babilonia ram sungih a ummi Babilon, Erek le Akkad ram thum tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih ram ihsin Assiria ramah a feh ih Nineveh, Rehoboth-Ir, Kalah le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nineveh le Kalah khawpi karlakih a ummi Reson timi khawpi tla a toh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izipt cu Lidia mi, Anam mi, Lehab mi, Naftuh mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Patrus mi, Kasluh mi le Kaftor mi pawl ih pa a si. Filistin mi pawl cu Kaftor ih cithlahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Kanaan cu a fapa upa bik Sidon le a nau Heth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />cuih hnuah Jebus mi, Amor mi, Girgash mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hiv mi le Arka mi, Sin mi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Arvad mi, Zemar mi le Hamath mi pawl ih pa a si. Cuih hnuah Kanaan ih tefa pawl cu an karhzai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />an ram cu Gerar lamah Sidon in Gaza tiang, cun Sadom, Gomorrah, Admah le Zeboiim lamah Lasha tiang a kau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A tlunih miphun pawl hi Ham ih tesinfa pawl an si ih ram dangdang ah anmah an hrin ciar in anmah ih an ṭong ciar hmangin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jafet ih u-pa Shem cu faate dang tla a nei ih Hebru mi pawl hmuahhmuah ih cithlahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Shem ih fapa pawl cu Elam, Asshur, Arpakshad, Lud le Aram an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aram ih fapa pawl cu Uz, Hul, Gether le Mash an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Arpakshad cu Shelah ih pa a si ih Shelah cu Eber ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cun Eber in fapa pahnih a nei. Pakhat cu Peleg ti ah an ko, ziangahtile Peleg san laiah leilungih milai pawl cu an ṭhen-aw thluh. Cule a naupa ih hmin cu Joktan a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Joktan ih tesinfa pawl cu Almodad, Shelef, Hazarmaveth, Jerah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hadoram, Uzal, Diklah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Obal, Abimael, Sheba,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ofir, Havilah le Jobab an si. Hi pawl hi an zatein Joktan ih tesinfa an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An umnak ram cu Mesha ihsin Sefar lamah nisuahnak lamih tlangram tiang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A tlunih miphun pawl cu Shem ih tesinfa pawl an si ih ram dangdang ah anmah an hrin ciar in anmah ih ṭong ciar hmangin an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A tlunih hrin le hnam pawl cu Noah ih tesinfa an si ih anmah ih an hrin ciar in miphun tampi ah an cang. Leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah cu tilik hnu Noah fapa pawl ih cithlahmi an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hlanah cun leilung tlun mi hmuahhmuah in ṭong phunkhat lawng an nei ih ṭongfang bangrep an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nisuahnak lamah an vai ih Babilonia nelrawn an thleng ih cutawkah khua an to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah, “Rahnik uh, phahlei tuah in meisa ah rawh uhsi,” ti ah pakhat le pakhat an ti-aw. Cutiin inn saknak ah tlakrawh an nei ih a erhnak ah ṭhung an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuṭheh in, “Ra uh; Kan hrangah khawpi kan tuah pei ih van dai in lungdawl kan tuah pei. Kanmah ih hrangah hmin nei ve seh; cule leilung khuazakip ah darhdai loin kan um ding a si,” ti ah an ti-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah milai ih an tuahmi khawpi le lungdawl zoh dingah Bawipa cu a rung ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Zohhnik uh, hi pawl hi an zatein miphun phunkhat an si ih ṭong pakhat an hmang. An tuahmi hi thil tuah an tummi a hramthawhnak lawng a si lai. A rei hlanah tuah an duhmi hmuahhmuah an tuahsuak thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah kan vung feh pei ih pakhat le pakhat an aan ciing-aw lo dingin an ṭong kan cokrawi thluh pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutiin Bawipa in milai pawl cu leilung khuazakip ah a ṭhekdarh thluh ih khawpi cu an sak ṭheh suak lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A cuih khawpi cu Babel ti ah an ti, ziangahtile cutawkah milai ih ṭong cu Bawipa in a cokrawi sak thluh ih, leilung tlun khuazakip ah a ṭhekdarh thluh hai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Shem ih tesinfa cu a hnuailam pawl hi an si. Tilik a tlun hnu kum hnih ah, Shem cu kum zakhat a ti ih, fapa pakhat Arpakshad a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zanga a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang khal a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arpakshad cu kum sawmthum le kum nga a si tikah fapa Shelah a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zali le kum thum a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Shelah cu kum sawmthum a kim tikah fapa Eber a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zali le kum thum a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Eber cu kum sawmthum le kum li a si tikah fapa Peleg a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zali le sawmthum a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Peleg cu kum sawmthum a si tikah fapa Reu a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zahnih le kum kua a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Reu cu kum sawmthum le kum hnih a si tikah fapa Serug a nei
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zahnih le kum sarih a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Serug cu kum sawmthum a si tikah fapa Nahor a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum zahnih a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nahor cu kum kul hluankua a si tikah fapa Terah a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuih hnuah kum za le hleikua a nung ih fapa dang le fanu dang tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Terah cu kum sawmsarih a si tikah fapa pathum Abram, Nahor le Haran a nei hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Terah ih tesinfa pawl cu Abram, Nahor le Haran an si. Haran cu Lot ih pa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Haran cu a pa Terah a nun laiah Khaldea ram, a suahnak Ur khua ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Abram in Sarai a ṭhit ih Nahor in Haran ih fanu Milkah a ṭhit. Haran cu Iskah ih pa khal a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sarai cu faate a nei lo, ziangahtile nucing a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Terah cun a fapa Abram le a fasuan, Haran ih fa, Lot le Abram ih nupi Sarai cu a lak hai ih Kanaan ram feh dingah Khaldea ram Ur khua cun a pok. Asinain Haran khua tiang an feh ih cutawkah cun umhmun an khuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Terah cu kum zahnih le kum nga a si tikah Haran khua ahcun a thita.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in Abram hnenah, “Na ram, na miphun le na pa ih inn taanta awla ka lo hmuh dingmi ramah feh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tefa tampi ka lo pe ding ih miphun tumpi-ah an cang ding. Ka lo thlawsuah ding ih na hmin ka thanter ding; cutiin thlawsuah mi na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lo thluasuahtu cu ka thlawsuah ve ding, Asinain siat a lo camtu cu ka camsia ve ding; Nangmah ka lo thlawsuah vekin, Leitlun mi hmuahhmuah in thlawsuah in dil ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abram cu kum sawmsarih le kum nga a ti tikah, Bawipa ih a fial vekin, Haran khua cun a suak. Lot khal in a thlun ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abram cu a nupi Sarai le a nau ih fapa Lot le Haran khua ih an neihmi sal pawl le an thil neih hmuahhmuah thawn Kanaan ramah cun an feh. Kanaan ram an thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram cu a feh vivo ih hmun thianghlim Shekhem khua Moreh hmunih sasua kung ah a va thleng. Cuih caanah Kanaan mi pawl acuih ramah an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa cu Abram hnenah a lang ih, “Na tesinfa hnenih ka pek dingmi ram cu hi ram hi a si,” ti ah a ti. Cule cutawkah Abram in a hnenih a langmi Bawipa hrangah biakṭheng a don.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Abram cu thlanglam ah, Bethel khua ihsin nisuahnak lam tlangpar ram ah a ṭhawn ih nitlaknak lamah Bethel, nisuahnak lamah Ai khua, cuih karlakah riahbuk a sak. Cutawk khalah cun biakṭheng a don ih Bawipa cu a biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun thlanglam Negev ram lamah riahbuk pakhat hnu pakhat sak in a ṭhawn vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A cuih ramah nasazetin paam a tlung ih rawl ei ding a um lo ruangah Abram cu Izipt ramah caan tawite sung um dingin a vung feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Izipt ramri a thlen zik tikah a nupi Sarai hnenah, “Nang hi nunau hmelṭha na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Izipt mi pawl ih an lo hmuh tikah Abram nupi a si, an ti ding ih nangmah co duh ah keimah riangri in that pang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />An lo sut asile a farnu ka si na ti pei. Cuticun nangmah ih ruangah ka luat ding ih in zohṭha ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Izipt ramsung an vung lut tikah Izipt mi pawl cun, “Sarai cu mimawi a si,” an ti ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Bawi pawl in an hmuh ve tikah a mawizia cu an siangpahrang hnenah an va sim ih siangpahrang inn ah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sarai ruangah Izipt siangpahrang in Abram cu ṭhazet in a zoh ih tuu le me pawl, caw le laak le kalauk pawl a ruun a ruun in a ṭhen ih sal tampi tiangin a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Sarai cu siangpahrang ih inn a thlen ruangah Bawipa in siangpahrang le a innsungih a ummi hmuahhmuah parah ṭihnungza natnak a tlunter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Faro siangpahrang in Abram cu a ko ih, “Ziang hrangah hi bangtuk in i tuah? Ziangah so ka nupi a si, ti ah fiangtein i sim lo?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ziangruangah ka farnu a si ti ah na ti? Ka farnu a si na ti ruangah a si nupi ih ka lak. Atu zamrangin na nupi hi lak awla suak uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Faro in a kuthnuai mi hnenah thu a pek ih Abram cu a nupi Sarai le an neihmi hmuahhmuah tla thawn Izipt ram ihsin an dawi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutiin Izipt ram in Abram cu a suak ih saklam ram Negev lamah a nupi le a neihmi hmuahhmuah thawn an feh. A hnenah Lot khal a tel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abram cu milianzet a si ih tuu, me, caw pawl tampi a nei ih sui le ngun khal a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Negev in a pok ih riahbuk pakhat hnu pakhat a ṭhawn vivo ih, hmaisa bikih riahbuk a saknak Bethel le Ai karlakih ram lamah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmaisaih biakṭheng a tuahnak hmun a thlen tikah Bawipa ih a hmin a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Abram thawn a feh ve mi Lot khal in tuu le me le caw pawl tampi a nei ih hnenum tla a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abram le Lot cu ṭilva tampi an nei veve ih rannung ei ding hrampi khopkham a um lo ruangah hmunkhat ah an umtlang thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah an ṭilva kiltu pawl karlakah napi ih tawh awknak a suak. Culai ahcun Kanaan mi le Periz mi pawl cuih ramah an um lai hrih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Abram in Lot hnenah, “Sungkhat kan si ih na minung pawl le ka minung pawl hi to-aw rero ding an si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan ṭhen-aw sawn pei. Na duhmi ram hril awla cutawkah feh aw. Kei hmun dangah ka feh pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah Lot cu khua a cuan ih, Bawipa ih hmuan le Izipt ram vek a si mi Jordan tiva kap phairawn cu Zoar tiang tidai tamzet ih ngahmi ramṭha a si kha a hmu. Culai ahcun Sodom le Gomorrah pawl cu Bawipa in a siatter hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lot cun amah ih hrangah Jordan tiva kap phairawn zatein a hril ih nisuahnak lamah a cer. Cuticun an ṭhen-awta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abram cu Kanaan ramah cun a um ih Lot cu phairawn ih khawpi lakah a um. Sodom khua kiangah buk a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sodom khuasung mi cu miṭha lozet an si ih Bawipa hmaiah an sual ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lot ih a tlansan hnu cun Abram hnenah Bawipa in, “Na umnak hmun ihsin sak le thlang, nisuah le nitlak, khuazakip hi ṭhatein zohhnik.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na hmuhmi ram hmuahhmuah hi nangmah le na tesinfa hnenah ka lo pe ding ih kumkhua in nan ram a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tesinfa tampi ka lo pe ding ih leilung parih leidip siar cawk lo an si bangin na tesinfa khal siar cawk lo an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutiin hi ram hi a tung a vang in haal thluh aw; ziangahtile a zatein ka lo pe thluh ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Curuangah Abram cu a riahbuk a ṭhawn ih Hebron khua Mamre sasua kung kiangah hmun a khuar. Cutawkah Bawipa hrangah biakṭheng a don.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih caanah siangpahrang pali: Babilonia siangpahrang Amrafel, Ellasar siangpahrang Ariok, Elam siangpahrang Khedorlaomer le Goiim siangpahrang Tidal pawl in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a dang siangpahrang panga: Sodom siangpahrang Bera, Gomorrah siangpahrang Birsha, Admah siangpahrang Shinab, Zeboiim siangpahrang Shemeber le Bela (a si lole Zoar) siangpahrang pawl tla an do.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atuih Rili Thi timi Siddim nelrawn ah khin cuih siangpahrang panga cu an kom-aw ih an ṭang tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anmah cu kum hleihnih sung Khedorlaomer in a rak uk zo ih a kum hleithumnak ah amah do dingin ral a thotu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kum hleilinak ah Khedorlaomer le a ṭanpi pawl cun an ralkap zate thawn an do ciamco ih Ashteroth Karnaim ah Refaim an neh, Ham ah Zuzim an neh, Kiriathaim hmunrawn ah Emim an neh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />vunnel rawn kiangih ummi Elparan tiang, Seirih tlang parah Hor mi pawl tla an neh thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun dunglamah an kir ih Kadesh (Kadesh a si lole Enmishpat) an thlen tikah Amalek mi pawl ih ram hmuahhmuah an hun lak phah ih Hazazon Tamar ih ummi Amor mi khal an neh thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Sodom, Gomorrah, Admah, Zeboiim le Bela khua ih siangpahrang pawl cun an ralkap neihmi hmuahhmuah an khawm ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Elam siangpahrang Khedorlaomer, Goiim siangpahrang Tidal, Babilonia siangpahrang Amrafel le Ellasar siangpahrang Ariok pawl thawn Siddim nelrawn ah siangpahrang panga le siangpahrang pali an do-aw ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siddim nelrawn cu zinan suahnak khur in a khat ih, Sodom le Gomorrah siangpahrang pawl cu an raldonak in an tlan tikah acuih khur sungah an tla ciamco. A dang pathum pawl cu tlang parah an tlan hlo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Siangpahrang pali pawl cun Sodom le Gomorrah khuasungih a ummi thil hmuahhmuah, an ei ding rawl tiangin an lak ih an tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sodom khuasungih a ummi Lot khal a neihmi hmuahhmuah thawn an kai ih an hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sikhalsehla raltlan pa pakhat cu Hebru mi Abram hnenah a ra ih Lot an kaihnak thu a ra sim. Abram cu Amor mi Mamre ih sasua kung kiangah a um. Mamre ih unau pawl cu Eshkol le Aner an si ih an pathum in Abram ṭantu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Abram cun a sungkhat pa an kaihnak thu a theih tikah a milai pawl a kokhawm ih pacang hlir zathum le hleiriat an pok ih ral pawl cu Dan tiang an dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutawk hmunah Abram milai pawl cu bu hnih ah an ṭhen-aw ih zanah an ral pawl cu an do ih an neh. An ral pawl cu Damaskas khua saklam ih a ummi Hobah tiang an hun dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A sungkhat pa Lot le Lot ih neihmi hmuahhmuah le nunau pawl le ral kaihmi dangdang thawn a long thluh ih a kirpi sal thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abram cu Khedorlaomer le siangpahrang dang pawl a va nehnak ihsin a kir tikah Sodom siangpahrang cun Shaveh phairawn (Siangpahrang Phairawn ti khalih timi) in a rak hmuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Salem siangpahrang Melkhizedek khal in sang le sabitti a keng ih Abram cu a hmuak ve. Melkhizedek cu Cungnungbik Pathian ih puithiam khal a si ih Abram cu thluasuahnak hiti in a pek:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Cungnungbik Pathian, Lei le van tuahtu in, Abram cu thlawsuah hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ral pawl parih nehnak a lo petu, Cungnungbik Pathian cu thangṭhat in um seh,” ti ah a ti. Cule Abram in ralkut ihsin a lakmi hmuahhmuah sungih ṭhenhra ih ṭhenkhat Melkhizedek hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Sodom siangpahrang in Abram hnenah, “Na lakmi thil hmuahhmuah cu nangmah in co aw; asinain minung pawl cu keimah i pe sal hram aw,” ti ah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain Abram in, “Van le leilung Tuahtu Cungnungbik Pathian Bawipa ih hmaiah baan phar in thu ka kam-aw:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na ta a si mi hmuahhmuah pat-hlum le kedamhri ih thokin ziangthil hman ka la lo ding. Curuangah ‘Abram a liantertu cu keimah ka si,’ na ti thei dah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka hrangah cun zianghman ka la lo pei. Ka milai pawl ih an ei an in ciami le, i ṭanpitu pawl ih covo lawnglawng ka saang ding; cule Ener, Eshkol le Mamre khal in an covo an la ve ding,” ti ah Sodom siangpahrang hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Abram hnenah Bawipa a lang ih, “Abram, na thinphang hlah; Keimah cu a lo humtu phaw ka si. Na hnenih ka laksawng cu a uakzet ding,” ti ah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Abram in, “Maw Pathian Bawipa, fa le ka nei lo. Ka hnenih na laksawng cu ziangso a si ding? Ka rocotu cu Damaskas khua ih Eliezer lawng a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fa pakhatte hman i pe lo ih, curuangah ka ro cu ka salpa pakhat in a co a ṭul ko,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Abram hnenah, “Hi na salpa hi na rocotu a si lo ding; na rocotu cu nangmah ih fapa ngaingai a si ding,” ti ah a sim sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa in Abram cu lengah a suahpi ih, “Van khi zoh awla arsi pawl khi na siar thei asile siar hnik; khi arsi zat in na tesinfa pawl cu an tam ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Abram in Bawipa cu a zum ih acuih zumnak cu Bawipa in dingnakah a co sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in Abram hnenah, “Keimah cu Bawipa ka si. Hi ram hi na ta siter dingah Khaldea ram Ur khua ihsin ka lo ṭhawnter a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Abram in, “Maw Pathian, ka Bawipa ziangtinso ka ta a si ti ka theih ding?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in, “Ka hnenah kum thum kim cawla, kum thum kim mela, kum thum kim tuucang, thuro pakhat le laileng pakhat rak keng aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abram in Pathian hnenah a zatein a rak keng ih an laifang ciar in phel hnih ah a phel ih phel khat cu a dang phel khat hmaiah artlang in tlar hnih ah a ret; vatesa cu a phel lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Langta pawl in sa cu an rung tlan naón Abram in a rak dawi hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zanlam ni a tlak cuahco tikah Abram cu a itthat. Cutikah a hnenah ṭihnung tuksumza khuathim a rung thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bawipa in a hnenah, “Na tesinfa pawl cu ramdang ah mivai an si ding. Cuih ramah cun sal an si ding ih kum zali sung hremmi an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain na tesinfa a tisiattu ram cu ka hrem ding; thilri tampi thawn cutawk cun an suak leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang cu tlamtling in tarkuun tiang na nung ding ih thinlung thlangamte in na thi ding; cule phum na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tesinfa pawl cu san li hnuah hi ramah an rakir sal ding; ziangahtile hi tawkih Amor mi pawl hi miṭha lozet ah an cang ding ih hremnak an tuar tik lawngah hi ram ihsin ka dawi leh hai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun ni a tlak ih khua a thim tikah, hmakhatte-ah a khu ih a alh hluahhlo mi beel le a alh hluahhlo mi meifar an lang ih sa tlar hnih ih retmi karlak ihsin an lan zuahzo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A cuih ni ah Bawipa in Abram hnenah thukamnak a tuah ih, “Hi ram hmuahhmuah hi na tesinfa pawl hnenah ka pe ding ti ah ka lo kam a si. Izipt ramri ih tiva ihsin Eufrates vapi tiang a si ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />cun Ken ram, Keniz ram, Kadmon ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hit ram, Periz ram, Refaim ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amor ram, Kanaan ram, Girgash ram le Jebus ram pawl tla an tel ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cule Abram nupi Sarai cun fa pakhat hman a nei lo. Asinain Sarai in Izipt mi Hagar timi salnu a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarai in Abram hnenah, “Zohhnik, Bawipa in fa i neihter duh lo hi! Ziangah so ka salnu thawn nan ittlang ko lo? Anih cun ka hrangah faate a nei thei men ding,” ti ah a ti. Cule Abram in Sarai ih thu cu a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Curuangah Sarai in a salnu, Izipt nunau Hagar cu Abram ih nupi dingah a pek. Kanaan ramah Abram kum hra a um hnuah hi thil hi a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Abram le Hagar cu an pawl-aw ih Hagar cu fa a vun. Hagar in fa a vun ti a theih awk tikah a puarthau ih Sarai cu a hmuhsuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Sarai cun Abram hnenah, “Hagar in hiti ih i hmuhsuam hi nangmah ih mawh a si. Ka salnu cu keimah in ka lo pe. Asinain fa a vun ti a theih awk vete in i hmuhsuam ciamco. Bawipa in nang maw kei so, zo a dik deuh ti thu in ṭhen hram seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Abram cun, “Hagar cu na salnu a si; nangmah in na uk; na duhduh in tuah aw,” ti ah Sarai hnenah a ti. Cutikah Sarai in Hagar cu a tuahsiat ih Hagar cu a tlan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutiin Hagar cu Shur lamah a tlan ih ramṭhing lakih cerhti kiangah Bawipa ih vancungmi in a tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vancungmi in a hnenah, “Sarai ih salnu Hagar, khui inso na rat ih khui ah so na feh zik?” ti ah a sut. Hagar in, “Ka bawinu Sarai hnen ihsin ka tlan,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancungmi in, “Sarai hnenah kirsal awla a kut hnuai ah va um aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Zohman ih siar cawk lo, Tesinfa tampi ka lo pe ding;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Fapa na nei ding ih, A hminah Ishmael na sak ding; Ziangahtile Bawipa in na zonzaihnak a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sinan na fapa cu, Laak hee vek a si ding. Mikip a raal ding ih, Mikip in an raal ve ding. Sungkhat thawn hman an umtlang lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Hagar in, “Pathian cu hitawk ah hin ka tong ngaingai ih ka nung lai maw si?” ti ah amah le amah a ti-aw. Cule a hnenah ra in a ṭongtu Bawipa cu a hminah, “El-roi,” ti ah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah Kadesh le Bered karlakih tikhur cu mi hmuahhmuah in, “Beer-lahai-roi,” ti ah an ko ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Hagar in Abram fapa cu a hring ih a hminah amah Abram in Ishmael ti ah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Abram cu Hagar in fapa a hrin tikah kum sawmriat le kum ruk a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abram cu kum sawmkua le kum kua a si tikah Bawipa a hnenah a lang ih, “Keimah cu Ziangkimtithei Pathian ka si. Na nunsung hmuahhmuah ka thu thlun awla soisel lomi si aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thukam na hnenah ka tuah ding ih tesinfa tampi ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Abram cu a hmai leilung dai in a kuun ih Pathian in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nangmah thawn ka fekter dingmi ka thukam cu hihi a si: Leilung tlun miphun tampi cithlahtu na si ding, ti ah ka lo kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na hmin hi Abram si nawn loin, Abraham a si thlang ding; ziangahtile miphun tampiih pa ah ka lo tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tesinfa tampi ka lo pe ding ih a hrekkhat cu siangpahrang tla an si ding. Tesinfa tampi na nei ding ih miphun tampi ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ka thukam cu ka fekter ding ih nangmah le na tesinfa pawl hnenah, sankhat hnu sankhat, kumkhua daih thukamnak a si ding. Keimah cu na Pathian ka si ding ih na tesinfa pawl ih Pathian khal ka si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atu na umnak ram, mikhual na sinak ram hi nangmah le na tesinfa hnenah ka lo pe ding. Kanaan ram hmuahhmuah hi kumkhua in nan ta a si ding ih keimah cu nan Pathian ka si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Pathian in Abraham hnenah, “Nangmah khal in ka thukam cu na fekter pei ih na thlun pei; na tesinfa pawl khal in sankhat hnu sankhat an thlun ringring pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangmah le na tesinfa pawl in ka thukam nan fekternak dingah mipa hmuahhmuah in serh nan tan thluh pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Atu thokin mipa pohpoh cu ni riat an ti ni ah an serh nan tan ding; nan innsung suak sal siseh, ramdang ih nan leimi sal siseh, nan tan thluh ding. Himi cu keimah le nanmah karlakih thukamnak langtertu a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Serhtan an si ṭheh ding; himi cu kumkhua in nan hnenih ka thukamnak a langnak dingah nan taksa parih hminsinnak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Serhtan lomi mipa cu ka thukam a thlun lo ruangah a miphun sung ihsin hlon a si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Pathian in Abraham hnenah, “Na nupi hi Sarai ti ah na ko nawn lo pei; atu thokin a hmin cu Sarah a si zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sarah cu ka thlawsuah ding ih amah sung ihsin fapa ka lo pe ding. Ka thlawsuah pei ih miphun tampiih nu ah a cang ding. A tesinfa pawl sungin siangpahrang tampi an suak ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Abraham cu a hmai leilung dai in a kuun ih a hni; cule thu a ruat ih, “Milai in kum zakhat ti hnuah fa a nei thei pei maw? Kum sawmkua a ti hnuah hin Sarah in fa a nei thei ngaingai pei maw?” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Abraham in Pathian hnenah, “Ishmael tal cu na hmaiah mithmai ṭha ngah hram seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in, “Abraham, cutiin a si lo. Na nupi Sarah hrimhrim in fapa a lo hrin ding ih a hminah Isaak ti ah na ko ding. Amah hnenah siseh, a tesinfa pawl hnenah siseh, ka thukam cu ka fekter ding. Ziangahtile kumkhua daih thukamnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang in Ishmael thu ah i dil ih ka thei zo; kei in ka tuah dingmi cu hiti in a si: Ishmael cu ka thlawsuah ding ih tefa tampi le tesinfa tampi ka pe ding. Amah cu siangpahrang hleihnih ih pa ah a cang ding. A tesinfa pawl cu miphun tumzet ah ka canter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hmaikum tu tikcu ah Sarah ih hrin dingmi na fapa Isaak hnenah ka thukam ka hngetter ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Abraham hnenih thusim a ṭheh tikah Pathian cun a fehsan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A cuih sun rori ah Pathian ih a simta vekin Abraham cun a fapa Ishmael le a sal hmuahhmuah, innsuak sal siseh, a leimi sal siseh, a innsungih a ummi mipa pohpoh, an serh a tan ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Abraham cu serh a tan tikah kum sawmkua le kum kua a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A fapa Ishmael cu kum hleithum a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuih ni ah an pa fa, le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />an innsungih a ummi sal hmuahhmuah thawn serhtan tlang an si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawipa cu Mamre sasua kung hmunih a ummi Abraham hnenah a rung lang. Abraham cu a riahbuk sangka ah, sun niling laifangah a to ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />a hun zoh tikah veikhatte-ah milai pathum an rung din kha a hmu. A hmuh vete in va hmuak dingah a sangka cun a va tlan. A hmai leilung dai in a bok ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka bawipa, in zaangfah thei ahcun ka inn ah cawl phah loin in taan siang hlah uh. Nan salpa ka si ih nan duh vekih a lo riantu ding ka si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nan ke kholhnak dingah tidai ka rak kengter pei ih hi thingkung hnuai ah nan cawlta hrih pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rawl ka rak keng pei ih nan lamzin fehnak ah thazaang nan nei deuh ding. Ka inn nan ra thleng zo ih nanmah tuamhlawmtu ding ka si ko,” ti ah a ti. Annih in, “A ṭha, na sim vekin tuah aw,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Abraham cu a riahbuk sungah zamrangin a feh ih Sarah hnenah, “Na sangvut lakih a ṭha bikmi tah thum in suak awla, zamrangin pawnghmuk tuah aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun a cawrual lakah a va tlan ih caw note pakhat, a thau ih a sathawt laifang a si mi a va hruai ih a hnenum hnenah zamrangin suan dingah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Abraham cun cawhnawi thur, cawhnawi le an suanmi cawsa cu a lak ih a mikhual pawl ih hmaiah ei dingah a hun. Annih in an ei; cule Abraham cun thing hnuai ah ding tahratin a kil hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule a mikhual pawl in, “Na nupi Sarah khuiah a si?” ti ah an sut. “Riahbuk sungah a um ko,” ti ah a let.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mikhual pakhat in, “Na nupi Sarah in hmai kum atuih caanah fapa a nei ding; cutikah ka ra sal ding,” ti ah thu a tiam. Sarah in an mikhual pa ih dunglam an riahbuk sangka ihsin a thusim mi cu a rak ngai ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham le Sarah cu an tarzet thlang ih Sarah cu nunau daan a nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Curuangah Sarah in, “Kei cu ka upa tuk zo, mipa thawn pawl-aw in nomnak ka nei ngai pei maw? Cuih tlunah ka pasal le a tar tuk ve zo,” ti ah hni phah in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Bawipa in Abraham hnenah, “Ziangah Sarah cu hni phah in, ‘Ka tar zo hnuah hin fa ka nei thei ngaingai pei maw?’ a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bawipa hrangah a harmi a um maw si? Hmaikum a tikcu a kim tikah ka ra sal ding ih Sarah in fapa a nei tengteng ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Sarah cu a thin a phang ih, “Ka hni hrimhrim lo,” ti ah a phat. Bawipa in, “Phat duh hlah, na hni ko,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun a mikhual pawl cu an tho ih Sodom khua an vun hmuh theinak hmun ah an feh. Abraham cun a hei thlah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Thil ka tuah dingmi hi Abraham hnen ihsin ka thup thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A tesinfa pawl cu miphun tum le miphun cak ah an cangṭheh ding ih amah ka thlawsuah zo vekin leilung tlun miphun hmuahhmuah in thlawsuah in dil ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A dikmi le a dingmi tuah tahratin ka thupekmi pawl an thlun theinak dingah a fapa pawl le a sungkhat pawl zirhsuak dingin amah cu ka hril zo a si. Cuticun ka tiamkam ciami hmuahhmuah cu a parah ka kimter thluh ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Bawipa in, “Sodom le Gomorrah an mawhthluknak pawl hi a nasa ngaingai ih an sualnak hi a tum ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka vung feh pei ih an mawhnak ka theihmi hi ka vung zingzoi pei ih thufiang ka thei ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Abraham ih mikhual pahnih cu Sodom khua lamah cun an feh; asinain Bawipa cu Abraham hnenah a taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Abraham in Bawipa cu a hei naih ih, “Mi ṭha lomi lakah mi ṭha khal na siatsuah cih thluh thotho ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sodom khawsung ah mi ṭha sawmnga an um tibang sehla, a khawpi zatein maw na siatsuah ko ding? Mi ṭha sawmnga him dingah hi khua hi na zuah lo ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi ṭha lomi thawn hmun khatah mi ṭhami tla cu na that ko ding maw? A cangthei lo, na ti dah lo ding. Cutiih na tuah ahcun a mawhmi bangtuk in a dikmi khal daan peknak an tuar ve ding maw? Cucu a cangthei lomi a si. Leilung tlun hmuahhmuah ih thuṭhentu cun dingthluk lairelnak thawn thu a ṭhen lo ding maw si?” ti ah Abraham in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in, “Sodom khuasungah mi ṭha sawmnga an um a si ahcun acuih sawmnga ruangah a khuapumin ka zuah ko ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham in, “Maw Bawipa, kei cu leidip le vutcam lawng ka si ih na hnenah zianghman sim theinak ka nei lo. A ral a va ṭha ve ti ah i ti siang hram hlah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thuṭhimnak ah Sodom khawsungah mi ṭha sawmnga si loin sawmli le panga um hai sehla, minung panga sam ruangah hi khawpi hi na siatsuah thotho pei maw?” ti ah a ti. Bawipa in, “Mi ṭha sawmli le panga an um ahcun ka siatsuah lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Abraham in, “Sawmli lawng um hai sehla teh,” ti ah a ti sal. Bawipa in, “Sawmli an um ahcun ka siatsuah lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abraham in, “ Bawipa , na thinheng hram hlah aw, ka lo sut hrih ko pei; sawmthum lawng um hai sehla ziangtin a si pei?” ti ah a sut lala. Bawipa in, “Sawmthum an um a si ahcun ka siatsuah lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Abraham in, “Ka lo sut ngam vivonak hi, Bawipa , i ngaithiam hram aw; thuṭhimnak ah kul lawng um hai sehla ziangtin a si pei?” ti ah a sut lala. Bawipa in, “A ṭhami kul an um ahcun hi khawpi ka siatsuah lo ding,” ti ah a ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule Abraham in, “ Bawipa , na thin heng hram hlah aw, veikhatte in ka lo sut hrih ko pei: pahra lawng um hai sehla teh, ziangtin a si pei?” ti ah a sut. Bawipa in, “Pahra an um taktak ahcun ka siatsuah lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Abraham in cutiih thu a suh hnuah Bawipa cu a fehhlo ih Abraham cu a inn ah a tlung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zanlam nitla zawng ah vancungmi pahnih Sodom khua an thlen tikah Lot cu minung an ton awk ṭheunak khuasuah ah a rak to. Lot in vancungmi pahnih a hmuh tikah hmuak dingin a va feh. Leilung dai in a kuun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka bawipale uh, in zaangfah asile ka inn ah ra riak hram uh. Ka inn ah ra riak uhla nan ke tla ra kholh uh. Thaizing ah zingpit tein nan feh sal leh ding,” ti ah a ti. Annih in, “A si thei lo ding; tuih zan cu hi khawpi-ih kotthler ah kan riak ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Asinain Lot in a innih riak ding cun a leem rero ih neta bik ah a innih riak ding cun an lung a kim sal. Cule Lot cun thilnu tel lo sang a tuah ih zanriah thawzet a dar ih an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih zan cu a mikhual pawl an ih hlanah, Sodom khuasungmi in Lot ih inn cu an kulh ṭheh. Upa nauhak ti loin an zatein an tel ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lot cu an vun ko ih, “Na hnenih tuih zan a ra riakmi na mikhual pawl khuiah an si? Rak suah hnik, kan sualpi pei,” ti ah an au.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lot cu sangka in a va suak ih a kharsal hnuah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Rualle uh, cuvek thil ṭha lo cu a tuah tum hram hlah uh, ti ah ka lo dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zoh uh, hinah fanu himte pahnih ka nei. Ka rak suahpi pei ih nan duh bangtuk in tuah uh. Asinain hi mi pawl parah cun zianghman tuah hram hlah uh; ziangahtile ka mikhual an si ih ka inn ah an thleng zo a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain annih in, “Nang ramdang mi taak ko; in kian sawn; cucu tuah uh, khakha tuah uh, ti ah ziangtinso nang in in ti thei? ṭhawn sawn aw; culole nangmah riangri kan lo tuahmawh ngah sawn ding,” an ti ih Lot cu an tuul ih a sangka cu a bauh an tum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah a mikhualte pahnih cun Lot cu sangka cun an hei dawh ih innsungih an hnuh lut hnuah sangka cu an khar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih hnuah sangka lengih a ummi mipi pawl cu nauta bik in upa bik tiang an mit an cawtter thluh ih sangka an hmu thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun a mikhual pahnih in Lot hnenah, “Sungte dang na nei lai maw? Na fapa pawl, na fanu pawl le na fanu ih pasal pawl ko thluh awla zamrangte in hi khua in suak uh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ziangahtile hi khua hi kan siatsuah thluh ding a si. Bawipa in hi khawsungmi sualnak le borhhlawhnak a theifiang zo ih Sodom khua hi siatsuah dingah in thlah a si,” ti ah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Lot cu zamrangte in a feh ih a fanu pawl ih pasal dingmi tlangval pawl hnenah, “Zamrangte in hi hmun in suak uh; ziangahtile Bawipa in hi khawpi cu a siatsuah ding a si,” ti ah a sim hai. Asinain annih cun capoh men ah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Zingpit khuafing a cah in vancungmi cun Lot hnenah, “Zamrang aw; na nupi le na fanu pahnih hruai awla suak zaang aw; hi khua hi siatthluh a si ih a hloral tikah nan tel ve pang dah pei,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Lot cu a ṭhukṭhun deuh. Cutikah Bawipa in a zaangfah thotho ih Lot le a nupi le a fanu pahnih cu vancungmi in an kut in an hruai ih khuapawn ah an fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Khawpawn an thlen tikah vancungmi pakhat in, “Nan nunsuaknak dingah tlan uh; nan dunglam hoikir hlah uhla hmunrawn ahhin tangphah hlah uh. Tlang parah tlan uhla nan thi lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain Lot in, “ Bawipa , cuticun si hram hlah seh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />i zaangfah ih ka nunnak cu i zuah zo. Tlangpar cu ka thleng thei hrimhrim lo ding; a hlazet lai ih khitawk ka thlen hlanah siatsuahnak in i man thotho ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bawipa , khi khua fate khi na hmu ko. Khi khua fate cu a naite pam ih ka thleng man ko ding. Ka luatnak dingah khi khua ah ka feh ko pei,” ti ah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah vancungmi in, “Na dil vekin ka lo lungkimpi a si; khi khua cu ka siatsuah lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zamrang in tlan zaang aw. Khi khua na thlen hlan cu zianghman ka tuah lo ding,” ti ah a ti. A cuih khua cu, “Khua fate,” ti ah Lot in a ti ruangah Zoar ti ah an run kota.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ni a hung suak ih Lot cu Zoar khua a va thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawipa in Sodom le Gomorrah khua parah kaat mei-alh van in a suurter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun khawpi pawl le nelrawn pawl, khuasungih a ummi minung hmuahhmuah le leiram parih a khomi hmuahhmuah thawn Bawipa in a siatsuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Asinain Lot ih nupi cu dunglam a hoikir ruangah ciṭhuamah a cangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A thaizing ah Abraham cu Pathian thawn an ton awknak hmunah zamrangte in a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sodom le Gomorrah khua le nelrawn tluan cu a vun zoh tikah cahmang meipikhu vekin meikhu a kai luailo kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Pathian in nelrawn ih khawpi pawl a siatsuah tikah Abraham cu a hngilh lo ih Lot cu himte in a luatter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lot cu Zoar khua ih um a ṭih ruangah a fanu pahnih thawn tlangpar ah an ceer ih lungpuk sungah an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah a upa deuh nu in a naunu hnenah, “Ka pa hi a tar vivo thlang a si. Faate kan neih theinak dingah a daan keelih in ra ṭhitu ding leilung parah mipa an um fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah ra hnik, ka pa thawn pawl aw-in faate tla kan neih theinak dingah sabitti ri ko in kan tul hnik pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A cuih zan cu an pa cu sabitti an pek ih a upa nu le a pa cu an pawl aw; asinain sabitti a rit tuk ruangah a pa cun an pawl awk cu a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A thaisun ah a naunu hnenah, “Mizan ah ka pa thawn kan pawl aw. Tuihzan khal sabitti kan pe lala pei ih nangmah thawn nan pawl aw pei. Cuticun kan pahnih in kan pa ih fa kan nei ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Curuangah acuih zan khal an pa cu sabitti an pek ih a ri lala ih a fanu nauta thawn an pawl aw. Ahmaisa vekin an pa cu sabitti a rit tuk ruangah a fanu nauta thawn an pawl awk cu a thei thotho lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutiin Lot ih fanu pahnih cu an pa ih fa an vun veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A fanu upa sawn in fapa a nei ih a hmin ah Moab ti ah a fanu in a sak. Cuih fapa cu tuihsan Moab mipawl cithlahtu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A fanu nauta khal in fapa a nei ve ih, Ben-ammi ti ah a fanu cun hmin a sak. Ben-ammi cu tuihsan Ammon mipawl cithlahtu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham cu Mamre ihsin Negev ramah a ceer ih Kadesh le Shur karlakah a um. Cuih hnu Gerar ih a um laiah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Abraham in a nupi Sarah cu ka farnu a si, a ti ruangah Gerar siangpahrang Abimelek in a nupi dingah a lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih zan cu Abimelek ih mangah Pathian a lang ih Pathian in, “Na thi ding, ziangahtile Sarah hi mi nupi a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Sarah cu Abimelek in a ihpi hrih lo hrangah, “Bawipa, miṭha khal na that ko ding maw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham in ka farnu a si a ti ih amah Sarah khal in Abraham cu ka u-pa a si a ti fawn. Curuangah hi thil ka tuahmi hi thinlung thiangte ih ka tuahmi a si; sualnak zianghman ka tuah lo,” ti ah Abimelek in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mang thotho ahcun Pathian in, “Asi, thinlung thiangte in na tuahmi a si ti ka thei; curuangah keimah hmaiih misual na si lonak dingah Sarah ka lo thamter lonak cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sikhalsehla atu ihsin Sarah cu a pasal hnenah fehter aw. A pasal cu Profet a si ih na thih lonak dingah na hrangah thla a lo cam sak ding. Asinain na kirter lo ahcun nangmah le nan sungkurun in nan thi tengteng ding; ralrinnak atu in ka lo pe a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah Abimelek cu a tho ih a hnenum pawl a ko thluh ih acuih thu pawl cu kimtein a sim ṭheh. A hnenum pawl cu an thin a phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Abimelek in Abraham cu a ko ih a hnenah, “Kan parih na tuah mi hi ziangvek thil so a si? Ziang sualnak na parih ka tuah ruangah so hi thil ṭihnungza hi keimah le ka ram parah na thlen ter? Ka parih na tuahmi vek hi cu zohman in an tuah dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ziangah so hivek cun na tuah?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham in, “Pathian a ṭihzahtu hi ramah hin an um lo ding ih ka nupi co duh ah in that men ding, ti ah ka ruah ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Sarah hi ka farnu taktak a si ko. Amah cu ka pa ih fanu a si; asinain ka nu ih fanu cu a si lo; curuangah ka ṭhit a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Curuangah Pathian in ka pa ih inn taan tahratin ka thlen dah lonak ramih i thlah tikah, ‘Ka parih zumtlak ngaingai na sinak langter dingah, ka ṭapa a si, ti ah kan fehnak tinah na ti pei,’ tiin Sarah cu ka tiam ciami a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Abimelek in Sarah cu Abraham hnenah a pek sal; cuih tlunah tuu le caw le sal tampi tla a pek cih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Abraham hnenah, “Hi ram hmuahhmuah hi ka ta a si; na duhnak poh ah um aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Sarah hnenah, “Na ṭapa hnenah ngun tangka thawngkhat ka pek. Himi cu na kiangkapih a ummi minung hmuahhmuah hnenah mawh nei lo na sinak kha langter dingah a si. Mi hmuahhmuah in sualnak zianghman na tuah lo ti an thei ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Abraham nupi Sarah parah cutiih thil an rak tuah ruangah Bawipa in Abimelek innsungih a ummi nunau hmuahhmuah cu faate nei thei lo dingin a tuah hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain Abraham in Abimelek hrangah thla a cam ih Pathian in Abimelek le a nupi le a salnu pawl tla cu a damter thluh ih faate khal an nei thei sal a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A tiamcia vekin Bawipa in Sarah cu a thluasuah ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sarah cu nau a keng ih Abraham tar zawng ah fapa a hring. Pathian ih a sim ciami tikcu a thlen in fapa an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Abraham in a fapa cu Isaak ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule Pathian ih thupek bangtuk in Abraham in Isaak cu ni riat a ti tikah serh a tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Isaak a suah tikah Abraham cu kum zakhat a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sarah in, “Pathian in lungawinak le hnihnak i pek a si. Hi thu a theitu hmuahhmuah in in lungawipi ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih tlunah, “Sarah in fapa te hnawi a fawh ding ti ah Abraham hnenah zo tal in an sim dah pei maw? Asinain a tar hnuah amah hrangah fapa ka hring zo,” ti ah Sarah in a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A fapa cu a ṭhang deuhdeuh ih hnawifawh a baan ni ah Abraham in rawldar puai tumpi a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nikhat ah Izipt nu Hagar le Abraham ih an hrinmi Ishmael le Sarah ih fapa Isaak an lek tlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cumi cu Sarah in a hmuh tikah Abraham hnenah, “Hi salnu le a fapa hi dawi aw. Ka fapa Isaak ih co dingmi na ro hi hih salnu ih fapa in malte hman dai hlah seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham cu a thinlung a harzet, ziangahtile Ishmael khal cu a fapa thotho a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Pathian in Abraham hnenah, “Hi na fapa le a nu Hagar hrangah na don har hlah. Sarah ih a lo sim vekin tuah aw; ziangahtile ka lo kam ciami siar cawk lo na tesinfa pawl cu Isaak sung ihsin an suak ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na salnu ih fapa hnen khalah tefa tampi ka pek ding ih miphun tumpi ah an cang ding. Ziangahtile anih khal na fapa a si ve,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah Abraham cu a tho ih Hagar hnenah rawl le tidai thawl khat a pek. A fapa Ishmael cu Hagar a pawkter ih a fehter. Cutiin Hagar cu a feh ih Beersheba ramṭhing lakah a vakvai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An tidai kenmi a cem tikah a fapa te cu hrambur hnuai ah a ret ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Ka faate thih lai cu ka zoh thei lo,” a ti ih a feh ih kaih zakhat hlat ah a va to. Cutiih a to phahin a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Pathian in naute ṭah aw khal a thei ih Pathian ih vancungmi cun vancung in a hnenah, “Hagar, ziangah so vansaangin na um? Na thin phang hlah. Pathian in naute aw a thei zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tho aw; na naute va la awla ngamter-aw. A tefa pawl cu miphun tumpi ah ka tuah hai ding a si,” ti ah a run ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in Hagar mit cu a vangter ih tikhur pakhat a hmu. A va feh ih tithawl khattein ti a than ih a fapa cu tidai a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian in a umpi ih a fapa cu a ṭhang vivo. Paran ram ramṭhing lakah a um ih amah cu sakapzet ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule a nu in nupi ah Izipt nu a ṭhit sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Culai ahcun Abimelek cu a ralkap uktu bawi Fikol thawn Abraham hnenah a ra ih, “Na thil tuahmi hmuahhmuah ah Pathian in a lo umpi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah keimah le ka faate pawl le ka tesinfa tla in bum lonak dingah Pathian hmaiah thu i kam aw. Na hnenah zumtlak in ka um zo ih nang khal keimah parah le hi na umnak ram parah zumtlakmi na sinak dingah thukamnak tuah aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham in, “Ka kam aw a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Abimelek hnenum pawl ih an lonmi tikhur thu cu Abraham in Abimelek hnenah a hun salhsuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Abimelek in, “Hi thu hi ka thei dah lo. Nangmah in i sim dah fawn lo; atu hi hmaisa bik ka theihnak a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun Abraham in Abimelek cu tuu le caw a ṭhen ih an pahnih in lungkimnak an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Abraham in a tuurual sung ihsin tuunu no pasarih a lak ih hmun dangah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Ziangah so hiti in na tuah?” ti ah Abimelek in a sut tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Abraham in, “Hi tikhur laitu cu nangmah na si ti ih i tinak dingah hi tuunu no pasarih cu i saan a ṭul,” ti ah a sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah acuih hmun cu Beersheba ti ah an ko; ziangahtile an pahnih ih thu an tiam awknak hmun a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutiin Beersheba ih lungkimnak an tuah hnuah Abimelek le a ralkap uktu bawi Fikol cu Filistin ramah an kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Beersheba ah Abraham in thingkung pakhat a phun ih kumkhua ih a nungmi Pathian Bawipa cu a biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cuticun Filistin ram sungah Abraham cu reipi a um.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Pathian in Abraham cu a hniksak ih, “Abraham,” ti ah a ko. Abraham in, “ Bawipa , hinah ka um,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian in, “Na duh zetmi na fapa neihsun Isaak cu hruai awla Moriah ram ah fehpi aw. Cutawk ramih a ummi ka lo hmuh dingmi tlang parah Isaak cu mei-ur thawinakah pe aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitte-ah Abraham cu a tho ih a laak tokham a dam ih a fapa Isaak le a hnenum pahnih thawn an feh. Thawinak hrangih hman dingah zanthing a khawm ih Pathian ih a sim ciami ramah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni thumnak ni ah acuih hmun cu hlavang in a hei hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah a hnenum pawl hnenah, “Laak thawn hitawk ah rak um uh. Kei le ka fapa cu Pathian kan va bia ding ih nan hnenah kan ra kirsal ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Abraham in thawinak hrangih zanthing cu a fapa a phurhter; amah in meiṭek le kawlnam a keng ih an pafa an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A rei hlanah Isaak in, “Ka pa,” ti ah a ko. A pa in, “Ziang a si ka fa?” ti ah a ti. Isaak in, “Meiṭek le zanthing hmuah kan keng ih thawinak hrangih tuu faate khui-ah so?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Abraham in, “Amah Pathian in in pe leh ko ding, ka fa,” ti ah a ti. Cutiin an pafa an feh vivo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cule Pathian ih a sim ciami hmun an thlen tikah, Abraham in biakṭheng a don ih a parah zanthing a ret. Cun a fapa Isaak cu a ṭem ih biakṭheng par zanthing tlunah cun a hlum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutikah a fapa that dingin a kawlnam cu a vun zuuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cu laifangah Bawipa ih vancungmi in vancung ihsin, “Abraham, Abraham!” ti ah a ko. Abraham in, “ Bawipa , hinah ka um!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah vancungmi in, “Na fapa that hlah; zianghman ti-aw hlah. Na fapa neihsun ka hrangih na sian ruangah Pathian na ṭihzah zet a si ti kha ka thei zo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Abraham in a kiangkap a hei zoh ih tuucang pakhat hri-hnok lakah a ki ih awk awmi a hmu. A va lak ih a fapa ai-ah mei-ur thawinakah a hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuih hmun cu Abraham in, “Yahweh Jireh,” ti ah hmin a sak. Curuangah tuih san tiangin, “ Bawipa ih tlang ah Bawipa in a pek,” ti ah mi in an run tita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Bawipa ih vancungmi in Abraham cu vancung ihsin a ko sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Bawipa in hiti in a ti: Ka hmin in thu ka lo kam - hi thil na tuah ih na fapa neihsun ka hrangih na sian ruangah tlamtling zetin ka lo thlawsuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tesinfa pawl cu ka karhzaiter ding ih vanih arsi zat in le tifinriat vunnel zat in an tam ding a si. Na tesinfa pawl in an ral pawl cu an neh thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun annih ka thlawsuah bangtuk in leilung tlunih miphun kip in thlawsuah in dil ding. Hi thil hmuahhmuah cu keimah ih thu na ngai ruangah a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Abraham cu a hnenum pawl hnenah a kir ih an zatein an umnak Beersheba ah an tlung sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Abraham in a unau pa Nahor le Milkah in fapa an neih kha a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Upa bik cu Uz a si ih a naupa cu Buz a si; Aram ih pa Kemuel le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khesed, Hazo, Pildash, Jidlaf le Bethuel tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />(Bethuel cu Rebekah ih pa a si.) Nahor ih nupi Milkah in hi fapa pariat hi a hrinmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule Nahor ih nusun Reumah in Tebah, Gaham, Tahash le Maakah a hring.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sarah cu kum za le kulhluan sarih a nung ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kanaan ram Hebron (a si lole Kiriath-arba timi) khua ah a thi. Abraham cu a ninghang in Sarah thih cu a ul ih a ṭah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule a nupi ruak kiang ihsin a tho ih Hit mi pawl hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Kei hi a laangte ih um mikhual le mivai ka si. Ka nupi phumnak dingah nan ram hi malte talin in zorh hram uh,” ti ah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah annih in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Bawipa, kan simmi hi in ngai hram aw; kanmah lakah nang cu a lian zetmi lal na si. Cuhrangah kan neihmi thlaan hmuahhmuah lakih a ṭha bikmi ah na nupi cu phum ko aw. Na nupi phumnak ahcun zohman in kan thlaanhmun kan ui lo ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham cu a tho ih an hmaiah a kun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Hi ramih ka nupi phum ding nan lung a kim ahcun Hit mi pa Zohar ih fapa Efron in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Makpelah lungpuk cu i zorh dingah i dilsak hram uh. A lungpuk cu a loram netnak ah a si. Thlanhmun ka neih thei venak dingah nan zate hmaiah hin a duhzat i ngen in i zorh hram seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cutiih Hit mi pawl an tonkhawm awknak khuasuah ahcun Efron khal a tel ve hrangah senpi theih-ah Efron in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Bawipa, cuticun si hlah seh, i ngai hrih hram aw; ka ram zate in a lakin ka lo ṭhen ih a sungih ummi lungpuk khal nei cih aw. Ka miphunpi theihhngan ah ka loram cu ka lo ṭhen; na nupi na phumnak dingah,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sihmansehla Abraham cu misenpi hmaiah a lu a kun ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />senpiih theih dingin Efron hnenah, “Na thinlung ngaingai a si ahcun i ngai hnik aw: na ram zatein ka lo lei pei. A man i la hram aw. Cun ka nupi ka phum ding a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Efron in Abraham cu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Bawipa, ka loram man cu ngun tangka zali lawng a si ih, nang le kei ih lakah ziangtlakso a si lem! Cunah na nupi cu phum ko aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham cu a lung a kim ih Hit mi pawl theih hnganah Efron ih ngun tangka zali a ngenmi cu sumtuahtu pawl ih an hmantlangmi cuai in a khai ih a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutiin Mamre ihsin nisuahnak lam Efron ih Makpelah leiram cu Abraham ih ramah a cangta. A sungih lo le lungpuk le thingkung hmuahhmuah khal a ta an si thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cuih an tonkhawm awknak ih a telmi Hit mi hmuahhmuah in Abraham ih ram a si cu an theihpi thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutiin Kanaan ram acuih lungpuk ah Abraham in a nupi Sarah cu a phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuhrangah Hit mi pawl ih ram a rak si dahmi cuih ram le a sungih a ummi lungpuk pawl cu Abraham ih ramah a rung cang ih thlaanmual ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham cu a kum a upa ih a tarzet thlang; Pathian in a tuahmi le a ṭuanmi hmuahhmuah ah a thluasuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule Abraham in a thil neihmi hmuahhmuah a kilkhawitu, a hnenum upa bik pa ih hnenah, “Na kut ka cawn karlakah re hram-awla thu i kam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van le lei ih Pathian Bawipa ih hmai le ka hnenah, ka fapa Isaak ih nupi dingah ka umnak Kanaan ramih nunau ka la hrimhrim lo pei, ti ah siatserh in thu i tiam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hlanih ka rak umnak ka khuaram ah na feh pei ih ka sungkhat pawl sung ihsin ka fapa ih hrangah nupi na va hawl pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah a hnenum pa in, “Asile cuih nunau nu in i thlun duh loin a innih um duh sawnsehla ziangtinso a si ding? Na fapa sawn na rak umnak na khuaram ahcun ka kirpi sal ding maw?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Abraham in, “Ka fapa cu kirpi hrimhrim lo dingin ruat cia aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bawipa vanih Pathian in ka pa ih inn le ka suahkehnak ram ihsin i suahter ih atu hi ram hi, ‘Na tesinfa hnenah ka pe ding,’ ti ah siatserh in i tiamkam ciami a si. Amah Pathian in a vancungmi na hmaiah a fehter ding ih ka fapa hrangih nupi cu na ngah thei ko ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nunau in a lo thlun duh lo ngaingai a si ahcun ka hnenih na kammi thutiam-awhnak ihsin na luat ding. Ziang a si khalle, ka fapa cu cutawk ram ahcun na kirpi hrimhrim lo pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuticun a hnenum pa cun a bawipa Abraham ih cawn karlakah a kut a ret ih a simmi pawl tuah tengteng dingah siatserh in thu a tiam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun a hnenum pa cun a bawipa ih kalauk rual sungin pahra a lak ih a tim a tuah ih laksawng dingah thilmankhung tampi a keng. Cule Mesopotamia ram Nahor umnak khua ah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuih khua a va thlen tikah hnarpawn ih tikhur kiangah a kalauk pawl cu a bawhter. Zanlam a si zo hrangah khuasungih nunau pawl cu tidai khai dingin an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham ih hnenum pa cu thla a cam ih, “Maw Bawipa , ka bawipa Abraham ih Pathian, ka bawipa hnenih na thukammi kimter in tuihsun tikcu caanah i hlawhtlingter hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi ka dinnak tikhur ahhin tidai khai dingah khuasung in fala pawl an ra ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Fala pakhat hnenah, ‘Zaangfahte in na tithawl run ṭhum awla tidai ka in ding,’ ti ah ka ti pei ih anih in, ‘In aw, na kalauk pawl khal ti ka tul hai pei,’ ti ah a ti asile cuih fala cu na salpa Isaak hrangih na hrilmi fala si hram seh. Cutiih a can ngaingai le ka bawipa hnenih na thukam na kimter a si, ti ah ka thei ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule a thlacam hman a ṭheh hlanah Rebekah an timi fala cu a liang parah tithawl pu tahratin a ra. Rebekah cu Bethuel ih fanu a si. Bethuel cu Milkah ih fapa a si ih Milkah cu Abraham ih unaupa Nahor ih nupi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rebekah cu fala himte a si ih a mawizet fawn. Tikhur ahcun a vungṭum ih a tithawl khat ko ti a than hnuah a hung sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham ih hnenum pa cu a va tlan ih a hnenah,” Zaangfahte in na tithawl sungih tidai i in ter hram aw,” ti ah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rebekah cun, “Bawipa in aw,” ti ah a ti ih a tithawl cu zamrangte in a liang par ihsin a ṭhum ih tithawl khal cu fektein a kaihsak ih a inter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tidai a inter hnuah Rebekah in, “Na kalauk pawl hrang khalah tidai ka khai pei ih an duhzat in in hai seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zamrangte in ṭilva tikuang sungah a tidai cu a thlet ta ih kalauk pawl an khawh hlan lo tidai cu a khaisak rero.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Abraham ih milai pa cun Bawipa in i hlawhtlinter pei maw, ti ah daitein a zoh ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun kalauk pawl cu Rebekah in ti a pek ṭheh hnuah Abraham ih hnenum pa cun a man a khung zetmi sui hnarthlaih a vun suah ih a hnar ah a thlaih; cun sui faute tumzet pahnih a lak ih a kutah a hruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule, “Zo fanu so na si? Na pa ih inn ah kan hrangah riahnak khaan a um pei maw?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rebekah in, “Nahor le Milkah ih fapa Bethuel ih fanu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na ṭilva hrangah hrampi le rawl tampi kan nei ih nan riahnak dingah khaan khal a um,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Abraham ih hnenum pa cun lukuun in, Bawipa Pathian cu a biak ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Ka Bawipa Abraham ih Pathian, Bawipa cu thangṭhat in um seh. Amah in ka bawipa Abraham hnenih a thukamnak le rintlak a sinak cu a kimter zo. Ka bawipa Abraham ih unau inn ah Pathian in i thlengter a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Falanu cu a nu hnenah a tlan ih cuih thuhla hmuahhmuah cu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah Rebekah ih ṭapa Laban in cuih thuhla cu a thei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Rebekah ih hnarthlaih le a ngeel parih faute tla a hmuh tikah tikhur lamah a va tlan ih Abraham ih hnenum pa cu tikhur kiangah a kalauk pawl thawn an rak din kha a va hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah Laban in, “Kan inn ah ra aw, Bawipa ih thlawsuahmi na si. Ziangah so khawlengah na din? Kan inn cu nan riahnak dingah ka simsial zo ih na kalauk pawl hrang khalah hmun a um a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuticun Laban in an inn ah a luhpi hai ih kalauk parih thil pawl cu a ṭhum thluh ih hrampi le rawl tla a pek. Cutiin Abraham ih hnenum le a minung pawl ke kholhnak dingah tidai a rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun zanriah ei an tuah tikah Abraham ih hnenum pa in, “Ka thusim duhmi ka sim hlan cu rawl ka ei hrih lo ding,” ti ah a ti. Cule Laban in, “Na sim duhmi cu sim aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />A thu cu a vun thok ih, “Kei cu Abraham ih hnenum ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian in ka bawipa cu tlamtling zetin bawngmal a sawm ih milianzet ah a tuah. Bawipa in tuu le me le caw a rualrual in a pek ih sui le ngun, salnu le salpa, kalauk le laak tampi tla a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule ka bawipa ih nupi Sarah in a tar hnuah fapa a hring. Ka bawipa in a neihmi thil hmuahhmuah cu a fapa a pek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka bawipa in, ‘Ka fapa Isaak ih nupi dingah atu ka umnak Kanaan ramih fala pawl sung ihsin na hril lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka pa ih miphun le ka laicin pawl hnenah ka fapa hrangah nupi na va hawl lo ahcun na parah siatserhnak thleng seh,’ ti ah a hmai rori ah thutiamnak i tuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule ka bawipa ih hnenah, ‘Cuih nunau nu in i thlun duh lo sehla ziangtinso a si ding?’ tiih ka suh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />ka bawipa in, ‘A thu ka thlun ringringmi Pathian in a vancungmi na hnenah a thlah ding ih a lo hlawhtlinter ding. Ka pa ih sungkhat le ka laicin sung ihsin ka fapa nupi cu na ṭhi tengteng ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cutiih na tuah asile ka siatserhnak sungin na luat ding; cun ka laicin hnenah na feh ih an lo el a si ahcun ka siatserhnak sungin na luat ding,’ ti ah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />“Tuihsun tikhur kiangih ka ra thlen tikah ka thlacammi cu, ‘ Bawipa , ka bawipa Abraham ih Pathian, ka thil tuahmi parah hlawhtlinnak i pe hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Zohhnik, tikhur kiangih ka din laiah tidai khai dingih falanu a rat tikah a hnenah, na tithawl sungih tidai i pe hram aw ti ah ka ti pei ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />falanu in, in aw, na kalauk tla tidai ka pe hai ding, a ti a si ahcun cuih fala cu ka bawipa fapa ih nupi dingah Bawipa in a hrilmi siseh,’ ti ah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cutiin daitein thla ka cam ih ka thlacam hman ka ṭheh hlanah Rebekah in a liangah tithawl pu in a ra ih tikhur ah tidai a vung khai. Cule a hnenah, ‘Zaangfahte in tidai i pe aw,’ ti ah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Zamrangte in a liangih a tithawl cu a ṭhum ih, ‘In aw; na kalauk pawl khal ti ka pe hai ding,’ ti ah i ti. Cuticun a tidai cu ka in ih ka kalauk pawl khal tidai a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />‘Na pa zoso a si?’ tiih ka suh tikah, ‘Nahor le Milkah ih fapa Bethuel ih fanu ka si,’ ti ah i ti. Cutikah a hnar ah hnarthlaih ka thlaih, a ngeel ah faute ka hruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Cun ka lu ka kun ih ka bawipa Abraham ih Pathian, ka lam tluangzet ih i hruaitu Bawipa cu ka biak ih ka thangṭhat a si. Pathian in ka bawipa ih unau hnenah i thlenpi; cule ka bawipa fapa ih nupi hrangah a fanu ka tong zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cutiin a si ih ka bawipa ih hrangah thuṭha nan ruat thei ih rem nan ti a si ahcun atu-ah i hliah hram uh. Kan thuhla a rem thiam lo nan ti a si khalle i sim uhla hmun dang ah feh ka tum pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Cutikah Laban le Bethuel in a hnenah, “Hi thu cu Bawipa ih hnen ihsin a rami a si hrangah kannih relcat ding a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Cuhrangah hinah Rebekah a um; hruai awla fehpi ko aw. Bawipa amah ih a sim zo vekin na bawipa fapa ih nupi-ah si ko seh,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cuih thu a theih tikah Abraham ih hnenum pa cu Bawipa Pathian hmaiah leilung dai in a lu a kun ih lungawi thu a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Cule sui le ngun hlawnthil le thilthuam tla a suah ih Rebekah cu a pek; a ṭapa le a nu khal thil mankhung zetzet a ṭhen hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cuticun Abraham hnenum le a milai pawl cu rawl ei le in in cuih zan cu an riak. A thaizing an thawh tikah, “Ka bawipa ih hnenah i kirter hram uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Asinain a nu le a ṭapa in, “Kan fala cu kan hnenah ni malte, nihra tluk talin um hrih seh; cuih hnuah a feh leh ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Anih in, “In kai hram hlah uh; Bawipa in ka lamzin a tluanter zo. Curuangah ka bawipa ih hnenah i kirter ko uh,” ti ah a dil hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Kan falanu kan ko pei ih amah kan sut pei, ziangtin a ruat pei maw,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Rebekah cu an ko ih, “Hi pa thawn feh dingah na lung a kim maw?” ti ah an sut. Rebekah in, “Ka lung a kim,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Curuangah an farnu Rebekah cu amah a rak umtu nunau pakhat thawn Abraham ih hnenum pa le a milai pawl hnenah an fehter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Cun Rebekah cu hiti in thlaza an camsak: “Kan farnu, mi thawng tampi ih nu ah cang hram aw, Na tefa pawl in an raal ih khawpi pawl neh thluh hram hai seh,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Cule Rebekah le a hnenum nunau pawl cu kalauk parah an to ih Abraham ih hnenum pa cu an thlun. Hnenum pa in a hruai hai ih an fehta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Culai ah Isaak cu, “Beer-lahai-roi” timi ihsin a ra thawn ih Negev ramah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nikhat siimlam ah Isaak cu lam a leng ih kalauk pawl an ra rero kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Cule Rebekah khalin Isaak cu a hmu ih a kalauk parin a ṭum lohli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Abraham ih hnenum pa hnenah, “Hramlakih kanmah tong dingah a ra rero mi pa khi zoso a si?” ti ah a sut. Hnenum pa in, “Ka bawipa a si,” ti ah a ti. Cutikah Rebekah in a hmaikhuhnak puanpaate cu a lak ih a hmai a khuh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Cule hnenum pa in a tawlrelmi thu le hla hmuahhmuah cu Isaak hnenah a sim thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Cule Isaak in Rebekah cu a nu Sarah rak umnak puanthlam ah a hruai ih a nupi ah a cang. Isaak in Rebekah cu a duhdawt ih a nu Sarah thih hnuah amah hnemtu ah a cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham in nupi dang a ṭhi ih a hmin cu Keturah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keturah thawn an hrinmi fapa pawl cu Zimran, Jokshan, Medan, Midian, Ishbak le Shuah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Jokshan ih fapa pawl cu Sheba le Dedan an si ih Dedan ih hrinmi fapa pawl cu Asshurim, Letushim le Leummim an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midian ih fapa pawl cu Efah, Efer, Hanok, Abida le Eldaah an si. An zatein Keturah ih tefa pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham in a neihmi hmuahhmuah cu Isaak a rohta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain a thih hlanah a nupi dangih fapa pawl hnenah laksawng a zem ve hai ih Isaak thawn umtlang lo dingin hmundang nisuahnak ramah a fehter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Abraham cu kum za le sawmsarih le kum nga tiang a nung;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tarkuun khuuksuang in a nun hnuah a thi ih a miphunpi hnenah finkhawm in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hit mi Zohar ih fapa Efron hnen ihsin ram a leimi, Mamre ih nisuahnak lam Makpelah lungpuk ah a fapa Isaak le Ishmael in an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hit miphun hnen ihsin amah Abraham ih rak lei ciami ram a si. A nupi Sarah thawn an pahnih in cutawkah phum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham thih hnuah a fapa Isaak cu Pathian in a thluasuah ih, “Beer-lahai-roi” timi tikhur kiangah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sarah ih salnu, Izipt mi Hagar thawn an hrinmi Abraham ih fapa Ishmael ih tesinfa pawl cu a hnuailam bangtuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ishmael ih fapa pawl hmin cu a sangsangin, upa bikah Nebaioth, cun Kedar, Adbeel, Mibsam,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mishma, Dumah, Massa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hadad, Tema, Jetur, Nafish le Kedemah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himi pawl hi Ishmael ih fapa pawl an si ih an khua le an umnak ram hmin cu anmah ih hmin ciar suang ih sakmi an si. Anmah tla cu miphun hnam hleihnih ih cithlahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ishmael cu kum za le sawmthum le kum sarih a nung. A thi ih a miphunpi hnenah finkhawm in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ishmael ih tesinfa pawl cu Izipt ram in nisuahnak, Assiria ram fehnak lam, Havilah le Shur karlak ramah an um. Abraham tesinfa hnenih um loin a dangte in an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abraham fapa Isaak ih thuanthu cu hiti in a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mesopotamia ram Aram mi Bethuel ih fanu, Laban ih farnu, Rebekah a ṭhit tikah Isaak cu kum sawmli a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rebekah in fa a neih lo ruangah Isaak in Bawipa ih hnenah thla a camsak. Bawipa in a thlacam cu a thei ih Rebekah cu fa a vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A pum sungah faphir an seem ih an eng-awk rero kha a theih tikah a don a har ih, “Hiti a si ahcun ziangso ka nun man a um?” ti ah a ti. Cule Bawipa hnenah thla a cam ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bawipa in, “Na pum sungah miphun pahnih an um. A ral-aw phun hrimhrim in an suak ding; Pakhat cu a dang pa hnakin a cak deuh ding ih, A upa sawn in a naupa a rian ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rebekah cu a nithla a kim tikah faphir a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A suak hmaisa pa cu misen a si ih a pumpuluk in hmul a nei. Curuangah Esau ti ah a hmin an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A nauta pa a rung suah tikah a upa Esau ih kedil kaihnget tahratin a suak. Curuangah a hminah Jakob an sak. Fapa a neih tikah Isaak cu kum sawmruk a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun an unau an ṭhang vivo ih Esau cu sakapzet a si ih hramlakih ramtawi duh zettu-ah a cang. Jakob cu midai a si ih inn lawnglawng ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A sakahmi a ei ṭheu ruangah Isaak in Esau cu a duh deuh; asinain a nu Rebekah cun Jakob a duh sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nikhat cu Jakob in pehang a suan laifangah a ramtawihnak in Esau cu a ra tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A ril a rawn tuk ruangah a naupa Jakob hnenah, “Ka ril a rawng tuk lawmmam, na tihang sente kha kaa khatte talin i pe aw,” ti ah a dil. (Curuangah Edom tiih an kawhnak a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asinain Jakob in, “Na fatir covo i pe awla ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cutikah Esau in, “Ka lo pe ding; rilrawng in ka thi zik thlang ih ka covo cu ka hrangah ziangso ṭhathnemnak a neih?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cule Jakob in, “Ka covo ka lo pe tengteng ding, tiin thu i kam hmaisa aw,” ti ah a ti. Cutiin Esau cun thu a kam ih fatir a sinak covo cu Jakob hnenah a zuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cule Jakob in sang le pehang a suanmi cu a pek. Esau in a in a ei hnuah a tho ih a feh. Fatir a sinak covo cu zianghman ah a siar lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Abraham sanih paam voikhat a rak tlun hlei ah hi ram ah paam a tlung sal. Curuangah Gerar ih a ummi Filistin siangpahrang Abimelek hnenah Isaak cu a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa cu Isaak hnenah a lang ih a hnenah, “Izipt ramah cun na feh lo pei; na um ding ka lo tinak ram ah um aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hitawk ah tikcu tawite sung um awla, na hnenah ka um ding ih ka lo thlawsuah ding; ziangahtile nangmah le na tesinfa pawl hnenah hi ram hmuahhmuah cu ka lo pe ding a si. Na pa Abraham hnenih ka rak tuahmi thukam cu ka kimter ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Van ih arsi zat in tesinfa ka lo pe ding ih an hnenah hi ram hmuahhmuah cu ka pe ding. Na tesinfa pawl ka thlawsuah bangin leilung tlunih miphun hmuahhmuah in thlawsuah in dil ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abraham in ka thukham a thlun ih ka thu a ngai ruangah nangmah cu ka lo thlawsuah ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutiin Isaak cu Gerar ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih khuami pawl in a nupi thu an suh tikah, “Ka nupi a si,” ti ngam loin, “Ka farnu a si,” a ti. Ziangah a ngam lo tile Rebekah cu a mawi ngaingai ih Rebekah co duh ah in that pang ding ti a phan ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Isaak cu tikcu rei nawn hi ramih a um hnuah voikhat cu Filistin siangpahrang Abimelek cu a tukvirh in khua a cuan ih Isaak in Rebekah a pom lai kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmakhatte-ah Abimelek in Isaak cu a ko ih, “Rebekah hi na nupi a si, a si ko lo maw? Ziangah so ka farnu a si, na ti?” ti ah a sut. Cutikah Isaak in, “Ka nupi a si, ka ti ahcun in that ding, ti ka ruah ruangah a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Abimelek in, “Ziangah so kan parah hiti in thil na tuah? Ka milai pakhatkhat na nupi parah a sual ih mawhphurh kan si le nangmah ih ruangah a si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun Abimelek in, “Hi te nupa, Isaak a si lole Rebekah hi zohman in nan tisia lo pei; a tisiatu nan um ahcun thah nan tong ding,” ti ah a milai pawl hnenah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Isaak in cutawk ramah thlaici a tuh ih acuih kum cu a tuhmi ih let zakhat a khawm; ziangahtile Pathian in a thluasuah ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ṭhangso vivo ih milianzet ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutiin caw le tuu a ruunruun in a nei ih sal khal tampi a neih hrangah Filistin mi pawl in an iksiik zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Curuangah a pa Abraham nun laiih a hnenum pawl ih laih mi tikhur hmuahhmuah cu leilung an silhsak thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cule Abimelek in Isaak hnenah, “Kannih hnakin na cah tuk zo ruangah hmun dangah feh aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Isaak cu a suak ih Gerar phairawn ah buk a sak ih a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutawkah tikhur pawl, a pa Abraham sanih laihmi, a thih hnu ih Filistin pawl in an silhmi pawl cu a lai sal thluh ih a pa ih hmin sakmi vekin Isaak in hmin a pek sal thluh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun voikhatah Isaak ih hnenum pawl in acuih phairawn ah tikhur an lai ih tipuut ṭhazet pakhat an tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Gerar khua ih tuukhal pawl in, “Hi tidai cu kanmah ih ta a si,” ti ah Isaak ih tuukhal pawl hnenah an ti ih an to-aw. Cutiih an tawh-awk ruangah Isaak in acuih tikhur cu, “Esek,” ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Isaak ih hnenum pawl in tikhur dang an lai ih el awknak a um thotho ruangah Isaak in acuih tikhur cu, “Sitnah,” ti ah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun Isaak cu acuih hmun in a ceer ih tikhur dang a lai lala. El awknak a um nawn lo ruangah acuih tikhur cu, “Rehoboth,” ti ah a ko. Cule Isaak in, “Atu cu Bawipa in hi ramah luatnak i pe zo ih kan ṭhangso thlang ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun Isaak cu Beer-sheba ah a hung ceer ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />acuih zanah Bawipa cu a hnenah a lang ih, “Keimah cu na pa Abraham ih Pathian ka si. Zianghman ṭih hlah, na hnenah ka um. Ka salpa Abraham ih vaangah ka lo thlawsuah ding ih tefa tampi ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutawkah Isaak in biakṭheng a don ih Bawipa a biak. Cun umhmun a khuar ih a hnenum pawl in tikhur an lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Abimelek cu Gerar ihsin a ralkap uktu Fikol le ruahnak petu Ahuzzath thawn Isaak tong dingin an ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutikah Isaak in, “Zianghrangah ka hnenah nan ra? In ngaih lo ruangah nan khua le nan ram in in dawi a si lo maw?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Pathian cu na hnenah a um hrimhrim a si, ti ah atu cun kan thei zo ih kan karlakah siatcam in thutiam awknak um sehla tiin kan ruat. Na parih siatsuahnak kan thlenter lo bangtuk in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />nang khal in kan parah siatsuahnak na thlenter lonak dingah thu in kam-aw, ti kan duh. Na hnenih zaangfahnak kan rak neih ruangah daitein kan lo fehter. Atu-ah cun Bawipa ih thlawsuah tampi na dong a si,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Isaak in rawl thawzetin a suang ih acuih zan cu puar zetin an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitte in siatcam thutiam awknak an tuah ih Isaak thawn rualpi ṭhazet cang in an ṭhen-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih ni-ah Isaak ih hnenum pawl an ra ih tikhur an laihnak thu a hnenah an ra sim. “Tidai kan tong zo,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah cuih tikhur cu Shibah ti ah a ko. Atu tiangin acuih khawpi cu Beer-sheba ti ah an run kota.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Esau cu kum sawmli a ti tikah Hit mi Beeri ih fanu Judith a ṭhit. Cuih hnuah Hit mi thotho Elon ih fanu Basemath a ṭhi lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuticun Isaak le Rebekah thinlung hartertu-ah an cang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Isaak cu a tarzet zo ih a mit khal a mal thlang. Curuangah a fapa upa bik Esau cu a ko ih, “Ka fapa,” ti ah a ti. Esau in, “Hinah ka um,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Isaak in, “Ka tar zo ih ka thi cing men ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na hriamnam, na li le thal la awla, ka hrangah hramlakah sa va hawl aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuih sa cu ka duhzawng in thawte in suang awla i rak pe aw. Ka ei pei ih ka thih hlanah ka thlawsuah ka lo peta ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutiih Isaak in a fapa Esau hnenih a ṭong cu Rebekah in a rak ngai ringring. Cun Esau in a pa hrangah hramlakih sa a hawl sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Rebekah in Jakob hnenah, “Na pa in Esau hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />‘Sa i sum awla rawl thawte in i son aw. Ka ei pei ih ka thih hlanah Bawipa ih hmaiah thlawsuah ka lo peta ding,’ ti ah tubaite ah a ti ka thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah ka fapa, ka thu ngai awla ka lo simmi tuah aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan ṭilva ruun lakah va feh awla, me note pahnih va hruai awla ka hnenah rak keng aw. Ka suang pei ih na pa ih duhzawng in ka tuah pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuticun na pa hnenah a ei dingah na hei keng pei; a thih hlanah a thlawsuah a lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain Jakob in a nu hnenah, “Ka nu, ka u Esau cu hmul tampi a nei ih kei cu taksa naalmi ka si, ti na thei ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka pa in i tham men ding sikhawh, ka bum ti i thei thotho lo ding maw? Cuticun thlawsuah si sawn loin camsiatnak riangri ka parah ka thlenter pang ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah a nu in, “Ka fapa, camsiatnak a thleng asile keimah ih parah siseh; ka lo simmi cu tuah sawn aw; va fehzaang awla me note cu ka hrangah va la aw,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Jakob cu a va feh ih a nu hnenah me note cu a rak keng; cule a nu in a pa ih duhzawng in rawl cu a suang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun Esau ih hnipuan ṭha bik, a nu ih ret sakmi cu Rebekah in a lak ih Jakob a hrukter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A nu in Jakob ih baan tluan le hmul um lonak a hngawng cu mephaw in a tuam thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun rawl a thawmi le sang a tuahmi cu a nu in Jakob a hei kenter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiin Jakob cu a pa hnenah a feh ih, “Ka pa,” ti ah a va ti. A pa in, “Awi, ka fa, zo deuh so na si?” ti ah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob in, “Na fa upa Esau ka si, na sim vekin ka tuah zo. Zaangfahte in ra to awla ka lo summi sa hi ra ei in thlawsuah i pe aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaak in, “Cuti zamrangin ziangtinso na va ngah, ka fapa,” a ti. Cutikah Jakob in, “ Bawipa na Pathian in i bawm ih ka ngah a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Isaak in Jakob hnenah, “Khuihnik, ka lo tham theinak dingah i rak naih deuh aw. Ka fapa Esau na si ngaingai maw, si lo so?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jakob in a pa cu a hei naih tikah a pa in a rak tham ih, “Na aw cu Jakob ih aw a bang naón na baan cu Esau ih baan a bang fawn,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Isaak in Jakob cu a rak theih thiam lo, ziangahtile Esau ih baan bangin hmul a nei thluh ve. Thlawsuah pek a hun tum tikah a pa cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Ka fapa Esau na si ngaingai maw?” ti ah a sut sal. Jakob in “Ka si ko,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Isaak in, “Na suanmi sa cu i pe aw; ka eita pei ih thlawsuah ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti. Jakob in sa cu a pek ih in dingah sabitti khal a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun a pa in, “Ka fa, i rak naih awla i hnam aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutiin Jakob cun a pa cu a hei naih ih a hnam tikah a pa in a hnipuan rim a hnim ih cuih hnuah thlawsuah a pek. “Hi ka fapa ih rim cu, Bawipa ih a thlawsuahmi hramlak rim a bang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pathian in vanih daifiim lo thlak in, Na leiram cu leiṭha si hram seh; Fang le sabitti tampi lo pe seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Miphun tampi in na hna ṭuan hai sehla, Mi tampi na hmaiah kun hai seh. Na sungkhat pawl ih tlunah lal na si pei ih, Na unau ih tesinfa pawl cu na hmaiah kun hai seh. A lo camsiattu cu camsiat si ve hai sehla, A lo thluasuahtu cu thlawsuah si ve hai seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutiih a pa Isaak in thlawsuah a pek ṭheh hnuah Jakob cu a suak. Cu ṭheh vete in a ramtawihnak in Esau cu a ra tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Anih khal in rawl thawthaw a suang ih a pa ih hnenah a hei keng. “Ka pa, zaangfahte in to awla, na fapa ih ka rak kenmi sa cu ei in thlawsuah i pe hram aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Isaak cun, “Zoso na si?” ti ah a sut. Anih in, “Na fa upa Esau ka si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutikah Isaak cu a pumpuluk hnin koin a thir thlohthlo ih, “Cuti asile sa a kap ih ka hnenih a rak kengtu cu zoso a si? Na rat hlante-ah ka rak ei zo. A neta bik ka thlawsuahnak cu amah ka pe zo ih amah ih ta kumkhua in a si zo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Esau in cumi a theih tikah, ninghangin napi in a ṭap ruangro; “Ka pa, na thlawsuahnak i pe ve aw,” ti ah a ṭap phah in a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Asinain Isaak in, “Na naupa a ra ih i bum a si. Na thlawsuahnak a co thluh zo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Esau in, “Atu hi a voihnih i bumnak a si. Jakob tiih an kawh hi a dik a si. A hmaisaah fatir ka sinak i long zo; atu-ah ka thlawsuahnak i long fawn. Ka hrangah thlawsuahnak ziangtetal na nei nawn lo maw?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cutikah Isaak in, “Amah cu na tlunah lal ah ka tuah zo ih a sungkhat pawl tiangin a hnaṭuantu dingah ka tuah thluh zo. Rawl le sabitti khal ka pe thluh zo. Ziang so na hrangah a taang nawn pei? ka fa,” ti ah Esau cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain Esau in a dil hrih thotho. “Maw ka pa, thlawsuahnak pakhat lawng maw si na neih? Kei khal i thlawsuah ve hram ko aw,” ti ah a ti ih Esau cu napi in a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cutikah Isaak in, “Na hrangah lei le ram ṭha a um nawn lo, Na leiram hrangah vanih daifiim khal a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Na hriamnam rinsan in na nung pei ih, Na naupa ih siahhlawh na si pei. Sikhalsehla ral na tho asile, A lo uknak sungin na suak ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A pa in Esau co dingmi thluasuahnak cu Jakob a pek thluh ruangah Esau in Jakob cu a hua ih, “Ka pa hi rei a nung nawn lo ding; a thih hnuah Jakob cu ka that tengteng pam ding,” ti ah a thinlungte in a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Asinain Esau ih tummi cu Rebekah in a thei ih Jakob cu a ko. “Ngaihnik, na u Esau in lehrul a tum ih nangmah lo thah a tum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cu a si ruangah, ka fapa, ka lo sim vekin tuah aw. Zamrang in na tim tuah awla Haran khua ih ka ṭapa Laban hnenah tlan aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Na upa ih thinhengnak a reh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />a hnenih na thil tuahmi pawl a hngilh thluh hlantiang na pu hnenah va um aw. Cuih hnuah mi pakhatkhat ka thlah pei ih ka lo kirter leh ding. Ziangah so ni khat sungah ka fapa pahnih hloral ding cu ka sian ding?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cule Rebekah in Isaak hnenah, “Esau ih ṭhitmi hnamdang nupi pawl hi ka ning tuk ih ka khop tuk zo. Hi vek Hit phun nunau Jakob in a ṭhi ve tla a si ahcun kei cu ka thih ah a ṭha sawn ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Isaak in Jakob cu a ko ih a thluasuah hnuah, “Kanaan nunau cu na ṭhi lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tim tuah awla Mesopotamia ram, na nuih pa Bethuel ih inn ah va feh aw. Cutawkih nunau, na pu Laban ih fanu pakhatkhat va ṭhi aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ziangkimtithei Pathian in nan ṭhit awknak cu lo thlawsuah hramsehla faate tampi nei in miphun tampiih pa ah lo canter hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in Abraham a thlawsuah zo vekin nangmah le na tesinfa pawl cu lo thlawsuah hram seh; Pathian in Abraham hnenih a pekmi na umnak ram hi co hram aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Isaak in Jakob cu Mesopotamia ram Aram mi Bethuel ih fapa Laban hnenah a thlah. Laban cu Jakob le Esau ih nu Rebekah ih ṭapa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Isaak in Jakob cu a thluasuah ih nupi va ṭhi dingah Mesopotamia ramah a thlah ti kha Esau in a thei. Cuih tlunah a pa in Jakob a thluasuah tikah Kanaan mi nunau cu ṭhi lo dingin a kham ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakob in a nu le a pa ih thu a ngai ruangah Mesopotamia ramah a feh a si ti khal a thei fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah a pa Isaak in Kanaan nunau cu a duh lo ti cu Esau in fiangtein a thei ngah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah Abraham ih fapa Ishmael hnenah Esau cu a feh ih, a neih ciami a nupi pawl ih tlunah, a dang pakhat Ishmael ih fanu, Nebaiothih farnu, Mahalath a ṭhit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun Jakob cu Beer-sheba in a suak ih Haran lamah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hmun pakhat ah a thleng ih ni a tlak zo ruangah cutawkah a riak. Lungto pakhat lukhamah a hmang ih a it.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule a mangah leilung in van a banmi kailawn saupi a hmu. Pathian ih vancungmi pawl tla cu cuih kailawn parah an ṭum an kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun Bawipa cu a kiangah a ding. Cutikah Bawipa in, “Keimah cu Abraham le Isaak ih Pathian Bawipa ka si. Na ihnak hmun le ram hi nangmah le na tesinfa pawl ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Na tesinfa pawl cu leilung parih leivut zat an si ding. An ram cu nisuah nitlak, saklam le thlanglam ah an kauh vivo ding. Nangmah le na tesinfa pawl ka lo thlawsuah bangtuk in leilung tlunih miphun hmuahhmuah in thlawsuah in dil ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na hnenah ka um ding; na fehnak kipah ka lo humhim ding ih hi ramah ka lo kirter sal ding. Ka lo tiammi hmuahhmuah hi ka kimter thluh hlan lo ka lo tanta hrimhrim lo ding, ti cu ciing ringring aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob cu a ṭhang ih, “ Bawipa cu hi hmun ah a um nan homaw thei loih ka rak um,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun Jakob cu a thin a phang ih, “Ziangtluk rapthlakza hmun so a si. Vancung kotka le Bawipa ih inn ngaingai a rak sihi!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitte in Jakob cu a tho ih lukhamih a hmanmi lungto cu a lak hnuah hngilhlonak lungphunah a phun. Cule hriak a toih ih Pathian hnenah a ap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob in a cuih hmun cu Bethel ti ah hmin a sak. A hlanah cun a cuih khua cu Luz ti ah an ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Jakob in Bawipa Pathian hnenah, “Ka hnenah na um ih ka fehnak lamzinah i humhim ih ei ding rawl le hruk ding hnipuan i pek ih tlunah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ka pa ih inn ah himdamte in ka thlen sal thei a si ahcun Bawipa nangmah cu ka Pathian ngaingai na si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hi ka phunmi hngilhlonak lungphun hi Pathian nangmah ih inn a si ding ih i pekmi hmuahhmuah sung ihsin ṭhenhra-ih ṭhenkhat ka lo pe tengteng ding,” ti ah thukam-awhnak a tuah.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Jakob cu a pok sal ih nisuahlam mi pawl ih ram lamah cun a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule rin lopi in hramlakih tikhur pakhat ah a va thleng ih a kiangkapah tuurual rual thum an bok kha a hmu. Cuih tikhur ihsin tuu pawl cu tidai an inter ṭheu. Tikhursin lungpher cu a tum ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuu hmuahhmuah an thlen kim tikah tuukhal pawl in lungpherpi cu an ṭhawn ih an tuu pawl cu ti an inter ṭheu. An in ṭheh hnuah tikhur cu an sin sal ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob in an hnenah, “Rualle uh, khuitawk in nan ra?” ti ah a sut ih annih in, “Haran khua in,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Nahor ih fapa Laban nan thei maw?” ti ah a suh tikah, “Asi, kan thei,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“A dam maw?” tiih a suh sal tikah, “Asi, a dam; zohhnik, a fanu Rachel cu a pa ih tuurual thawn a rat khi!” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule Jakob in, “Ni a saanglai ih tuu pawl tlun a cu hrih lo hrangah ziangah so nan tuu pawl ti tulh in nan tlanter sal lo?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Annih in, “Cuticun a si lo ding; tuurual pawl an thlen kim tikah lungpherpi hi kan ṭhawn hmaisa ding; cuih hnu lawngah ti kan ṭul ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutiih Jakob le tuukhal pawl an biak-awk rero laifangah Rachel cu a pa ih tuurual thawn a ra thleng. A pa ih tuukhal cu amah Rachel cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun a pu Laban ih tuurual thawn Rachel a rat cu Jakob in a hmuh tikah tikhur ah a va feh ih lungpherpi cu a ṭhawn ih, a nu ih ṭa-pa, a pu Laban ih tuurual cu tidai a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Rachel cu a hnam ih aw-ring in a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hnenah, “Na pa ih farnu Rebekah ih fapa ka si,” ti ah a sim. Cutikah Rachel cu zamrangin a tlan ih a pa a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A pa Laban cu a tupa Jakob ih thuhla a theih tikah hmuak dingah a tlan ih a ton tikah a pom ih a hnam. Cule a inn ah a hruai. Cun Jakob in a thuhla hmuahhmuah cu a pu Laban hnenah kimtein a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Laban in, “Ka thi le ka sa ngaingai na si,” ti ah a ti. Cutiin Jakob cu a pu hnenah thla khat pum a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Laban in Jakob hnenah, “Ka sungkhat na si ruangah a lakin ka hna na ṭuan rero ding cu a cang thei lo. Ziangzat so hlawhman ka lo pek ding?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A pu Laban cu fanu pahnih a nei; a fanu upa deuh ih hmin cu Leah a si ih a nauta deuh cu Rachel a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Leah cu a mit a mawi; Rachel cu a ruangrai a ṭha ih a hmel khal a ṭha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakob in Rachel cu a duh ruangah a pu Laban hnenah, “Na fanu nauta Rachel co dingah na hna kum sarih sung ka ṭuan ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cutikah Laban in, “A rem ko ding, ka hnenah um aw. Midang hnenih ka fanu umter hnakin na hnenih umter ka duh sawn lo maw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Curuangah Jakob cu Rachel co dingah kum sarih sung hna a ṭuan; asinain Rachel a duhzet ruangah kum sarih cu caan tawite vekin a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cule Jakob in Laban hnenah, “Kan ni tiammi a kim zo ih ka nupi si dingah na fanu cu i ṭhiter thlang aw,” ti ah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuhrangah Laban in ṭhit awknak puai a tuah sak ih an khuasung mi zatein an sawm ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain cuih zanah Rachel si loin Leah sawn cu a pa in Jakob hnenah a pek ih Jakob in Leah cu a ihpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Laban in a fanu Leah kilkhawitu dingah a salnu Zilpah cu Leah hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A thaizing lawngah Leah a si ti kha Jakob in a thei. Cutikah Jakob in Laban cu, “Ka parah zianghrangah hivek na tuah? Rachel co dingah na hna ka ṭuan a si lo maw? Ziangah so hiti in i bum?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cule Laban in, “Kan ramah fanu upa pasal neih hlanah fanu nauta sawn pasal neih daan a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A dang kum sarih sung ka hna na ṭuan hrih ding asile mopuai zarh khat sung hi hngak awla Rachel cu ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cumi cu Jakob a lung a kim ih zarh khat sung ṭhit awknak puai a cem tikah Laban in a fanu Rachel cu Jakob ih nupi dingah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Rachel kilkhawitu dingah a salnu Bilhah khal Rachel hnenah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cun Jakob in Rachel khal cu a ihpi ih Rachel cu Leah hnakin a duh sawn. Cuticun Laban ih hna ṭuan in a dang kum sarih a um sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakob in Leah cu a duh deuh lo ti kha Bawipa Pathian ih a hmuh tikah faate a neihter, asinain Rachel cu fa nei loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leah cu fa a vun ih fapa a hring. Cule, “ Bawipa in ka zonzaih zia a hmu zo; atu cu ka pasal in i duh thlang ding,” ti ah a ti ih a fapa hminah Reuben ti ah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cun fa a vun sal ih fapa a nei. Cule Leah in, “Pasal ih duh lomi ka si hi Bawipa in i thei; curuangah fapa i pe a si,” a ti ih a fapa hmin ah Simeon a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Fa a vun sal ih fapa a nei lala. Cutikah, “Fapa pathum ka hrin zo ruangah ka pasal cu ka hnenah a kop deuh thlang ding,” ti ah a ti ih a fapa hmin ah Levi a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cuih hnuah fa a vun sal lala ih fapa dang pakhat a nei lala. “Atu cu Bawipa ka thangṭhat ding,” a ti ih a hminah Judah a sak. Cuih hnu cun faate a nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A pasal Jakob hrangih fa pakhat hman a hrin lo cu Rachel in a ruat tikah a u Leah cu a nahsiik zet. Jakob hnenah, “Faate i pe aw; culole ka thi ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob cu a thin a heng ih, “Pathian ih ai cu ziangtinso ka awh thei ding? Faate a lo neiterlotu cu amah Pathian a sisi!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Rachel in, “Asile ka hrangah faate a neih ih cuticun kei khal naute ih nu ka si ve theinak dingah hi ka salnu Bilhah thawn pawl aw uh,” ti ah Jakob cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cuticun Rachel in a salnu Bilhah cu a pasal hnenah a pek ih a pasal in Bilhah cu a ihpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bilhah cu nau a keng ih Jakob cu fapa a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah Rachel in, “Pathian cu keimah ih lam ṭangin thu a rel a si. Ka thlacamnak a thei ih fapa i pek,” ti ah a ti ih a hminah Dan a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a salnu Bilhah cu nau a keng sal ih Jakob ih fapa pahnihnak a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Rachel in, “Ka u neh dingah nasa zetin ka zuam ih ka neh suak a si,” ti ah a ti ih a hmin ah Naftali a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Leah khal in faate a neih sal lohli lo kha a theih awk tikah a salnu Zilpah cu Jakob ih ihpi dingah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cule Zilpah cun fapa a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah Leah in, “Ka van a ṭha a si,” a ti ih a hminah Gad a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leah ih salnu Zilpah in fapa a nei sal ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Leah cun, “Ziangtluk in so ka lung a awi. Atu cun nunau hmuahhmuah in mi lungawi ti ah in ko ding,” a ti ih a hminah Asher a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule sangvut lak caanah Reuben cu hramlakah a feh ih lengai rah a hmu ih a nu Leah hnenah a pek. Cutikah Rachel in Leah cu, “Na fapa ih rak kenmi lengai rah cu malte in i ṭhen ve aw,” ti ah a dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asinain Leah cun, “Ka pasal i lon hi tawk na ti lo maw? Ka fapa ih lengai rah khal maw a lak hrih na tum?” ti ah a ti. Cule Rachel in, “Na fapa ih lengai rah i pek asile tuihzan cu Jakob hnenah na it ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuih zanlam ah Jakob cu hramlak in a rung tlun tikah Leah cun a va hmuak ih a hnenah, “Tuihzan cu ka hnenah na ih a ṭul, ziangahtile ka fapa ih lengai rah in Rachel hnen ihsin ka lo saang a si,” ti ah a ti. Cutiin cuihzan cu Leah thawn an pawl aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cule Pathian in Leah ih thlacamnak cu a theih hrangah fa a vun ih Jakob cu fapa panganak a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Leah cun, “Ka salnu cu ka pasal hnenih ka pek ruangah Pathian in ka laksawng i pek zo a si,” ti ah a ti. Cuhrangah a fapa cu Issakhar ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leah cu fa a vun lala ih fapa a paruknak a hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Leah cun, “Pathian in laksawng sunglawi i pek. Fapa paruk ka hrin zo hrangah atu cun ka pasal in i duh thlang ding,” ti ah a ti. Cuhrangah a fapa hminah Jebulun a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cuih hnuah fanu pakhat a nei ih a hminah Dinah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain Pathian in Rachel cu a hngilh lo. A thlacamnak a thei ih fa nei thei dingin a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Rachel cu fa a vun ih fapa a hring. Cutikah, “Faate nei thei loih ka ningzahnak cu Pathian in i lak sak zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian in fapa dang i pe hrih hram seh,” ti ah a ti ih a hminah Josef a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josef suah hnuah Jakob in Laban hnenah, “I thlah thlang aw, ka khua le ka ram ah kir ka duh thlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka nupi pawl le ka faate pawl tla cu i pe awla ka tlung ding; anmah co duh ah ziangtlukin na hna ṭhatein ka ṭuan ti cu na thei ko,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cutikah Laban in, “Thusimnak tikcu i pe hram aw! Nangmah ka hnenih na um ruangah Bawipa in thlawsuah vanluh i pek ih ka ṭhangso tihi tinzohnak in ka thei a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cuti a si ruangah na hlawhman i sim awla ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Jakob cun, “Ziangtluk in na hna ka ṭuan ih na ṭilva pawl ka khalh sungah ziangtlukin an pungzai ti cu na thei thluh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na hnenih ka thlen pekte ih malte lawng na neihmi atu-ah siar cawk lo an si thlang. Keimah ruangah Bawipa cun thlawsuah vanluh a lo pe taktak a si. Atu cu keimah ih hrang ka ruah caan a si ve thlang,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah Laban cun, “Cuti asile ziangso ka lo pek ding?” ti ah a sut. Jakob in, “Hlawhman zianghman ka duh lo. Ka lo ngenmi i pek ding asile na ṭilva pawl hi ka kilkhawi hrih ding. Ka lo ngen mi cu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />tuihsun ah na ṭilva pawl lakah ka vak ding ih tuu note a dummi hmuahhmuah le a ṭialmi tuu pohpoh ṭialcip ih a ṭialmi siseh, ṭialkau ih a ṭialmi siseh - ka lak ding. Cule a ṭialmi me pohpoh ṭialcip ih a ṭialmi siseh, ṭialkau ih a ṭialmi siseh - ka lak ding. Cuvial cu ka hlawhman ah ka duhmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cuticun ka fel le fel lo hmailamah na thei ding. Ka hlawhman cu na thei fel duh ih na zingzoi tikah tuu a dum lomi le me a ṭial lomi ka neih na hmuh asile a rukih rukmi a si ti ah na thei ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cutikah Laban in, “A ṭha a si, na sim vekin ka tuah pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Sikhalsehla acuih sun rori ah Laban cun mecang ṭialcip le ṭialkau ih a ṭialmi le mepi ṭialcip le ṭialkau ih a ṭialmi pohpoh, a si lole a raangin a ṭialmi hmuahhmuah le tuu a dummi hmuahhmuah tla a lak thluh ih a fapa pawl ih khalh dingin a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Jakob ih umnak ihsin ni thum ban ah a fehpi hai. Cun a taangmi Laban ih tuu le me pawl cu Jakob in a run khal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cule Jakob cun ṭhil, ṭhuang le hriang kungih a ṭeek pawl a lak ih a hawng a hrekin a hawk ih funghreu ṭial ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cuih funghreu ṭial pawl cu ṭilva pawl ih tidai innak tikuang sungah atung in ṭilva pawl hoih in a ret. Ziangah hiti in a ret tile tidai in dingih ṭilva pawl an rat tikah an pawl-awk ṭheu ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cuticun funghreu ṭial hmaiah me pawl cu an raih-aw vivo ih faate an hrinmi pawl cu a ṭialmi ṭialngaan, ṭialcip le ṭialkau mi - lawnglawng an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Cun Jakob in Laban ih tunu pawl cu a dan ih a pa thawn a dangah a ret; cu ṭheh in Jakob ih tuucang ṭial le a dum pawl thawn lawngin a pawl awkter. Cuticun Laban ih tuurual sung ihsin Jakob cun a tuurual kha a zaiter vivo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Cule ṭilva lakih a harhdammi le a cakmi an pawl-awk tikah fa ṭial an vun theinak dingah a funghreu ṭial pawl cu tikuang sungah an hmai hoih in a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Asinain ṭilva ṭawnṭai pawl an pawl-awk tikah funghreu ṭial cu a ret lo. Curuangah ṭilva ṭawnṭai pawl cu Laban ih ta ah an cang ih a cak deuh pawl hmuahhmuah cu Jakob ih ta ah an cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cutiin a rei hlanah Jakob cu milianzet ah a cang. Ṭilva tampi, salnu salpa le kalauk le laak tampi a nei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Voikhat cu Laban fapa pawl in, “Kan pa ih ta a si mi hmuahhmuah Jakob in a lak ṭheh a si. Kan pa ih neihmi a lak ruangah hiti in a lian a si,” ti ah an ti kha Jakob in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Laban cu a hlan bangtuk in a parah a mithmai a ṭha nawn lo ti kha Jakob in a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Bawipa in Jakob hnenah, “Na sungkhat le na laicin ih ramah kir thlang aw. Na hnenah ka um ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah ṭilva pawl a khalhnak hmunah amah ra tong dingin Rachel le Leah cu a cah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hnenah, “Nan pa ih mithmai cu ka parah a hlan bangtuk a si nawn lo tihi ka thei a si; asinain ka pa ih Pathian cu ka hnenah a um ringring ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thazaang neihmi hmuahhmuah thawn nan pa ih hna ka ṭuan cu nan pahnih in nan thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain nan pa in i bum ih ka hlawhman hi voi hra a ṭhin zo. Sikhalsehla ka parih siatsuahnak a thlenter ding cu Pathian in i siang lo a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nan pa Laban in, ‘A ṭialcipmi me pohpoh cu na hlawhman a si ding,’ i ti tikah me pohpoh in a ṭialcipmi faate an nei. Cule ‘A ṭialkaumi me pohpoh cu na hlawhman an si ding,’ i ti tikah me pohpoh in a ṭialkaumi faate an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian cun nan pa hnen ihsin ṭilva pawl kha a lak ih keimah i pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Cun ṭilva an hur caanah mang ka nei ih ka mangah mepi a pawltu mecang pohpoh cu ṭialngaanmi le ṭialcipmi le ṭialkaumi hlir an si kha ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Pathian ih vancungmi in ka mangah cun, ‘Jakob,’ ti ah i ko ih, ‘Hinah ka um!’ ti ah ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cule vancungmi cun, ‘Zohhnik, mepi a pawltu mecang pohpoh cu ṭialngaan le ṭialcip le ṭialkau hlir an si. Hitiih cang dingin keimah ih tuahmi a si. Ziangahtile na parah Laban ih thil a tuahzia ka hmu thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keimah cu hriak toih in hngilhlonak lung na phun ih thu na kamnak Bethel ah na hnenih a rak langmi Pathian ka si. Atu cu na tim tuah awla hi ram hi taan in na suahnak khua le ramah kir thlang aw,’ i ti,” ti ah a sim hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Rachel le Leah in, “Kan pa hnen ihsin kan co ding ro zianghman a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kannih tla cu ramdangmi tlukah in ruat ko lo maw? Kannih cu in zuar ih kan manih a ngahmi paisa hmuahhmuah cu a hmang thluh zo fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian in kan pa hnen ihsin a lakmi lennak hmuahhmuah cu kanmah le kan faate pawl ih ta a si zo. Curuangah Pathian ih a lo sim bangtuk in tuah ko aw,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Jakob cu Kanaan ramih a pa hnen feh dingah a tim a tuah thluh. A nupi le a faate pawl cu kalauk a toter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ṭilva hmuahhmuah cu hmaiah a fehter ih Mesopotamia ram a um sungih a ngahmi thilri hmuahhmuah thawn a pok.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Laban cu a tuu pawl ih hmul met dingah a feh ih a um lo sungah Rachel in a pa ih innsang biakmi milem pawl a rak ruk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aram mi Laban cu Jakob in a bum ih a fehnak ding thu cu sim lotein a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A neihmi hmuahhmuah a keng ih a tlan. Cawl loin a feh ih Eufrates tiva a tan ih Gilead tlang lamah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nithum hnuah Jakob a tlan a si ti ah Laban an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Laban in a hnenum pawl a ko ih Jakob cu ni sarih sung an dawi ih Gilead tlang ah an man.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cuih zanah Laban ih mangah Pathian a lang ih a hnenah, “Ralring aw, Jakob cu ziangti hmanin hringhro cetci hlah,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Laban in a hei man tikah Jakob cu tlang parah riahbuk a rak sak zo; Laban khal Gilead tlang ah riahbuk a sak ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Laban in Jakob hnenah, “Zianghrangah i bum ih ka fanu pawl ral kaihmi nunau bangih na tlanpi?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zianghrangah i bum ih keimah sim loin a thupte in na rak tlan ziar? I rak sim cila, na feh tikah khan lungawinak le hlasaknak thawn khuang le dar le ṭingṭang tum phahin ka lo thlah ding a sisi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka fanu pawl le ka tule pawl hman i hnamterta lo. Na tuahmi hi aat-thlakza thil ṭha lo zet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangmah siatsuah theinak cu ka nei ve ko; asinain mizanah na pa ih Pathian in, ‘Ralring aw, Jakob cu ziangti hmanin hringhro cetci hlah,’ ti ah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tlannak hi na pa ih inn zamrangih thlen na duhtuk ruangah a si ti ka thei ko. Sikhalsehla zianghrangah ka milem pawl tla na rak fir?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob in, “Na fanu pawl hi an duh na loin i long pang ding ti ka phan ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Sikhalsehla kan sungte lakih pakhatkhat parah na milem na hmu asile amah cu thah a si pei. Kan milai pawl hi thu theihpitu an si pei ih, hawl awla na ta a si mi pohpoh cu lak aw,” ti ah a ti. Rachel in a pa ih milem pawl a rak ru ti kha Jakob in a thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutikah Laban cu Jakob ih riahbuk sungah a lut ih a hawl; cuih hnuah Leah ih riahbuk sungah a feh; cuih hnuah an salnu pahnihte ih riahbuk sungah a lut lala. Asinain a milem pawl cu a hmu lo. A neta bikah Rachel ih riahbuk sungah a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Rachel cun innsang milem pawl cu a rak lak ih kalauk phurhmi dip sungah a khum ih a rak toh-nen. Laban cun riahbuk pumpuluk in a hawl naón a hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cutikah Rachel in a pa ih hnenah, “Na rung luh ih ka din lo hi bawipa na thinheng hram hlah aw; nunau daan ka neih laifang a si,” ti ah a ti. Cuticun Laban in a hawl rero naón a innsang milem pawl cu a hmu thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob cu a ai a thok ih thinheng zetin Laban cu, “Ziang mawhnak so ka neih ih ziangvek daan ka tisiat ruangah so hiti ih i dawi ih i hawl ciamco?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ka thilri zatein na zoh thluh zo; na ta a si mi ziangtal na hmu maw? Na hmuh asile na sungkhat le ka sungkhat hmaiah hin suah hnik; zo kan dik sawn ti kha relcat hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Na hnenah kum kul sung rori ka um ih cuhmuah ka um sungah na tuu le na me voikhat hman an fa a siat dah lo; na tuurual sung ihsin tuucang pakhatte hman ka ei hrih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Sahrang in na tuu a deh tikah keimah sualnak a si lo ti langter duh in a sa na hnenah ka rak keng dah lo, a ai-ah keimahte in ka rak ruul mai ringring sawn. Sun ah siseh, zanah siseh, rukru pawl in an ru asile na kuan pei i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Voi tamzet sunih niling ka tuar ih zanih khawsik khal ka tuar. Ka it thei dah lem lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kum kul khengte na hnenih ka um sung hmuahhmuah cutiin ka rak tuar cuahco a si. Na fanu pahnih hrangah kum hleili na hna ka ṭuan; na tuuruun pawl kum ruk sung ka khal. Cucing hmanin ka hlawhman voi sawmsahra na ṭhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ka pa ih Pathian, Abraham ih Pathian le Isaak ih biakmi Pathian ka hnenah um hlah sehla ka kut lawngin i dawihlo zo ding. Asinain Pathian in ka hnaṭuanmi le ka zonzaihnak a hmuh ruangah mizanah a lo kawk a si kha!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Cule Laban in, “Hi nunau pawl hi keimah ih fanu an si; na faale pawl khal hi keimah ih faale an si ih ṭilva rual khal hi keimah ih ta hlir an si. Na hmuh mi pohpoh hi ka ta an si thluh. Asinain tuih hnuah cun hi ka fanu pawl le an faale pawl hrangah zianghman ka tuah thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Curuangah ra awla thukamnak kan tuah sawn pei ih hminsinnakah lungdawl kan tuah pei,” ti ah Jakob cu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Curuangah Jakob in lungpher pakhat a lak ih hngilhlonak lung a phun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Cule a hnenum pawl cu lungto peng dingin a fial. Lungto cu an peng ih an lungpen kiangah cun rawl an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cuih lungpen cu Laban in Jegar Sahadutha ti ah hmin a sak ih Jakob in Galeed ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Laban in, “Hi lungpen cu nangmah le keimah karlakah thutheitu a si ding,” ti ah a ti. Cutiin cuih hmun cu Galeed ti ah an tita.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Cule Laban in, “Kan ṭhen-awk tikah Bawipa in kan umnak fingfingah in kilkhawi hram seh,” ti ah a ti. Curuangah cuih hmun cu Mizpah ti ah hmin an sak lala.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Laban cun Jakob hnenah, “Ka fanu pawl na tisiat hai ih, nupi dang tla na ṭhit le keimah ih ka theih lo hmanah Pathian in in hmu ringring ti thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hitawk ah kan pahnih karlakah hngilhlonak lungphun le lungpen tla an um ti na hmuh ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Hi lungpen le hngilhlonak lungphun cu kan thutheitu an si ding. Nangmah do dingah hi lungpen hi ka lan lo pei ih, nang khal in keimah do dingah hi lungpen, a si lole hi lungphun hi na lan lo pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Abraham ih Pathian le Nahor ih Pathian cu kan karlakih thureltu a si ding,” ti ah a ti. Cutikah Jakob cun a pa Isaak ih biakmi Pathian hmin in siatcam in thu a kam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Cule Jakob in ṭilva pakhat a that ih tlangpar ah thawinak a pek. A sungkhat pawl a ko ṭheh ih zanriah an ei tlang hnuah tlangpar ahcun an riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitah Laban cu a tho ih a fasuan pawl le a fanu pawl a hnamta ih thlaza a camta hnuah a khua lamah a kir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob cu a pok sal ih lamzinah Pathian ih vancungmi pawl in an rak tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob in a hmuh tikah, “Pathian ih ralkap pawl an si,” ti ah a ti. Curuangah cuih hmun cu Mahanaim ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Jakob cun Edom ram Seir an timi hmunih a um mi a u-pa Esau tong dingin mi a hei thlah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thlahmi pawl hnenah, “Ka bawipa Esau hnenah ṭihzahnak thawn na siahhlawh keimah Jakob in thu ka lo cah a si. Laban hnenah kum reipi ka um ih atu lawngah ka ra kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Caw le laak pawl, tuu le me pawl le salnu le salpa ka nei a si. Ka u nangmah mithmai ṭha co thei dingah hiti in thu ka lo cahnak a si,” ti ah va sim dingin a tirh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thlahmi an ra kir tikah Jakob hnenah, “Na u Esau hnenah kan va feh ih amah cu nangmah tong dingin a ra pok zo. Minung zali thawn an ra,” ti ah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Jakob cun a ṭih ih a thin a phang thlohthlo. Curuangah a hnenih ummi a milai pawl le tuu le me pawl, caw le kalauk pawl cu bur hnih ah a ṭhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ziangah cutiin a ṭhen tile, “Esau in bur khat pawl a thah khalle a dang bur khat tal cu an luat na hman maw!” tiih a ruah ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob cu thla a cam ih, “Maw Pathian, ka pu Abraham le ka pa Isaak ih Pathian, i ngai hram aw. Bawipa , nangmah in, ‘Na khua le na sungkhat hnenah kir sal awla na hrangah na lamzin ka tluangter ding,’ i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei na salpa hnenih na thlentermi na zaangfahnak le rinsantlak na sinak hi a cotu si dingah malte hman ka tlak lo. Zianghman nei loin kianghrol pakhat lawng thawn Jordan tiva ka rak tan; atu-ah cun minung le ṭilva bur hnih thawn ka ra kir sal zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah ka u Esau ih kutsung ihsin, maw Bawipa , i run hram aw. Ka u Esau a ra ding ih nunau le nauhak hman zuah loin in that thluh pang ding ti ka phang tuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />‘Na lamzin ka tluangter ding ih tesinfa tampi ka lo pe ding; na tesinfa pawl cu tifinriat kapih vunnel zat in an tam ding ih siarcawk lo an si ding,’ ti ah thu i kammi kha vun mangsal hram aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutawkih zan khat a riak hnuah, a u Esau laksawng pe dingin a neihmi sung ihsin a tanglam pawl a hril.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mepi zahnih le mecang kul, tuupi zahnih le tuucang kul,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />hnawisawr mi kalauk sawmthum le an faate ciar, cawpi sawmli le cawcang pahra, laakpi kul le laakcang pahra tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ṭilva phun khat cu hnenum pakhat ciar a kilter ih an hnenah, “Ka hmaiah feh uhla bur khat le bur khat cu hlat aw nawn in feh uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmaisa bikih a fehtupa hnenah, “Ka u Esau in a lo tong ih, ‘Na bawipa zo a si? Khuiah na feh ding? Na hmaiih ṭilva pawl neitu zo a si?’ tiih a lo sut tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />‘Hi ṭilva pawl cu na siahhlawh Jakob ih ta an si ih a bawipa nangmah Esau hrangah laksawng a lo pekmi an si. Amah Jakob cu kan dungte-ah a ra lai,’ na rak ti pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hmaisa bik pa hnenih a ti bangtuk in pahnihnak, pathumnak le an zate hnen khalah bangrep in thu a pek. “Esau nan ton tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Asi, na salpa Jakob cu kan dungte-ah a ra lai,’ ti ah nan rak ti pei,” ti ah a ti. Jakob cun ka hmaiih ka fehtermi laksawng in a thinlung cu ka nemter deuh ding ih ka ton ngaingai tikah i ngaithiam thei men ding, ti ah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A laksawng pawl hmaiah a fehter ih amah cu cuihzan cu a riahbuk ah a riak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A cuih zan zankhuathim ah Jakob cu a tho ih a nupi pahnih le a nusun pahnih le a faate hleikhat thawn Jabbok tiva an tan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A innsangmi pawl tiva ralih a hruai thluh hnuah a neihmi dang hmuahhmuah khal tiva ralah a hei ṭhawn thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amah lawng a rung taang. Cuih zanah mi pakhat in Jakob cu zing khuavang zik tiang a rung buan ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jakob a neh thei lo ti kha a buantu pa in a theih tikah, Jakob ih khel kha a sawh in a sawh ih, an buan-awk rero laiah cun Jakob ih khel hlikhlok a pelh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah mi pa in, “I thlah aw, khua a van zik thlang hi!” ti ah a ti. Sikhalsehla Jakob cun, “I thlawsuah lo ahcun ka lo thlah lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule mi pa in, “Na hmin zoso a si?” ti ah a sut ih Jakob in, “Jakob ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cule mi pa in, “Atu thok ihsin na hmin cu Jakob a si nawn lo pei. Milai thawn siseh, Pathian thawn siseh nan tawng aw ih na neh ruangah na hmin cu Israel ti a si pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob in, “Na hmin i sim hram aw,” ti ah a dil. Anih in, “Ziangah so ka hmin i suh?” ti ah a ti ih cuih hnuah Jakob cu thluasuah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Jakob cun, “Pathian cu hmaiton tein ka tong zo; asinain ka nung lai a si,” ti ah a ti ih acuih hmun cu Peniel ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Peniel ihsin a pawh zawng ah ni a hung suak cerco. Jakob cu a ke a bai; ziangahtile a khelruh a pelh ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Curuangah tuih san tiangin Israel ih tesinfa pawl cun sakhel hlikhlok parih satit ei loin an run iikta; ziangahtile Jakob ih khel sawhpelhnak a rak ton ruangah a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob in Esau cu milai zali thawn an rat kha a hmuh tikah a faate pawl cu Leah, Rachel le a nusun pahnih hnenah a ṭhendarh thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nusun pahnih le an faate pawl cu hmaisabik ah a ret; a sangtu ah Leah le a faate pawl a ret ih neta bikah Rachel le Josef a ret hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah Jakob cu an hmaiah a feh ih voi sarih tiang a hmai leilung dai in a lu a kuun hnuah a u hnenah a va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Esau in Jakob a hmuh tikah tong dingah a va tlan ih Jakob cu a pom; a hngawng in a kuah ih a hnam. Cule an pahnih in an ṭaptlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cule Esau cu khuadang a tang ih nunau le nauhak pawl a hmu. “Na hnenih nunau le nauhak pawl hi zoso an si?” ti ah a sut. Cutikah Jakob in, “Na siahhlawhpa keimah hi Pathian in i zaangfah ih i pekmi faale pawl an si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun a nusun le an faate pawl an ra ih upat pe in an lu an kuun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Leah le a faate pawl an ra kuun; cule a neta bikah Josef le Rachel an ra ih an lu an ra kuun ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Esau in, “Ṭilva rual ka rak ton zomi kha ziang sullam so a si?” ti ah a sut. Jakob in, “Bawipa, na hmaiṭha ka co theinak dingah an si,” ti ah a hun ti tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Esau in, “Ka duhzat cu ka nei ve ko, ka naupa; na ta pawl kha cu nangmah in nei ko aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Jakob cun, “Cuticun a si lo pei; na mithmaiṭha i coter a si ahcun ka laksawng cu na sang hram pei. Atu cu ka parah na thinlung tluangzet in a um ih ka hrangah na mithmai hmuh cu Pathian ih mithmai hmuh bangtuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zaangfahte in na hrangih ka rak kenmi laksawng cu co hram aw; Pathian in i zaangfah ih ka ṭulmi pohpoh cu i pek a si,” ti ah a ti. Cutiin Esau ih a san hlan lo a hneek zok rero. Cule Esau cun a saang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Esau in, “Kan tim kan tuah pei ih kan feh pei. Keimah in hmai ka lo hruai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Asinain Jakob in, “Bawipa, kan faale pawl hi an nauhak tuk lai hrih ti cu na thei ko; cule kan tuu le kan caw pawl tla ka ruah a ṭul fawn; hnawifawp lai hlir an si. A khaaltu pawl in ni khatah hlat tuk an dawi a si ahcun an thi thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Curuangah bawipa, nang hmaiah rak feh sung aw; Seir ramih na hnen ka thlen tiang, rannung le nauhak pawl an feh thei tawkin ka hun lo dawi ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Esau in, “Cuti asile na hnenah ka milai pawl a hrekin ka taanta pei,” ti ah a ti. Asinain Jakob cun, “Na thuruah thiamnak parah ka lung a awi, bawipa, sikhalsehla an taan a ṭul lem lo ding,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuhrangah Esau cu Seir ramah cuih ni ah a kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jakob cu a pok ih Sukkoth ah a feh. Cutawkah amah ih hrangah inn a sak ih a rannung hrangah deu a suang. Curuangah cuih hmun cu Sukkoth ti ah hmin an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jakob cu Mesopotamia ram ihsin a kir tikah Kanaan ram Shekhem khua himdamte in a thleng. Shekhem khua pawnah a puan inn cu a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A cuih hmun cu Shekhem ih pa Hamor ih tefa pawl hnen ihsin ngun tangka zakhat in a lei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutawkah biakṭheng a don ih a hmin ah El, Israel ih Pathian, ti ah a sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leah thawn an hrinmi Jakob ih fanu Dinah cu cuih ramih nunau pawl hnenah a va leng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cuih ramih lal a si mi Hiv mi Hamor ih fapa Shekhem in Dinah cu a hmuh tikah a kaihrem ih a duh naloin a sualpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cule Dinah ih tlun lawngah a thinlung a taap ih a duhzet fawn hrangah a leem ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule a pa Hamor hnenah, “Hi falanu hi ka nupi dingah i biak sak aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob in a fanu Dinah cu a thang an siatter zo ti a thei naón a fapa pawl hramlakah caw khal in an um hrangah an ra tlun hlan cu zianghman ti loin a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Shekhem ih pa Hamor cu Jakob bia dingin a feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakob ih fapa pawl hramlak ihsin an ra thlen caan fangah a va thleng ve. An farnu an sualpi ti thu le Shekhem in hi bangtuk thil borhhlawh le ningzakza a tuah ruangah Israel miphun a hmuhsuam ih a nautat ti thu pawl an theih tikah an ai a thok ih an thin a ling.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Hamor in an hnenah, “Ka fapa Shekhem in nan fanu cu a duhzet ruangah a ṭhit theinak dingah zaangfah hram uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ṭhit awknak in rual kan kai aw pei. Nan fanu pawl kan ṭhi pei ih nannih khal in kan fanu pawl nan ṭhi ve pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cuticun kan hnenah kan ram sungah nan um pei ih hnangamte in nan duhnak pohpoh ah nan um ding. Thilri nan nei ding ih nan duhduh in sum nan tuah pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Shekhem in Dinah ih pa le ṭapa pawl hnenah, “Nan mithmaiṭha i coter hram uh; nan duhmi hmuahhmuah ka lo pe ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ziang laksawng so nan duh, i sim uh; nan farnu man cu nan duhzat ngen uh; in ṭhitter siang a si ahcun nan dilmi pohpoh ka lo pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob ih fapa pawl cun, Shekhem in Dinah a thangsiatter zo ruangah, an leemsiah ih an thu cu an zom buum ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />an hnenah, “Serhtan lomi cu kan farnu kan pasalter thei lo; neihter kan siang tibang sehla kan hrangah ziangtluk ningzakza so a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kanmah bangtuk in mipa pohpoh serh nan tan thluh lawngah kan lung a kim thei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cuti a si lawngah kan fala pawl nan ṭhi thei ding ih kannih khal in nan fala pawl kan ṭhi ve ding. Nanmah lakah khua kan sa ding ih nanmah thawn miphun pakhat ah kan cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asinain kan thu nan pom thei lo ih serh nan tan lo a si ahcun kan farnu cu kan lak ding ih kan feh ko ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutiin Jakob fapa pawl ih thu cu Hamor le a fapa Shekhem cun thil remcaangzet ah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuhrangah Shekhem cun rei lote-ah an sim vekin a tuah ṭheh. Ziangahtile Jakob ih fanu cu a duh ngaingai ruangah a si. Shekhem cu a sungte lakah mi ih hmaizah bikmi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hamor le a fapa Shekhem cu an tlung ih an khuasuah ah an khawpi pawl thawn an tongkhawm-aw ih an hnenah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Jakob le a sungkhat pawl thawn kan rem-aw zet ko; kan ramah hin kan hnenah um ve ko hai sehla, an duhnak poh ah tlangleng hai seh. Anmah ih hrang daih in kan ram khal a kau pam a si. An fanu pawl kan ṭhi pei ih annih khal in kan fanu pawl ṭhi ve hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sikhalsehla anmah bangtuk ih mipa hmuahhmuah serh kan tan ṭheh lawngah kan hnenah um in kanmah thawn miphun khat si ding cu an lung a kim ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuti a si lawngah an ṭilva, an thilri le an cawrual pawl cu kan ta ah an cang ding. Curuangah kanmah lakih an um theinak ding cu tuah ve uhsi,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah khuasungmi hmuahhmuah in Hamor le Shekhem ih thu cu an zom ih khuasungih mipa hmuahhmuah cu serh an tan ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cuticun ni thumnak a kim ih an serhtannak a besiat laifangah, Jakob ih fapa pahnih, Dinah ih ṭapa Simeon le Levi cu ralnam kengin khuasungah zohmanih theihthiam lo dingin an lut ih an mipa hmuahhmuah cu an that ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hamor le a fapa Shekhem khal an lu an tan ih an farnu Dinah cu Shekhem innsung ihsin an lak ih an tlanpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih tlunah Jakob ih fapa dang pawl in an farnu an thangsiatter zomi ningna in hriamhmapu mi pawl khal an that suak thluh lawlaw ih khuasungih thilri hmuahhmuah tiangin an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuu siseh, caw siseh, laak siseh, khuasung le lo ih an neihmi tiangin fai koin an lak ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An sumsaw le an hlawnthil, innsangih khuasaknak thilri hmuahhmuah tiangin an lak ih nunau le nauhak khal an kaih ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob in a fapa Simeon le Levi hnenah, “Harsatnak sungah in thlenter zo; hi ram sungih a ummi Kanaan mi le Periz mi pawl in in hua thlang ding. Kei le milai tampi nei ka si lo. Annih pawl hmun khatah an ṭan ih in do a si ahcun kan zatein kan ci in mit rori ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Asinain annih in, “Kan farnu cu hlawhhlang nunau ah maw an tuah ding?” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian in Jakob hnenah, “Na tim tuah in Bethel ah feh awla va um aw. Na u Esau hnen ihsin na tlan laiih na hnenih a langmi Pathian hrangah biakṭheng don aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob in a sungkhat le a hnenih a ummi hmuahhmuah hnenah, “Ram dang khawzing lem nan neihmi hmuahhmuah cu hlon ṭheh thlang uh; thianghlimter-aw uhla hnipuan thiang hruk uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi hmun hin kan suak pei ih Bethel ah kan feh pei. Cutawkah ka thlaphan laiih ka thla i rak ngamtertu le ka vahvaihnak kipih i umpitu Pathian hrangah biakṭheng ka don ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Curuangah ram dang khawzing lem an neihmi le an khaih laimi hnakhai pawl an lak ih Jakob hnenah an pek. Jakob in Shekhem khuakiangih a ummi sasua kung hnuai ah cu pawl cu a phumta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob le a fapa pawl cutawk ihsin an suah tikah a kiangkapih khuasungmi pawl cun an khua siksem suakin an ṭih hai ruangah Jakob le a fapa pawl cu zohman in an dungin an dawi ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An feh vivo ih an milai pawl thawn Kanaan ram Luz khua (Bethel timi khua) an thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutawkah biakṭheng a don ih a u hnen ihsin a tlan laiih Pathian a hnenih a langnak a si ruangah cu hmun cu Pathian hrangah tiin El-Bethel ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Rebekah umtu Deborah a thi ih Bethel ihsin thlanglam ih a ummi sasua kung hnuai ah an phum. Curuangah acuih thingkung cu, “Allon Bacuth” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakob cu Mesopotamia ram ihsin a kir tikah Pathian cu a hnenah a lang sal ih thluasuah vanluh a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hnenah, “Na hmin cu Jakob a si, sikhalsehla atu thokin Israel na si thlang ding,” ti ah a ti. Curuangah amah cu Israel ti ah kawh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Pathian in a hnenah, “Keimah cu Ziangkimtithei Pathian ka si. Faate tampi nei in ci tampi na thlah ding ih a hrekkhat cu siangpahrang tla an si ding. Na tesinfa pawl cu an tamzet ding ih miphun tampi-ah an cang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham le Isaak hnenih ka pekmi ram cu nangmah hnenah ka lo pe ding; cule na hnu ih na tesinfa pawl hnen khalah ka pe ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutiih an biak awknak hmunah cun Jakob cu Pathian in a taanta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutawkah Jakob in hngilhlonak lungphun a phun ih in thawinak hrangah sabitti a burh hnuah hriak a toih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutawk hmun cu Bethel ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bethel ihsin an ṭhawn ih Efrath khua an thlen hlan deuhte-ah Rachel cu a nithla a kim ih a nauneih pumnat cu a besia zet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Culaifang ah nau dongtu in, “Phang hlah aw, mipa a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain Rachel cu a thi; a thihzik a hnuk a cah zawng ah a fapa cu Ben-oni ti ah hmin a sakta. Asinain a pa in Benjamin ti ah a ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rachel cu a thi ih atuih Bethlehem timi Efrath lamzinah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule Jakob in a thlaan ah hngilhlonak lung a phun ih, “Rachel lungphun,” ti a si ih cumi cu atu tiangin a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Jakob cu a feh vivo ih Eder lungdawlih ralah riahbuk a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Jakob cutawkih a um laiah, a pa ih nupisun Bilhah cu Reuben in a sualpi. Cumi cu a pa Jakob in a theih tikah a thin a heng ngaingai. Jakob cu fapa hleihnih a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A nupi Leah thawn an hrinmi fapa cu upa bikah Reuben, cun Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issakhar le Zebulun an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rachel thawn an hrinmi fapa cu Josef le Benjamin an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rachel ih salnu Bilhah thawn an hrinmi fapa cu Dan le Naftali an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cun Leah ih salnu Zilpah thawn an hrinmi fapa cu Gad le Asher an si. Hi fapa pawl cu Jakob in Mesopotamia ih a hrinmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Abraham le Isaak an umnak Mamre khua ah a pa Isaak hnenah Jakob cu a thleng. (Mamre cu Kiriath Arba a si lole Hebron ti tla in an ko.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isaak cu tarkuun in a nung ih kum za le sawmriat a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule a fapa Esau le Jakob in an phum.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Esau ih tesinfa pawl cu a hnuailam bangtuk in an si. (Esau cu Edom ti tla-in an ko.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Esau cu Kanaan nunau pawl nupi ah a nei. Hit mi Elon ih fanu Adah, Hiv mi Zibeon ih fapa Anah ih fanu Oholibamah, le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ishmael ih fanu Nebaioth ih farnu Basemath tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Esau ih nupi Adah in Elifas a hring; Basemath in Reuel a hring ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Oholibamah in Jeush, Jalam le Korah a nei. Hi pawl cu Esau in Kanaan ramih a neihmi fapa pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Esau in a nupi pawl, a fanu le a fapa pawl, a sungkhat pawl le a cawrual le Kanaan ram a um sungih a neihmi hmuahhmuah a lak ih a nau Jakob thawn an umtlangnak ihsin a ṭhawn ih hmun dangah a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ziangah a ceer tile Jakob thawn an umnak loram in a daih hai lo ruangah a si. Ṭilva tamtuk an nei ih curuangah hmun khatah an umtlang thei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Esau cu a feh ih tlangpar ram Seir ah a um. Esau cu Edom ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Edom miphun ih pa Esau cu tlangpar ram Seir ahcun a um ih tesinfa tampi a nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Esau ih fapa pawl cu Adah ih hrinmi Elifas le Basemath ih hrinmi Reuel tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Elifas ih fapa panga pawl cu Teman, Omar, Zefo, Gatam, le Kenas an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Esau fapa Elifas ih nusun pakhat cu Timna a si ih amah in Amalek a hring. Hi pawl cu Esau nupi Adah ih faate pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Reuel ih fapa pali pawl cu Nahath, Zerah, Shammah le Mizzah tla an si. Hi pawl cu Esau nupi Basemath ih faate pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cule Zibeon ih fapa Anah fanu Esau ih nupi Oholibamah in fapa pathum a neihmi tla cu Jeush, Jalam le Korah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Esau ih tesinfa sung ihsin cithlahtu pawl cu hihi an si. Esau ih fapa upa bik Elifas ih fapa pawl cu Teman, Omar, Zefo, Kenas,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Korah, Gatam le Amalek an si. Edom ramih Elifas sungsuak ih cithlahtu pawl cu hihi an si. Anmah tla cu Adah ih tesinfa pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Esau ih fapa Reuel ih hrinmi fapa, cithlahtu pawl cu Nahath, Zerah, Shammah, le Mizzah tla an si. Edom ramih Reuel sungsuak ih cithlahtu pawl cu anmah hi an si. Anmah tla cu Esau nupi Basemath ih tesinfa pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun Esau nupi Oholibamah ih fapa, cithlahtu pawl cu Jeush, Jalam le Korah tla an si. Anmah cu Anah ih fanu Esau ih nupi Oholibamah ih hrinmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi pawl cu Esau ih tesinfa, Edom ih phunhnam tla an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hihi Hor miphun Seir ih fapa pawl, a ramih rak um ciami an si. Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer le Dishan tla an si. Annih cu Edom ramih ummi Seir fapa an si ih Hor miphun ih cithlahtu pawl an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lotan ih fapa cu Hori le Heman an si. Timna cu Lotan ih farnu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Shobal ih fapa pawl cu Alvan, Manahath, Ebal, Shefo le Onam an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Zibeon ih fapa pahnih tla cu Aiah le Anah an si. Hi Anah cu a pa Zibeon ih laak pawl a khalh laiah ramcaar lakih cirhti hlum a hmu suaktu kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anah ih faale pawl cu Dishon le a fanu Oholibamah an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Dishon ih fapa pawl cu Hemdan, Eshban, Ithran le Kheran an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ezer ih fapa pawl cu Bilhan, Zaavan le Akan an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dishan ih fapa cu Uz le Aran an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Hor miphun ih cithlahtu pawl cu Lotan, Shobal, Zibeon, Anah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Dishon, Ezer le Dishan tla an si. Anmah cu Seir ramah Hor miphun pawl ih cithlahtu an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Israel siangpahrang pawl in an uk hlanih Edom ram a uktu siangpahrang pawl cu hihi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Beor fapa Bela in Edom ram a uk ih a khawpi hmin cu Dinhabah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bela cu a thi ih a ai ah Bozrah khuami Zerah ih fapa Jobab in Edom ram cu a run uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jobab a thi ih a ai ah Teman miphun pawl ih ram sungih ummi Husham in a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Husham cu a thi ih a ai ah, Moab ramih Median mi a nehtu Bedad ih fapa Hadad in a uk. A khawpi hmin cu Avith a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hadad cu a thi ih a ai ah Masrekah khua ih Samlah in a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Samlah cu a thi ih a ai ah Eufrates tiva kap Rehoboth khuami Shaul in a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Shaul cu a thi ih a ai ah Akbor ih fapa Baal Hanan in a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cun Akbor ih fapa Baal Hanan cu a thi ih a ai ah Hadad in a uk. A khawpi hmin cu Pau a si. A nupi hmin cu Mehetabel a si ih Matred ih fanu a si. Matred cu Mezahab ih fanu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hi pawl cu an hnam le an umnak khua ciarih lal an si ih Esau ih tesinfa pawl an si: Timna, Alvah, Jetheth,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Oholibamah, Elah, Pinon,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Magdiel le Iram an si. Anmah tla cu an umnak ciarah ram neitu le lal an si ih Edom ram sungah hotu an si. Edom miphun ih pa cu Esau a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob cu a pa umnak Kanaan ramah a umta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob ih innsang thuanthu cu hi vekin a si. Josef cu tlangval no kum hleisarih a si ih a pa ih nusun Bilhah le Zilpah ih fapa pawl, a ule pawl hnenah tuu le me a khal ve ṭheu. A ule pawl ih thiltuah sualmi pawl cu a pa a sim ṭheu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josef cu a pa Jakob in a tar hnu ih a neihmi a si ruangah a fapa dang hnakin a duh cuang. Curuangah angki saupi baanfual a ṭhit sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cutiih an pa in Josef a duh deuh cu a ule pawl in an hmuh tikah Josef cu an hua ih awkaa ṭha-in an biak hrimhrim dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Voikhat ah Josef cu mang a man ih a mang cu a ule hnenah a sim. A mang a sim tikah a ule cun an hua sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An hnenah, “Ka mang cu ngaihnik uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mangah lo ah kan zatein kan feh ih sangvut kan teel ciamco; cutikah ka sangvut teel cu a tho ih dingzetin a ding. Cule nan sangvut teel pawl cu ka sangvut teel ih kimvelah an ding ih an kuun,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah a u le pawl cun, “Kan tlunah siangpahrang si dingin le thunei dingah na ruat-aw maw si?” ti ah an sut. Cun a mang a sim ruangah a ule pawl cun an huat a luar sinsin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Josef cun mang a man lala ih a u le hnenah, “Mang ka man ih ka mangah ni le thlapi le arsi hleikhat cu ka hmaiah an kuun ka hmu,” ti ah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mang cu a pa le a ule hnenah a sim ih a pa in, “Ziangvek mang ngelcel so na man? Na nu le na unau pawl le keimah tiangin na hmaiah ra in kan kuun ding maw si?” ti ah a kawk ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A u le pawl cun an nahsiik ngaingai. Asinain a pa cun acuih thuhla pawl cu a thinlungte-ah a ret ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Josef ule pawl cu an pa ih ṭilva khal dingah Shekhem ah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule a pa Jakob in Josef hnenah, “Na ule pawl cu Shekhem ah ka ṭilva an khal. Na tim tuah awla an hnenah ka lo thlah ding,” ti ah a ti. Josef cun, “Ka tim aw thluh zo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa in a hnenah, “Va feh awla na ule pawl le ṭilva pawl an himdam maw va zoh aw. Ra kir sal awla an thuhla i ra sim sal aw,” ti ah a ti. Cuhrangah a pa in Josef cu Hebron phairawn ihsin a hei tirh. Cutiin Josef cu Shekhem a thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />mipa pakhat in hramlakih a vah rero kha a hmu. “Ziang so na hawl rero?” ti ah Josef cu a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Ka ule pawl ka hawl a si; ṭilva khuitawkah so an khalh, i sim hram aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cupa cun, “Hi tawkah an um nawn lo. Dothan ah kan feh ding an ti cu ka theita,” ti ah a ti. Curuangah Josef cu Dothan ah a feh ih a ule pawl hnenah a va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ule pawl in an hnen a ra thlen hlan a hlatpi in an rak hmu. Cuvete in thusia an ruatkhawm ih amah that dingin thu an phiar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Mang man pa a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Rahnik uh, kan that pei ih a ruak cu hi tikhur caar pakhatkhatah kan hlon pei. Sahrang in a deh a si kan ti leh ding. Cule a mang pawl ziangtin a cang kan zohhnik pei,” ti ah pakhat le pakhat an ti aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutiin an ti cu Reuben in a thei ih Josef cu hum a tum. Reuben in, “A thah lawmmam cu that hlah uhsi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef cu that hram hlah uh. Hi ramṭhing lakih tikhur caar sungah hin thla uh. Asinain amah cu tuahmawh hlah uh,” ti ah a ti. Himtein a humsuak a si ahcun a pa hnenih kuat kir leh dingin Reuben ih tummi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef cu a ule hnen a thlen ngaingai tikah a angkifual baansau cu an hlit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An kaihrem ih tikhur caar sungah an thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Rawl an ei laiah khualtlawng mi ruunkhat Ishmael mi pawl Gilead ihsin Izipt ram pan ih an feh kha rin lopi-ah an hmu. An kalauk pawl cun pazuksi, thingthling le masala pawl an phur.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cutikah Judah in a unau pawl hnenah, “Kan naupa kan thah ih laithat kan sinak cu kan thup khalle kan hrangah ziangso a ṭhahnem?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi Ishmael mi pawl hnenah kan zuar sawn pei. Cutiih kan zuar asile amah kan tuahmawh a ṭul lem lo; thu ngai ih kan ti asile kan nau a si ih kan thii le kan sa a si,” ti ah a ti. Cutiih a timi cu a unau dang pawl khal an lung a kim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cun Midian mi sumtuah pawl an ra thlen tikah tikhur sung ihsin Josef cu an suah ih Ishmael mi hnenah ngun tangka kul ah an zuar. Cuticun Ishmael mi in Josef cu Izipt ramah an hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Reuben in tikhur sung cu a zoh ih Josef a hmuh lo tikah a ning a hang ih a riahsiatnak langter dingah a hnipuan a thlek thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cule a unau hnenah a kir ih, “Kan naupa tikhur sungah a um nawn lo. Ziangtin so kan ti ding?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cun a unau pawl cun me an that ih Josef ih korfualpi cu me thisen sungah an hnim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cule korfualpi cu an pa ih hnenah an keng ih, “Hihi kan hmu, na fapa ta a si maw, zohhnik?” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cutikah an pa in Josef ih korfualpi a si kha a thei lohli ih, “A si, amah ih ta a si! Sahrang in maw a deh zo! Josef cu thlekbauh thluh zo a si cu!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Jakob cu a hnipuan a thlek ih a riahsiatnak langter dingah buri a hruk ih reipi mithi ngai in a um cuahco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A fapa le a fanu pawl an ra ih an ra hneem rero; asinain an hneem thei cuang lo. “Amah hnen mithi khua ih ka thlen ve lai hlan lo, ka fapa ngai in ka um ding,” ti ah a ti. Curuangah a fapa Josef ngai in nitin a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cule Josef cu Midian mi pawl in Izipt ramah an fehpi ih Izipt siangpahrang ih inn kiltu ralbawipa Potifar hnenah an zuar.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cuih caanah Judah cun a unau pawl a taanta ih Adullam khuami Hirah hnenah a vung um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cutawkah Kanaan mipa Shua ih fanu a hmu ih a nupi ah a ṭhit.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nupi cu fa a vun ih fapa a hring ih a hminah Er a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A nupi cu fa a vun sal ih fapa a hring lala ih a hminah Onan a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A nupi in fapa a hring lala ih a hminah Shelah a sak. A nupi ih Shelah a hrin laiah Judah cu Khezib khua ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Judah in a fapa upa bik Er cu nupi a holh ih a nupi hmin cu Tamar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Asinain Er cu Bawipa hmaiah misiava a si ruangah Bawipa in a nunnak a cemter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cutikah Judah in Onan hnenah, “Na u-ih nupi cu ihpi awla na u in tesinfa a neih theinak dingah a pasal ih unau na si bangtuk in na ṭuanvo cu kimter aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Asinain faate a neih khalle amah ih tefa an si lo ding ti kha Onan in a thei. Curuangah a u-ih nupi thawn an pawl-awk tinin a u-ih hrangah faate seem thei lo dingin a ci cu leilungah a tlakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A nuncan cu Bawipa ih lungkimmi a si lo hrangah Bawipa in a nunnak a cemter ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cule Judah in a fapa ih nupi Tamar hnenah, “Ka fapa Shelah a ṭhan ih tlangval a si hlan cu na pa ih inn ah va kir hrih awla nuhmei in va um hrih aw,” ti ah a ti. Hitiih a tinak cu a ule pahnih an thih vekin Shelah khal a thi ve pang ding ti a phan ruangah a si. Curuangah Tamar cu a pa ih inn ah a kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Caan a hung rei deuh tikah Shua ih fanu, Judah ih nupi cu a thi. A mithi ngai a reh tikah a tuurual pawl ih hmul an mehnak Timnah khua ah a rualpi Adullam khuami Hirah thawn an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule Tamar hnenah, “Na pasal ih pa cu a tuu pawl hmulmet dingah Timnah ah a feh a si,” ti ah mi in an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cuhrangah a hruk ringringmi nuhmei hnipuan cu a phoih ih hmaihuhnak puanpaate in a hmai a hup ih, Timnah lamzinih a ummi Enaim khuasung luhnak ah a to. Shelah cu a tlangval zo naón amah cu Shelah hrangah ṭhit an tum lo ti kha Tamar in a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Judah in Tamar cu a hmu ih a hmai a huh awk ruangah hlawhhlang a si ti ah a ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hnenah lamzin kapah a va feh ih, “Ra awla kan ittlang ding,” ti ah a ti. A fapa ih nupi a si kha a thei lo. Cutikah Tamar in, “Ziang so i pek ding?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah in, “Ka ṭilva sung ihsin me note pakhat ka lo kuat ding,” ti ah a ti. Tamar in, “Na run kuat hlan tiang thutiamkamnak i pekta a si ahcun na sim vekin si ko seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Judah in, “Ziang so thutiamkamnak ah ka lo pek ding?” ti ah a suh tikah, Tamar in, “Na hminkhennak le a hridai le atuih na kenmi na kianghrol i pe aw,” ti ah a ti. A ti vekin a pek. Cun an pawl-aw ih Tamar cu fa a vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tamar cu a tho ih inn ah a feh. A hmaihuhnak puan cu a phoih ih a nuhmei hnipuan a hruk sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Judah cun a thutiamkamnak thil va tlen sal dingah Adullam khuami a rualpipa cu me note pakhat thawn Tamar hnenah a hei tirh; asinain Tamar cu a va hmu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kiangkapih mi pawl cu, “Enaim lamzin kiangih a ummi hlawhhlangnu kha khuiah so a si?” ti ah a suh tikah annih in, “Cutawkah hlawhhlangnu a um dah lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuhrangah Judah hnenah a kir ih, “Nunau nu ka tong lo; a kiangkap mi pawl in, ‘Cutawkah hlawhhlangnu a um dah lo,’ an ti,” ti ah a sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Judah in, “A hnenih ka thilri pawl cu lak sal tum nawn hlah; mual kan pho pang ding. Na va tong thei lo naón me note ka kuat ngaingai cu a tawk zo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thla thum hnuah Judah cu, “Na fapa ih nupi Tamar cu hlawhhlang a ṭuan ih midang thawn fasawn a vun zo,” ti ah mi in an sim. Cutikah Judah in, “Khawsung ihsin suah uhla mei in ur that uh,” ti ah thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tamar cu an suah ih an hruai laiah a pasal ih pa Judah hnenah thu a cah ih, “Hi thilri a neitupa ih fa ka vun a si; hi thilri hi zo ih ta so a si, zohhnik uh; hminkhennak le a hridai le kianghrol an si hi,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cumi cu Judah in a theih tikah, “Hi nu hi midik a si ih keimah sawn misual ka si. Ka fapa Shelah hrangah ṭhi zo ding ka rak si naón,” ti ah a ti. Cuih hnu cun Tamar cu a ihpi nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cun a nithla a kim tikah faphir a ken kha an thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A pum a na ih culaiah a fa pakhat in a kut pakhat a run suah. Cutikah nau dongtu in a ngel ah pat hrisen a rak khih ih, “Hihi suak hmasa a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Asinain a kut cu a dirhsal ih a dang pakhat sawn hmaisa-ah a suak. Cutikah nau dongtu in, “Nangmah riangri maw a rung suak hmaisa,” ti ah a ti. Cuhrangah a hmin ah Perez an sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a unau a suak ih a kutih patsen khihmi a si. A hmin ah Zerah an sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef cu Ishmael mi pawl in Izipt ram an thlenpi ih Izipt siangpahrang ih inn kiltu bawi Izipt mi Potifar hnenah an zuar.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipa cu Josef hnenah a um ih a hrangah ziang hmuahhmuah a tluang thluh. Josef cu Izipt mi a bawipa ih inn ah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Bawipa Pathian cu Josef hnenah a um ih a thil tuahmi hmuahhmuahah a hlawhtling ti cu a bawipa in a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef ih ziaza Potifar in a zoh tikah a lung a kim ngaingai ih a innsungsang le a neihmi hmuahhmuah kilkhawitu-ah a tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A cuih thok ihsin Josef ruangah Izipt mi pa ih inn cu Pathian in thluasuah a pek. A inn sungih a neihmi le a lo sungih a ummi tla Bawipa in a thluasuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Potifar in a neihmi hmuahhmuah cu Josef kutah a ret ṭheh ih a eimi rawl siar lo zianghman a ruah ṭulmi a um lo. Josef cu a ruangrai a ṭhazet ih a piangzet fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Caan a rei deuh tikah a bawipa ih nupi in Josef cu sualpi duhnak mit in a zoh ringring. Voikhat ah a bawipa ih nupi in, “Ka hnenah ra it aw,” ti ah Josef cu a leem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asinain Josef cun a el ih a hnenah, “Keimah hitawk ih ka um ruangah ka bawipa in hi innsungsang thuhla pawl zianghman a helhkam ṭul loin a um. A neihmi hmuahhmuah kilkhawitu-ah i tuah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hi innsungah amah tlukin thu ka nei ih a nupi nangmah siar lo a dang zianghman ka hrangah uimi a nei lo. Cuti a si hrangah ziangtinso cutluk thilsia ka tuah ding ih Pathian hmaiah ka sual ding?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Josef cu a bawipa ih nupi in nitinte a leem rero naón a thu a ngai dah lo ih voikhatte hman a ihpi dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Asinain ni khatah Josef cu innsung hnaṭuan ṭuan dingah a lut ih midang zohman inn sungah an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah a bawinu cun Josef cu a angki in a kai ih, “Ka hnenah it aw,” ti ah a ti. Asinain Josef cu lengah a tlansuak ih a angki cu a bawinu ih kutah a taangta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Josef in a angki a taanta ih innsung ihsin a tlanhlo ti a hmuh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a bawinu cun a innsangih hnenum pawl a ko ih, “Zohhnik uh; ka pasal in hi Hebru pa hi kan innsangah a rak hruai; asinain atu-ah in hmuhsuam a si. Ka khaan sungah a rung lut ih amah thawn ittlang dingah i sawm; asinain ka au ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutiih ka au ruangah ka kiangah a kor taanta in a tlan ih lengah a suak a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef ih bawipa a thlen hlan lo a kor cu amah hnenah a ret ringring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pasal a thlen tikah cuih thu cu a sim. “Hebru salpa na hruai mi pa kha i hmuhsuam tum in ka khaan sungah a lut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Asinain ka au ruangah a tlanhlo ih a kor lawng ka kiangah a taanta,” ti ah a rak ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Josef ih bawipa cu a nupi in, “Na salpa in hiti in i tuah a si,” tiih a rak sim tikah a thin a heng ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Josef cu a kai ih siangpahrang ih thawngtla pawl an retnak thawnginn ah a ret. Cutawkah Josef cu thawng sungah a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla Bawipa Pathian cu Josef hnenah a um ih a zaangfah hrangah thawnginn uktu bawipa khal Josef parah zaangfahnak thinlung a neihter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Curuangah thawngtla pawl kilkhawitu-ah Josef cu a tuah ih thawnginn sungih thil a cangmi hmuahhmuah zohtu-ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Josef ih ṭuanvo lakmi pohpoh cu thawnginn uktu pa ih zohsal a ṭul nawn hrimhrim lo. Ziangahtile Bawipa Pathian cu Josef hnenah a um ih a thil tuahmi hmuahhmuahah hlawh a tlinter.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Caan a hung rei deuh tikah Izipt siangpahrang ih sabitti petu le sangtuah hotu in an bawipa cu a thin an hengter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Faro cu a hnaṭuantu pahnih parah a thin a heng ngaingai ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josef an retnak hmun, siangpahrang inn kiltu bawipa ih innah thawngah a thlak hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Siangpahrang inn kiltu bawi in Josef cu cuih thawngtla pahnihte hnenah a ret ih an hna a ṭuanter. Cutiin thawng sungah caan reipi an umtlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan khatah thawnginn ah Izipt siangpahrang ih sabitti petu le sangtuah hotu an pahnih in sullam neimi mang an man veve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zingpit ah Josef cu an hnenah a va feh ih an thinlung nuamlozet ih an um ngiongio kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josef in, “Zianghrangah tuih sun hi nan riah a siazet cuang?” ti ah a suh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />annih in, “Mang kan man veve ih kan mang in leh saktu hitawk ah zohman an um lo,” ti ah an ti. Cutikah Josef in, “Mang leh theinak cu Pathian ih pekmi a si. Nan mang cu i sim hnik uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah sabitti petu in a mang cu a sim ih, “Ka mangah sabit hri pakhat ka hmaiah ka hmu ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hnge pathum a nei. Sabit hnge pawl cu an cerh ih an cerhvete in a par an par ih a rah pawl tla an hmin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Faro ih hai ka keng ih sabit rah pawl cu ka lo ih hai sungah ka sawr. Cule Faro hnenah ka pek,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Atican cu hiti in a si: A hnge pathum cu ni thum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nithum sungah Faro in a lo thlah ding; a lo ngaithiam ding ih na hnaṭuanmi na ṭuan sal ding. Sabitti petu na rak si bangin sabit hai cu Faro hnenah na pe sal ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutiih na lamzin a tluan ṭheh tikah hi thawnginn ihsin i suah theinak dingah i hngilh hlah awla ka thuhla cu Faro hnenah rak sim hram aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thungai in kan ti asile, Hebru mi pawl ih ram ihsin rukmi ka si. Hitawk khalah thawng in thlak theinak dingah zianghman tuah sualmi ka nei lo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef ih mang a lehmi cu thuṭha lam a si kha sangtuah hotupa in a hmuh tikah, “Kei khal mang ka nei ve; ka mangah ka lu parah sang kho thum an um ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a tlunta bikih kho sungah Faro hrangih sang rawh mi a phunphun an um. Asinain cuih rawl pawl cu vate in an ei ciamco,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Atican cu hiti in a si: Kho pathum cu ni thum a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nithum ah Faro in a lo suah ding ih na lu a lo tan ding. Na ruak cu thingkung parah a thlai ding ih vate in na sa cu an ei ciamco ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cuvek ngaingai in ni thumnak ni, Faro suah camah, Faro in a kuthnuai-ih bawi pawl hmuahhmuah hrangah puai a tuah ih sabitti petupa le a sangtuah hotupa cu thawnginn ihsin a suah ih a bawi pawl hmaiah an rak hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sabitti petupa cu a hlanih a ṭuanmi hna a ṭuanter sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Asinain sangtuah hotupa cu a hngawng in a thlai ih a thi. Josef ih lehsakmi vek cekci in an mangih tican cu a kim ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Asinain sabitti petupa in Josef cu thei nawn loin a hngilhta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kum hnih a kim hnuah Faro in mang a man ih a mangah cun Nail tivapi kapah a ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tiva sung ihsin cawpi a thauzetmi le mawizetmi pasarih an hung suak ih hrampi note an hung ei hmuarhmo kha a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cuih hnuah cawpi dang pasarih, a ṭawl ṭenṭen le a mawi lozet, tiva sung ihsin an hung suak ih a hmaisa cawpi thau pasarih kiangah tiva kapah an hung ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cule cawpi ṭawl pasarih pawl in cawpi thau pasarih pawl cu an ei ṭheh. Cun Faro cu a ṭhang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cuih hnuah a itthat sal ih mang a man sal. A mangah fangcang kung pakhat ihsin a bor ṭhazet le ah a cuzet mi fangvui pasarih an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun nelrawn thli ih nuai siat reprepmi le a hivai sialsialmi fangvui pasarih an suak ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule a siazetmi fangvui in a borzetmi fangvui pasarih cu an dolh ṭheh. Cun Faro cu a hung ṭhang ih a mang a si kha a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thaizing cu a lung a nuam lo ngaingai ih Izipt ram sungih pol pawl le mifim hmuahhmuah a ko ṭheh. A mang cu a sim ṭheh hai naón a simfiang theitu zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah sabitti petupa in Faro hnenah, “Bawipa, ka mawh zia cu tuih sunah ka phuang ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hnaṭuantu pawl ih tlunah na thin a heng ih sangtuah hotupa le kei cu siangpahrang inn kiltu pawl hotu bawi ih inn ah thawng in thlak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zan khatah kan pahnih in mang kan man. Kan mang cu sullam nei veve an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Culai ah Hebru tlangval pakhat siangpahrang inn kiltu bawi ih hnenum pa cu kan hnenah a um ve ih kan mang pawl cu amah kan sim. Kan mang cu in lehsak ih a sullam in sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule a sim vek rori in a kim ṭheh; kei in ka hnaṭuan ka ṭuan sal ih sangtuah hotupa cu na that a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Josef cu a ko ih zamrangte in thawnginn ihsin a suah. Josef cu a meetfai-aw ih a hnipuan a thleng-awk hnuah Faro hmai ah a ra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in, “Mang ka nei ih zohman in an let thei lo. Nang cu mang an lo simmi fiangtein na let thei ti in sim,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef in, “Kei ih ti theimi a si lo; Pathian lawngin fiangtein a lo sim thei ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in, “Ka mangah Nail tiva kapah ka ding ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />tiva sung ihsin cawpi thauzet le mawizet pasarih an hung suak ih hrampi note an hung ei hmuarhmo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cuih hnuah cawpi dang pasarih, a ṭawl ṭenṭenzet ih ruh lawng a taangmi, tifiamfiam in an hung suak. Izipt ram pumpi sungah cuvek cawpi ṭawnṭai ka hmu dah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cule cawpi ṭawl pawl in cawpi thau pawl cu an ei ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sikhalsehla an ei ṭheh hnu khalah zohman in cawpi thau pasarih an ei ti ah an thei thei lo ding; a hlan vekin an ṭawl ṭenṭen thotho. Cutikah ka hung ṭhang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cun mang ka man lala ih ka mangah fangcang kung pakhat ihsin fangvui pasarih, a borzetmi le a cuzetmi an suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cuih hnuah nelrawn thli ih nuaisiat reprepmi, hivai sialsialin fangvui pasarih an hung suak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule fangvui siazet pawl in fangvui ṭhazet pasarih pawl cu an dolh ṭheh. Ka mang cu pol ka sim hai naón i lehsak theitu pakhat hman an um lo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in Faro hnenah, “Na mang pahnih ih sullam cu an bangrep a si. Pathian in a tuah tummi a lo theihternak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cawpi thau pasarih cu kum sarih a si ih fangvui ṭhazet pasarih khal cu kum sarih thotho a si. An sullam cu thuhmunkhat a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Neta-ih a hung suakmi cawpi ṭawl pasarih le nelrawn thli ih nuaisiatmi le a hivai sialsialmi fangvui pasarih cu paam kum kum sarih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka lo sim zo vekin Pathian in a tuah dingmi a lo hmuhnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Izipt ram sung hmuahhmuah ah paṭhat ngaingai kum kum sarih a um ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuih hnuah paam kum kum sarih a tlung ding ih Izipt ram sungih paṭhat kum hmuahhmuah cu hngilh thluh a si ding. Paam ruangah Izipt ram cu a siat thluh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Paṭhat caan cu zohman in an ciing nawn lo ding. Ziangahtile neta-ih a tlung dingmi paam caan cu a nasa ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na mang voihnih rori na mannak cu Pathian in hi thu cu a nemhnget zo ih rei lote-ah a thleng ding tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cu a si hrangah atu-ah mi pakhat, khuaruatthiam le mifim hril awla, Izipt ram pumpi ṭuanvo latu dingah ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ram sungih hnaṭuantu dingah hotu pawl tla ret awla, paṭhat kum kum sarih sungih neihmi rawl sung ihsin ṭhen nga-ih ṭhen khat khawlter aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hi rawl hmuahhmuah cu a ra dingmi paṭhat kum sungah khawm ṭheh hai seh. Nangmah ih thu in hna an ṭuan pei ih khawpi kipah rawl cu an khawl pei ih an kil pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hi rawl pawl cu paam kum kum sarih a ra thlen tikah Izipt ram sung minung pawl an thih ṭheh lonak dingah khawl ciami rawl a si ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Josef ih thusimmi cu Faro le a tlangsuak pawl an lung a kim tuk lawmmam ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Faro in, “Hi pa vekin Pathian thlarau-ih umpimi midang khui-ah so kan hmuh ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Cule Faro in Josef hnenah, “Pathian in hi thil hmuahhmuah hi a lo hmuh hrangah nangmah hnakin thil a theithiam sawn le a fim sawn zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Curuangah nangmah hi ka ram zohtu-ah ka lo tuah pei ih ka minung pawl in na thu an lo ngai ding. Siangpahrang ka sinak lawng hi ka lo hleihnak a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Atu ihsin Izipt ram pumpi uktu bawi ah ka lo tuah a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Cuṭheh in Faro in siangpahrang hmin khenmi zunghruk cu a phoih ih Josef ih zungah a hrukter; a mawi le a mankhungmi hnipuan in a thuam ih suiṭhi a hngawng ah a orhter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Siangpahrang tonak sangtu rangleng ah a toter ih amah kiltu ralkap pawl in a hmai ihsin, “Nan lu kun uh,” ti ah an au hluarhlo. Cuticun Izipt ram pumpi uktu bawi ah Josef cu a cang a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Cun Faro in Josef hnenah, “Keimah cu siangpahrang ka si; asinain nangmah ih thu loin Izipt ram sungah zohman an kutke an caangkhai thei lo ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Cule Josef cu Zafenath Paneah ti ah Izipt hmin a sak. Heliopolis khua ih puithiam Potifera ih fanu Asenath cu nupi ah a ṭhitsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Josef cu Izipt siangpahrang Faro ih hnaṭuan a thawh tikah kum sawmthum a si. A feh ih Izipt ram a kiil le a deng tiangin a tlawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Paṭhat kum kum sarih sungah rawl cu ei cawk loin an nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Paṭhat kum kum sarih sung rawl tamzet an neih sung hmuahhmuah Josef in Izipt ram sungih rawl cu a khawm ciamco ih khawpiih kipah a khawl. Khua kiangkapih lo rawl pawl cu a cuih khawsungah a khawl.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Rawl a khawlmi cu a tam ngaingai ih tifinriat ih vunnel a bang. A rawl khawlmi cu a tamtuk thlang hrangah a tah khal an tah nawn lo; ziangahtile tah cawk ding a si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Paam kum a thlen hlanah Josef cu, Heliopolis khua puithiam Potifera ih fanu, a nupi Asenath in fapa pahnih a hrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Josef in, “Ka zonzaihnak hmuahhmuah le ka pa ih innsang thu khal Pathian in i hngilhter zo,” ti ah a ti ih a fapa hmaisa cu Manasseh ti ah hmin a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Cun, “Harsat ka tonak ram ah Pathian in faate i pek,” a ti ih a fapa pahnihnak hminah Efraim a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Izipt ram sungih paṭhat kum kum sarih cu a rung cem ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Josef ih a rak sim cia bangtuk in paam kum cu a rung thleng ngaingai. Izipt ram lawng si loin ram dang hmuahhmuah khalah paam a tlung ve; asinain Izipt ram sungah cun khuazakipah rawl a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Izipt ram sung hmuahhmuahih paam a thlen tikah ram sung minung pawl in Faro hnenah rawl an dil. Cutikah Faro in, “Josef hnenah feh uhla a lo sim vekin tuah uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Izipt ram sungah paam cu a nasazet ih ram sungmi pawl rilrawng ih an um tikah Josef in rawl retnak innpi pawl cu a ong ih rawl cu Izipt mi hnenah a zorh ciamco hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Leilung tlun hmuahhmuahah paam cu nasazet ih a tlun ve ruangah mi hmuahhmuah cu pursum dingin Izipt ramah Josef hnenah an ra ciamco.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob in Izipt ramah rawl a um ti a theih tikah a fapa pawl hnenah, “Ziangah so hiti ih nan um men?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Izipt ramah rawl a um ti ka thei. Rawl loih kan thih thluh lonak dingah vung feh uhla rawl vung lei uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cubangin Josef ih unau pawl pahra cu Izipt ramah rawl lei dingah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Jakob cun Josef thawn nukhat hrin a si mi Benjamin cu a fehter lo. Ziangahtile tuahmawh a tong pang ding ti a phang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kanaan ram sungih paam a tlun ve ruangah mi dang vekin Jakob fapa pawl cu rawl lei dingah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Josef cu Izipt ram uktu bawi a si hrangah ramkip ihsin a rami mikip hnenah rawl a zuar. Cuhrangah Josef ih ule pawl khal Josef hmaiah an ra ih upatnak in an hmai leilung dai in an kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Josef in a hmuh tikah a ule an si kha a thei naón a thei lo vekin a umter-aw. Ṭonghrang zetin an hnenah, “Khuilaminso nan rat?” ti ah a sut. Annih in, “Rawl lei dingah Kanaan ram in kan ra,” ti ah an sawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josef cun a ule an si ti a thei naón annih cun an thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A mangih anmah ih thuhla a rak man tla a vun cing ih, “Nannih cu mi thlingthlatu nan si. Kan ramih ṭonṭaihnak zawn theih duh ah nan ra a si,” ti ah a ti hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Asinain annih cun, “Bawipa, kan si hrimhrim lo. Kannih na sal le pawl hi rawl lei ding lawngih ra kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan zatein unau rual kan si. Bawipa, mi dik kan si ko; mi thlingthlatu kan si hrimhrim lo,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Asinain Josef cun, “Asilo, kan ram derdainak thlingthlak duh ah nan ra a si ko,” a ti thotho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cule annih in, “Bawipa, kan zate cun unau hleihnih kan si ih Kanaan ramih um mi pakhat ih fapa kan si. Kan nau nauta bik cu atu-ah kan pa hnenah inn ah a um ih kan unau pakhat cu a thi zo,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Ka ti zo vekin nannih cu mi thlingthlatu nan si ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan si le si lo fianternak ah hiti in ka lo hniksak ding: Faro hmin in ka lo kam; nan nau nauta bik hitawk a rat lo ahcun nan tlung thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nanmah lak ihsin pakhatkhat in va hruai uh. Nan thu a fiang hlan lo a dang pawl cu thawngah ka lo thla ding. Cuti a si lole Faro hmin saal in ka sim: nannih cu thlingthlatu nan si tengteng,” ti ah a ti hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cuticun an unauza in ni thum sung thawngah a thlak hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni thumnak ni ah Josef in, “Pathian hmai ka zah ruangah hiti ih nan tuah asile thihnak in nan luat ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi dik nan si ngaingai ahcun atu nan umnak thawnginn ah pakhat cu nan taangta pei ih midang cu rilrawng in a ummi nan innsang hnenah nan leimi nan rawl thawn nan va tlung pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sikhalsehla nan simmi a dik le dik lo theihnak ah nan nau nauta bik ka hnenah nan rak hruai tengteng pei. Cuti nan tuah asile nan thi lo ding,” ti ah a ti. Cumi cu an unauza an lung a kimtlang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Anmah le anmah cu, “Kan naupa Josef, kha tiih kan rak ti kha kan mawh ngaingai a si. Harsatnak a tuar lai kan hmu ko ih i zaangfah hram uh ti ah in leem rero naón kan zaangfah duh lo. Cu ruangah a si atu hiti ih harsatnak kanmah kan tuar,” ti ah an ti-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Reuben in a unau pawl hnenah, “Kan naupa-ih tlunah zianghman thil ṭha lo tuah hlah uh, ka lo ti tho lo maw? Ka thu nan ngai duh lo. Atu-ah a thih man phulaknak kan tuar thlang a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutiih an ṭong cu Josef in a thei ṭheh; asinain annih cun in thei ṭheh ti an thei lo. Ziangahtile Josef thawn an biak-awk tikah ṭonglettu an hmang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cutikah Josef cu hmun dangah a va feh ih a va ṭap. A ṭah a baan tikah an hnenah a ra sal ih anmah ih lakin Simeon cu a vun dir ih an mithmuh rori-ah a ṭeemter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Josef in, “An dip khatión rawl than uh, an paisa cu an dip sung ciarah ret sal uhla lamzin hrang lamcaw ken uh,” ti ah thu a pek ih a thupek vekin a ule pawl parah an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A ule pawl cun an leimi rawl cu an laak parah an suang ih an tlung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cuih zan an riahnak ah an unau pakhat in a laak rawl pek dingin a dip cu vun ong khua a paisa cu a dip sung tlunta bikah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />“Ka paisa in khirh sal a si, ka dip sungah a um,” ti ah a au ih a unau pawl cu a sim. An lung a phang thluh ih thir rero in, “Pathian in kan parah ziang thil tak so a tuah hi?” ti ah pakhat le pakhat an sut-aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Kanaan ramih an pa Jakob hnen an thlen tikah an tonmi le an tuarmi hmuahhmuah cu an pa ih hnenah an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Izipt ram uktupa cu kan parah a ṭong a hrangzet ih thlingthlatu nan si, in ti ih sual in puh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />thlingthlatu kan si lo, midik zumtlakmi kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Pa pakhat ih fa unau hleihnih kan si ih kan nau pakhat cu a thi zo; nauta bik cu Kanaan ramah kan pa ih hnenah innah a um, ti ah kan sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Asinain acuih bawipa cun, zumtlakmi nan si le si lo ka theihnak ah ka hnenah pakhat cu nan taangta ding; a dang pawl cu rilrawng ih a ummi nan innsang hrangah rawl hei phurh uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Cule nan nau nauta bik nan rak hruai pei. Cuih hnu lawngah thlingthlatu si loin zumtlakmi nan si ti kha ka theih ngah hnuah nan unau pa ka thlah sal ding ih kan ram ah nan duhduh in thil nan zuar nan lei thei ding, ti ah in ti,” ti ah an pa an sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Cun an phurhmi rawl cu an suah tikah an dip sung ciarah an paisa cu an hmu ih an pafarual in an lung a phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Cutikah an pa Jakob in, “Faate pakhat loin maw in taan ding. Josef cu a thi zo; Simeon le a hlo zo fawn. Atu Benjamin a lak nan tum lala. Kei hi a tuartu bik ka si hi!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Cumi a theih tikah Reuben in, “Benjamin na hnenih ka kirpi sal lo asile ka fapa pahnih hi that hai aw. Benjamin cu ka kut sungah re ko awla ka rak kirpi tengteng ding,” ti ah a pa ih hnenah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Asinain a pa in, “Ka fapa cu ka thlah thei lo ding. A ule a thi zo ih atu amah lawng a taang. Lamzin ah tonlo a va tong pang ding. Cuvek riahsiatnak tuar thei ding ka si nawn lo; ka tar tuk zo ih ka thi ngaingai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kanaan ram ah paam cu a luar sinsin ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jakob ih sungte pawl cu Izipt ram ihsin an leimi rawl an ei ṭheh tikah Jakob in a fapa pawl hnenah, “Vung feh sal uhla kan hrangah rawl vung lei sal uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Judah in, “Nan naupa nan ratpi lo ahcun ka hmel hman in hmu thei lo ding, ti ah Izipt ramih bawipa in fiangtein ralrinnak in pe zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan naupa kan hnenih na fehter a si ahcun kan feh ding ih na hrangah rawl kan lei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na fehter siang lo a si ahcun kan feh lo ding. Ziangahtile cupa cun nan naupa nan rak hruai lo a si ahcun in tong thei lo ding, ti ah in ti zo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cutikah an pa Israel in, “Ziangtin so ka zawn maltetal ruat loin nau pakhat kan nei hrih ti tiangtiang cupa ih hnenah nan va sim?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cule a fapa pawl in, “Nan pa a nunglai maw? Unau dang nan nei maw? ti ah kanmah le kan innsang thuhla lawnglawng cupa cun in sut ih, let loin kan um thei fawn lo. Nan naupa nan rak hruai pei ti ah in ti ding ti cu kan rak ruat hrimhrim lo,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Judah in a pa ih hnenah, “Kan naupa cu keimah hnenah fehter aw. Kan tim kan tuah pei ih kan feh ding. Cutiih kan tuah lawngah nangmah siseh kan faate pawl le kanmah siseh kan zatein rilrawng thihnak in kan luat thei ding a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan naupa hrangah ka nunnak in ka kam a si; mawhphurh ding a um khalle keimah in ka phur ko pei. Na hnenah damte le himte ih ka kirpi lo a si ahcun ka nunsung hmuahhmuah na hmaiah mawhthluk ka tuar pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hitiin rei hlah uhsila Izipt ram ah feh in voihnih hman kan let man zo ding naón,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cutikah an pa in, “Cuti ding thotho a si ahcun hiti in tuah uh: Kan ramsung ihsin a suakmi lakih a ṭha bik pawl thingthling, khuaitizu, rimhmui, khumkhal le mekei rah maltete ciar keng uhla cupa cu laksawng vung pe uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nan dip sungih paisa nan hmuh salmi pawl tla cu nan khirh a ṭul ding hrangah paisa khal a let hnih in nan keng pei. Paisa an lo khirh cu an tisual a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nan tim tuah in nan naupa cu hruai uhla cupa ih hnenah cun fehpi uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nan unau pakhat pa le Benjamin cu nan hnenih an rakir sal theinak dingah Ziangkimtithei Pathian in cupa cu nan parah zaangfahnak thinlung neiter hram seh. Kei cu ka faate pawl hloral thluh ding hi ka tuar ding hrimhrim a si ahcun ka tuar a si ko pei cu,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuhrangah laksawng pawl an keng ih paisa khal a let hnih in an pai. An tim an tuah ih Izipt ram ahcun an feh. Benjamin khal an hruai ih Josef cu an va tong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An hnenih Benjamin a tel cu Josef in a hmuh tikah a hnenum pa hnenah, “Hi pawl hi ka inn sungah hruai hai aw; ṭilva pakhat that awla suang aw; ziangahtile tuih sunah keimah thawn rawl kan eitlang ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Josef ih a sim vekin a hnenum pa in a tuah ih a inn sungah a fehpi hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Josef inn an thlen tikah an thin a phang ngaingai. Ziangahtile, “Hmaisa rawl kan lei ṭumih kan paisa pawl kan dip sungih a um hrangah hitawk ah in thlenpi. Kan sual hawl in rin lopi in sal ah in kai men ding. Kan laak pawl tla in long thluh ding a si hi,” ti ah an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Curuangah Josef hnenum pa hnenah sangka kiangah an va feh ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Bawipa, rawl lei dingah hi tawk voikhat kan ra thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kan tlung ih lamzin kan riahnak ah kan dip sung kan zoh tikah rawl leinak man paisa kan pekmi kimtein kan dip sung tlunta bikah kan hmu fingfing. Cuih paisa cu atu-ah kan rak keng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule rawl lei saalnak ah paisa dang tla kan keng a si. Kan dip sungah zo in maw paisa a rak ret ti cu kan thei lo,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah Josef hnenum pa cun, “ṭih hlah uh, nan thin khal phang hlah uh. Nan Pathian le nan pa ih Pathian in paisa cu nan dip sungah a ret a si ding. Rawl man paisa kimtein ka ngah ko,” ti ah a ti. Cuih hnuah an hnenah Simeon a rak hruai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cule hnenum pa in an unau rual in Josef inn sungah a fehpi hai ih an ke kholhnakah tidai a pek ih an laak khal rawl a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sun ah Josef a ra ding ih anmah thawn rawl a ra ei ding ti an theih tikah an kenmi laksawng pawl an suah ih Josef pek dingah tiar ciain an ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Josef a ra thleng ngaingai ih laksawng an kenmi pawl cu a inn sungah cun an pek ih a hmaiah leilung dai in an kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Cule Josef in an thuhla cu kimteih a sut ṭheh hnuah, “Kan dung nan rat laiah a tarzet nan timi nan pa ih thuhla in sim. Atu ziangtin a um? A harh dam lai maw?” ti ah a sut hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Kan pa, na siahhlawh, cu a dam lai a si,” ti ah an ti hnuah an khuk an bil ih a hmaiah an kun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cule Josef in a nau Benjamin a hmuh tikah, “A thuhla in sim reromi nan nauta bik pa cu amah hi maw a si?” a ti ih, “Pathian in thlawsuah lo pe seh, ka fapa!” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cuti a ti hnuah Josef cu hmakhatte-ah a khaan sungah a lut, ziangahtile a nau a hmuh sal tikah a lung a hno. A suup-awk thei lo ruangah a khaan sungah cun a feh ih a ṭap ciamco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A hmai a phiah-awk hnu ah a ra suak ih a lunghnomi suup-aw phah in, “Rawl tuah uh,” ti ah a hnenum pawl thu a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Josef cu cabuai pakhat ah rawl an tuah sak; a unau pawl a dang cabuai ah rawl an pek ih Josef hnen rawl ei ding ih a rami Izipt bawi upa pawl cu cabuai dangte-ah rawl an ei. Ziangah Izipt mi pawl a dangte-ah an ei tile Hebru mi pawl thawn rawl eitlang cu ningzakza a si, tiin an ruat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A unau pawl cu Josef hmai hoi in an toter hai ih an kum vekin upabik in nautabik tiang a sangsangin an to. Cuti an to cu an hmuh tikah mangbangin pakhat le pakhat an zoh aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Josef cabuai ih a ummi rawl pawl an lak ih a unau pawl cu an bet, asinain Benjamin cu a unau pakhat ih comi let nga tam in rawl an pek. Cuticun an ei an in ih nuamzetin caan an hmang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef in a inn kiltu hnenum pa ih hnenah, “Hi pawl ih dip sungah an phurh thei zat in rawl than awla, an dip sungih tlunta bik ciarah an paisa ret aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule ka ngun khuathai hi an nauta bikih dip sung tlunta bikah a paisa thawn ret aw,” ti ah a fial. A ti bangtuk in a hnenum pa cun a tuah thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thaizing zingpitte in an laak pawl thawn an tlunter hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khua ihsin malte an feh hnuah Josef in a inn kiltu hnenum pa hnenah, “Zamrang in kha milai pawl kha va dawi aw. Na man hai tikah, ‘A ṭhami cu ziangah so a sia in nan rulh,’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Ziangah so ka bawipa ih ngun khuathai nan ruk? Ka bawipa ih sabitti innak a si ih, tinzohnak ih a hmanmi khal a si. Thil ṭha lo ngaingai nan tuah a si,’ ti ah na ti pei,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A hnenum pa cun a dawi ih a man tikah Josef ih sim vekin a va ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Bawipa hiti ih na ṭong rero hi na ti duhmi ziangso a si? Cuvek lawmmam tuah cu kan ruah dah lomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan dip sungih kan hmuhmi paisa cu Kanaan ram ihsin kan run keng ih na hnenah kan lo khirh sal ti na thei ko. Cuih hnuah cun ziangah so na bawipa inn ihsin sui le ngun cu kan ruk ding?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cuhrangah bawipa, kanmah lakah pakhatkhat in kan ruk a si ahcun cupa cu thah siseh; cule a dang pawl cu na salah in kai ko aw,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anih in, “Asi, nan timi cu ka lung a kim; asinain nanmah lakih pakhatkhat hnenah ngun khuathai ka hmuh a si ahcun cupa lawng cu ka sal ah a cang pei ih midang cu nan tlung thei ko ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Curuangah zamrangin an dip pawl cu an ṭhum ih an dip ciar cu an ong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Josef ih hnenum pa cun upabik pa ih dip ihsin nautabik pa ih dip tiang feltein a hawl tikah Benjamin ih dip sungah ngun khuathai cu a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cutikah an riahsia in an hnipuan an thlek ih an laak pawl parah an thilri cu an suang sal ih khuasung ah an kir sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Judah le a unau pawl Josef innih an thlen sal tikah Josef cu inn ah a rak um lai. A hmaiah an bok ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Josef in, “Nan thil tuahmi hi ziangso a si? Keimah vekih thuneimi bawi cun tinzohnak hmang in in kai thotho ding ti nan thei lo maw?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Judah in, “Bawipa, na hnenah ṭong ding zianghman kan nei lo. Ziangtin so kan lo el thei ding? Ziangtin so thiam kan co awkter thei ding? Pathian in kan mawhnak cu a langter thluh zo. Curuangah bawipa, a dip sungih ngun khuathai an hmuhmi pa lawng si loin kan zatein na sal kan cang ko pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Si hlah ee, cuticun ka ti lo ding. A dip sungih ka ngun khuathai an hmuhmi pa lawng ka salah a cang ding. Mi dang pawl cu nan pa ih hnenah harhdam tein va tlung uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule Judah cun Josef cu a hei naih ih, “Bawipa, zaangfahte in thusimnak caan i pe hrih hram aw. Ka parah na thin heng hram hlah aw, bawipa, nang cu amah Izipt ram siangpahrang vek thotho na si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Bawipa nangmah in, ‘Pa nan nei maw? Unau dang teh nan nei maw? tiih in suh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />‘Pa kan nei ih a tarzet zo; nau kan nei ih tlolsam a si lai hrih. Kan pa a tarzet hnu ih a suakmi a si. Kan naupa ih u-pa a thi zo ih amah thawn nukhat sungsuak ahcun amah lawng a nung lai a si; curuangah kan pa in amah cu a duh cuang,’ ti ah kan lo sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cutikah bawipa nangmah in, ‘Nan naupa cu rak hruai uh, a hmuh ka duh a si,’ ti ah in ti laiah khan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />‘Kan pa a taan thei lo ding; a taan ahcun kan pa cu a thi men ding,’ ti ah kan lo ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cutikah nangmah in, ‘Nan hnenih nan naupa a rat ve lo ahcun ka hmel hman in hmu thei lo ding,’ ti ah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Na salpa a si mi kan pa hnenih kan kir tikah, na ti vekin kan sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah anih in, ‘Vung fehsal uhla kan hrangah rawl vung lei sal uh,’ in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Kannih in, ‘Kan feh lo ding; ziangahtile kan nau nautabik a tel lo ahcun kan lo simmi pa kan vung tong thei lo ding. Kan nau nautabik a tel lawngah kan feh ding,’ kan ti tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />kan pa cun, ‘Ka nupi Rachel in fapa pahnih i hrin ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />pakhat cu a um nawn lo. Sahrang in a thlekbauh thluh a si pei ti ka zum; ziangahtile tuih sun tiangin ka hmu nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cuih tlunah hi a taangmi ka fapa nan lak lala ih ziangmaw tiih a thih pang asile riahsia thinhar in ka thi ngaingai ding a si,’ ti ah in ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“Curuangah bawipa, ka pa hnenah keimah lawng ka kir ih ka nau a hmuh lo asile kan pa cu a thi rori ding a si. Kan pa ih nunnak le hi pa ih nunnak cu a zom-aw a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Curuangah bawipa, kan pa hi a tar zawng ah thihpi tlak riahsiatnak a parah kan thlenter ngaingai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih tlunah bawipa, hi ka nauhakpa ih hrangah ka pa hnenah ka nunnak ka kamta a si. ‘Na hnenih hi nauhakpa ka rak kirpi lo asile na hmaiah ka nunsung hmuahhmuah mawh ka phur ding,’ ka ti zomi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Curuangah bawipa, hi nauhakpa cu a ule pawl thawn tlungter hram awla, keimah sawn hi na salah ka rung taang pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Nauhakpa tel locun ziangtinso ka pa ih hnenah ka tlun ngam ding? Ka pa ih tuar dingmi riahsiatnak cu ziangtinso ka hmuh ngam ding?” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Josef cu a lunghno suup-aw thei nawn loin a hnenum pawl hnenah, “Mi hmuahhmuah suakter uh,” ti ah a auh hai. An suak thluh ih a unau pawl hnenah Josef ka si ti a phuan-awk tikah an kiangah zohman an um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Josef cu a ṭap ih napi in a ṭah ruangah Izipt mi pawl in an thei. Cuih thuhla cu siangpahrang inn tiangin a thang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Josef in a unau pawl hnenah, “Josef ka si. Ka pa a nunglai maw?” ti ah a sut. Asinain a unau pawl cun an ṭih tuk ruangah an sawn ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Josef cun, “I rak naih deuh uh,” ti ah a ti ih an hei naih tikah Josef in, “Izipt ramih nan rak zuarmi nan nau Josef kha ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Asinain hi ramih in zuar ruangah nan riahsia in mawhthluk aw rero hlah uh. Mi nunnak run dingah hitawk ih i thlentertu ngaingai cu Pathian a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuih kum hi hi ram sungah paam kum a kum hnihnak lawng a si lai. Paam kum kum nga a um hrih lai ding a si ih cuih sungah leileh le rawlkhawm ti khal a um lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nan tesinfa tiang an nun theinak dingah nan hlanah Pathian in i thlenter a si. Mi tampi ka run theinak ding le nanmah tla nan nunnak dingah thlahmi ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Curuangah hitawk ram i thlentertu ngaingai cu nannih nan si lo; Pathian a si. Pathian in, Faro hrangah a pa vekah i tuah ih a ramsung hmuahhmuah hi ka ṭuanvo a si ih Izipt ram hmuahhmuah uktu ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Curuangah ka pa ih hnenah zamrangin va kir uhla na fa Josef in, ‘Pathian in Izipt ram hmuahhmuah uktu-ah i tuah zo. Ka hnenah zamrangin ra aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keimah thawn kan hlat-awk tuk lonak dingah Goshen lamah na um pei ih nangmah le na faale pawl le na tesinfa pawl le na neihmi ṭilva - tuu le me le caw hmuahhmuah tla thawn nan um pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Goshen ih nan um ahcun ka lo kilkhawi phah thiam ding a si. Paam kum kum nga a baak lai a si ruangah nangmah siseh, na innsang le na neihmi ṭilva siseh, ei ding nei loih nan um pang ding cu ka duh lo, a ti,’ ti ah nan va sim pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Atu cu nanmah le ka naupa Benjamin in nan hnenih a ṭong rerotu hi Josef ka si, ti nan mit rori in in hmu thluh zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Izipt ram sungih huham ka neihzia hi ka pa ih hnenah va sim uhla, nan tonmi le nan hmuhmi hmuahhmuah dang khal nan va sim thluh pei. Zamrangte in va kir uhla amah rak hruai uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Josef in a naupa Benjamin cu a pom ih a ṭap. Benjamin khal in a pom ih a ṭap ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cuih hnuah Josef in a ule pawl cu pakhat hnu pakhat ṭap phah in a pom ih a hnam vivo hai. Cuṭheh in a unau pawl thawn an totlang ih thunuam an rel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Josef ih unau pawl an ra ti thu cu siangpahrang inn tiangin a thang thluh ih Faro le a kuthnuai bawi pawl khal an lung a awi ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Josef hnenah, “Na unau pawl kha an laak thawn rawl phur-aw hai sehla Kanaan ram ah va tlung hai seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An pa le an sungte dang pawl va hruai hai sehla ka hnenah ra hai seh. Izipt ram sungih ram ṭha bik ka pe ding ih kan ram sungih a suakmi a ṭha bik an ei ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An nupi pawl le an faate note pawl to dingah Izipt ram ihsin rangleng tla hei keng hai seh. An pa run hruai hai seh ti felfai tein sim hai aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />An thilri taanmi zaangraam hlah hai seh. Ziangahtile Izipt ram sungih a ṭha bik cu anmah ih ta a si paam ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jakob ih fapa pawl cun a sim vekin an tuah. Faro ih thu a pek vekin Josef in rangleng pawl tla a pek ih lampi hrangah lamcaw khal a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cuih tlunah a unau pawl cu hnipuan voikhat thleng awknak ciar a pek, asinain Benjamin cu ngun tangka zathum le hnipuan voinga thleng awknak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Izipt ram sungih suakmi thil ṭha bik pawl laak pahra phurin a pa a kuat. Cun a pa a ratnak ding lamcaw hrangah rawl le sang le rawl phun dangdang laak pahra phur a kuat fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A unau pawl cu malte a hei thlah ih, “Lampi ah va to-aw hlah uh,” ti ah a cahta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Izipt ram ihsin an suak ih Kanaan ram an pa Jakob hnenah an va thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Josef a nunglai sokhaw! Izipt ram hmuahhmuah uktu a si!” ti ah an pa cu an sim. An pa cu a mangbangin a thir dukdi ih a zum thei hrimhrim lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Asinain Josef ih thusimmi hmuahhmuah an sim tikah le Izipt ram a fehnak dingah Josef ih a kuatmi rangleng pawl tla a hmuh tikah Jakob cu a lungawi in a thla a tlung sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob cun, “Ka fapa Josef a nunglai ngaingai ti ka fiang, in sim a ṭul nawn lo. Ka feh pei ih ka thih hlanah ka va tongta ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakob cu a neihmi thil hmuahhmuah thawn a pok ih Beersheba a thleng. Cutawkah a pa Isaak ih Pathian hnenah thawinak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A cuih zanah langnak a hmu ih Pathian in, “Jakob, Jakob!” ti ah a ko. Jakob in, “ Bawipa , hinah ka um,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Pathian in, “Keimah cu Pathian, na pa ih Pathian ka si. Izipt ramih feh ding cu ṭih aw hlah. Cutawk ram ah na tesinfa pawl cu miphun tumzet ah ka tuah ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Izipt ram ah nangmah hnenah ka feh ding ih na tesinfa pawl cu hitawk ram ah ka kirter leh ding. Na thih tikah Josef cu na kiangah a um ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Beersheba ihsin Jakob cu a pok ih a fapa pawl in an pa Jakob le an fanote pawl le an nupi pawl cu Faro ih a rak kuatmi rangleng pawl parah an toter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kanaan ramih an neihmi ṭilva hmuahhmuah le thilri hmuahhmuah thawn an pok ih Izipt ram ah an feh. Jakob cun a tesinfa pawl,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />a fapa pawl le a tupa pawl, a fanu pawl le a tunu pawl, an zatein a fehpi ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Izipt ramih a fehmi Jakob ih tefa pawl ih hmin cu a hnuailam vek an si: Jakob ih fapa upabik Reuben,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Reuben ih fapa pawl: Hanok, Pallu, Hezron le Karmi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Simeon ih fapa pawl: Jemuel, Jamin, Ohad, Jakhin, Zohar le Kanaan nunau nu ih fapa Shaul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi ih fapa pawl: Gershon, Kohath le Merari.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Judah ih fapa pawl: Er, Onan, Shelah, Perez le Zerah. (Asinain Er le Onan cu Kanaan ramah an thita.) Perez ih fapa pawl: Hezron le Hamul.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Issakhar ih fapa pawl: Tola, Puvah, Jashub le Shimron.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Zebulun ih fapa pawl: Sered, Elon, le Jahleel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />(Hi pawl cu a fanu Dinah siarcih in Leah in Mesopotamia ram ah a pasal Jakob a hrinmi fapa pawl an si. Leah thawn an hrinmi tefa pawl cu an zatein sawmthum le pathum an si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gad ih fapa pawl: Ziphion, Haggi, Shuni, Ezbon, Eri, Arodi le Areli.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Asher ih fapa pawl: Imnah, Ishvah, Ishvi, Beriah, le an farnu Serah. Beriah ih fapa pawl: Heber le Malkhiel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />(Hi minung hleiruk cu Laban in a fanu Leah hnenih a fehter mi a salnu Zilpah ih a hrin sakmi Jakob ih tefa an si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Jakob ih nupi Rachel ih hrinmi fapa pawl: Josef le Benjamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cun Heliopolis khua ih puithiam Potifera ih fanu Asenath in Izipt ramah Josef thawn fapa pahnih Manasseh le Efraim an hring.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Benjamin ih fapa pawl: Bela, Bekher, Ashbel, Gera, Naaman, Ehi, Rosh, Muppim, Huppim, le Ard.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />(Hi minung hleili cu Rachel ih hrinmi Jakob ih tefa pawl an si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Dan ih fapa cu Hushim a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Naftali le a fapa pawl: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer le Shillem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />(Hi minung pasarih cu Laban in a fanu Rachel hnenih a fehtermi a salnu Bilhah ih a hrinsakmi Jakob ih tefa an si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Izipt ramih a fehmi Jakob ih tefa pawl cu, a fapa pawl ih nupi pawl tel loin an zatein sawmruk le paruk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Izipt ramah Josef in fapa pahnih a nei ih, curuangah Jakob ih sungte cu an zatein Izipt ram an thlen tikah minung sawmsarih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakob in Josef tong dingah Judah kha hmaiah a thlah ih, “Goshen in in rak hmuak seh,” ti ah a cah. A sungkhat pawl Goshen ram an thlen tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Josef cu a rangleng a to ih a pa Jakob hmuak dingah a feh. A pa a ton tikah Josef cu a pa ih hngawng a kuah ih reipi a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cutikah Jakob in Josef hnenah, “Atu cu na hmel ka lo hmu ih na nung ti ka thei zo. Ka thih khalle poi ka ti nawn lo,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cule Josef in a unau pawl le a pa ih sungkhat pawl hnenah, “Faro hnenah ka va feh pei ih ka unau le ka pa ih sungkhat pawl Kanaan ramih a ummi cu ka hnenah an thleng zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Annih tla cu tuukhal an si ih ṭilva vulh pawl an si. Atu-ah an tuurual le an cawrual le an neihmi dang hmuahhmuah thawn an ra thleng zo a si, ka va ti ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Faro in a lo kawh ih, ‘Ziang hna so nan ṭuan?’ tiih thu a lo suh tikah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />nannih in, ‘Bawipa, kan pu le kan pa pawl vekin kan nauhak lai ihsin tuu kan khal a si,’ nan ti pei. Cuticun Goshen ram ah nan um thei ding,” ti ah a ti. Izipt mi pawl in tuukhal pawl cu an ningsin zawng a si ruangah Josef in hiti ih a simnak cu a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Josef cu Faro hnenah a feh ih, “Ka pa le ka unau pawl Kanaan ihsin an tuu le an cawrual le an neihmi hmuahhmuah tla thawn an ra thleng zo. Atu-ah Goshen ram ah an um,” ti ah a va sim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cule amah hnenih a fehpimi a unau panga cu Faro hnenah a hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in, “Nan hnaṭuan ziangso a si?” ti ah a sut ih annih in, “Bawipa, kan pu le kan pa vekin kannih khal tuukhal kan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hi ram ah hin bawipa, kan ra zo. Ziangahtile Kanaan ramah paam a besia tuk ih kan ṭilva pawl hrangah hrampi hman a um lo. Curuangah bawipa, zaangfahte in Goshen ram ah in umter hram aw,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cutikah Faro in Josef hnenah, “Atu cu na pa le na unau pawl an ra thleng zo ih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Izipt ram cu an ta a si ko. Goshen ram ahcun um ko hai seh; kan ram sungih a ṭha bik hmun pakhat a si. Cun anmah lakih rinsantlak an um asile keimah ih ṭilva khaaltu pawl hotu ah ret aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Josef in a pa Jakob cu a fehpi ih Faro a tonter. Jakob in Faro cu thluasuah a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cule Faro in, “Kum ziangzatso na si?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jakob in, “Leilung ah vakvai in kum za le sawmthum ka nung zo. Ka pu le ka pa pawl an vahvaihnak kum cu ka zat lo. Ka kum hi a mal naón ka nunsung san hi a har ngaingai a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jakob in Faro cu thluasuah a pekta ih a feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Josef in a pa le a unau pawl cu Faro ih thupek bangtuk in Izipt ram sungih ram a ṭhatnak bik Rameses khawpi kiangah a umter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A pa le a unau pawl le, a pa ih sungkhat pawl hmuahhmuah cu nauta bik tiangin Josef in an ei ding rawl a pek ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Paam cu a luar deuhdeuh ih leilung tlun khui hmanah rawl a um lo. Izipt le Kanaan ramih minung pawl cu rilrawng in an cau ṭheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cutikah Izipt le Kanaan ram sung minung pawl in rawl leinak ih an hmanmi tangka hmuahhmuah cu Josef in a khawm ṭheh ih Faro inn ah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ramsungmi pawl ih neihmi paisa a cem thluh tikah Izipt mi pawl cu Josef hnenah an ra ih, “Rawl in pe aw. Kan paisa le a cem ṭheh zo. Ziangtal in ruahsak lo ahcun kan thi thluh ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Nan paisa a cem ṭheh zo a si ahcun nan ṭilva rak keng uhla rawl in ka lo thleng hai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Curuangah Josef hnenah an ṭilva pawl rang, tuu, me, caw le laak pawl cu an rak keng ih Josef in rawl in a rak thleng. Cuih kum cu an ṭilva hmuahhmuahih manah rawl a pek hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hmai kum cu Josef hnenah an ra sal ih, “Bawipa, nang cu kan lo pheh lo pei; kan paisa a cem ṭheh zo ih kan ṭilva hmuahhmuah khal na ta an si ṭheh zo. Bawipa, kan leiram le kan taksa ruangpi siar lo zianghman lo pek ding kan nei nawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />In thiter siang hram hlah awla, ziangtal in ruahsak aw. Kanmah kan minung le kan leiram tla rawl in in lei aw. Faro ih sal kan cang thluh ko pei ih kan ram hmuahhmuah khal amah ih ta-ah si ṭheh ko seh. Rawl loih kan thih ṭheh lonak ding le kan ram pawl tla ramṭhingih an can ṭheh lonak dingah rawl le rawlci in pe hram aw,” ti ah an dil.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in Izipt ram sungih leiram hmuahhmuah cu Faro hrangah a lei ṭheh. Paam cu a besiat zet hrangah Izipt mi hmuahhmuah in an loram an zuar ṭheh. Izipt ram hmuahhmuah cu Faro ih ta ah a cang thluh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Izipt ram khatlam deng ihsin khatlam deng tiang a ummi minung hmuahhmuah cu hnaṭuantu salah a tuah ṭheh hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef ih a lei lomi leiram cu puithiam pawl ih leiram lawnglawng an si. Puithiam pawl cu an leiram an zuar a ṭul lo; ziangahtile Faro in an cawm awknak a pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cule Josef in Izipt mi pawl hnenah, “Atu-ah nanmah le nan leiram pawl cu Faro ih hrangah ka lo lei thluh zo a si ti nan hmu. Hinah thlaici nan hrangah a um ih nan lo ah va cing uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rawlkhawm tikcu ah nan neihmi rawl ṭhen nga ṭhen khat Faro nan pek pei. A taangmi hmuahhmuah cu nanmah ih hrangah a si pei; nan loih nan tuh ding thlaici le nanmah le nan sungkhat pawl le nan faate pawl tla-ih cawm awknak hrangah a si pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cutikah annih in, “Kan nunnak in run ngah zo; bawipa, kan tlunah na ṭha ngaingai ih kannih cu Faro ih sal kan si ko ding,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Curuangah an rawl neihmi-ih ṭhen nga ṭhen khat cu Faro pek dingin Izipt ram sungah Josef in daan a tuah. Cuih daan cu atu tiangin an hmang lai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Israel mi pawl cu Izipt ram Goshen ah cuticun an um. An neinung, leiram an nei ih an karhzai ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jakob cu Izipt ramah kum hleisarih a um ih, amah ih kum cu za sawmli kum sarih a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Jakob cu a thih caan a nai thlang hrangah a fapa Josef a ko ih, “Na mithmai ṭha ka co a si ahcun ka hnenah thukamnak tuah hram aw. Na kut cu ka cawn karlakah ret awla ka parah thungai zetin, rinsantlak na sinak ding le Izipt ram sungih i phum lonak dingah Bawipa hmin in thu kam aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka thih tikah Izipt ram ihsin i fehpi awla ka pu le ka pa vekin an thlaan ah i phum aw,” ti ah a ti. Josef in, “Na sim vekin ka tuah ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Jakob in, “Ka tuah tengteng ding ti ah siatcam in thu i kam aw,” ti ah a ti ih Josef in thu cu a kam. Cutikah Jakob cu a ihkhun lu lamah lukuun in lungawi thu a sim.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tawkfang a rei hnuah Josef cu, “Na pa a na a si,” ti ah an sim. Curuangah Josef cu a fapa pahnih Manasseh le Efraim thawn a pa veh dingah an feh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na fapa Josef cu nangmah zoh dingah a ra a si,” ti ah an sim tikah, Jakob cu a to thei nalo cingin ihkhun parah a hung to.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jakob in Josef hnenah, “Ziangkimtithei Pathian cu Kanaan ram Luz khua ah ka hnenah a lang ih thlawsuah i pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian in, ‘Tefa tampi ka lo pek ding ih na tesinfa pawl cu miphun tampi-ah an cang ding. Hi ram cu na tesinfa pawl hnenah kumkhua in anmah ih ta-ah ka pe ding,’ ti ah i ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na fapa pahnih Izipt ram ka ra thlen hlanih na hrinmi tla cu ka fapa ngaingai ah siar an si ding. Reuben le Simeon ka fapa an si tlukin Efraim le Manasseh khal ka fapa an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asinain anmah ih hnu ih na hrinmi na faate pawl cu nangmah ih ta an si ding. Roconak ahcun an u Efraim le Manasseh thawn ṭawmcih an si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hitiih ka tinak cu ziangah a si tile Mesopotamia ram ihsin ka ra kir ih Kanaan ramsung ka thlen hnu Efrath khua kan thlen hlan deuhte ah, ka riahsiattertu bikah, na nu Rachel in in thihsan ih Efrath lamzin ah ka phumta a si,” ti ah a ti. (Efrath cu atu ahcun Bethlehem tiin kawh a si.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Josef ih fapa pahnih cu Jakob in a hmuh tikah, “Hi nauhak pawl cu zoso an si?” ti ah a sut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in, “Annih cu hi Izipt ram ah Pathian ih i pekmi ka fapa an si,” ti ah a ti. Cule Jakob in, “Ka hnenah rak hruai awla thlawsuah ka pe hai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tar zo hrangah Jakob cu a mit a mal thlang ih ṭhatein khua a hmu thei lo. Josef in a fapa pawl cu a pa ih hnenah a hruai ih a pa cun a pom ih a hnam hai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jakob in Josef hnenah, “Nangmah ton sal ding hman hi ka rak zum dah lo. Asinain atu cu Pathian in na faate pawl tla i hmuhter a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in a pa ih cawn par ihsin a faate pawl cu a lak hnuah a pa ih hmaiah leilung dai in a kuun ih upatnak a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Josef in a fapa pahnih cu an kut veve in a kai ih a pa Jakob ih kehlam um dingah Efraim cu a vorhlam kut in a hruai ih, a pa ih vorhlam um dingah Manasseh cu a kehlam kut in a hruai ih a fehpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain Jakob in a kut kalh-aw in a nauta deuh Efraim ih lu parah a vorhlam kut a suang ih a upa deuh Manasseh ih lu parah a kehlam kut a suang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cule Josef cu thlawsuahnak a pek ih: “Ka pu Abraham le ka pa Isaak in An nun sungih an renmi Pathian, Cuih Pathian in nannih cu thluasuah lo pe hai hram seh. Tuihsun tiangin i fingkhawitu Pathian in nannih cu bawngmal lo sawm hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Siatsuahnak tinkim sung ihsin i runtu vanmi in, Nannih cu thluasuah lo pe hram seh. Ka hmin le ka pu Abraham le ka pa Isaak ih hmin cu, Anmah thawngin nung ringring hram seh. Te le fa tampi nei in, Leilung parah miphun tampi ah cang hai seh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun a pa in a vorhlam kut cu Efraim lu parih a suan kha Josef in a hmuh tikah a lung a kim lo ngaingai ih a pa ih kut cu Efraim ih lu ihsin Manasseh ih lu ah ṭhawn dingin a lak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cule a pa hnenah, “Ka pa, khati cun a si lo ding. Hi pa hi fa upa a si ruangah a lu parah na vorhlam kut re aw,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain a pa in a duh lo; “Ka thei ko ka fapa, ka thei ko. Manasseh ih tesinfa pawl khal miphun tumzet ah an cang ve ko ding. Asinain anih hnakin a naupa cu a tum sawn ding ih a tesinfa pawl cu miphun tumzet ah an cang ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cutiin cuih ni-ah thluasuahnak a pek hai: “Israel mi pawl in midang hrangah Pathian ih thluasuah an dil tikah, ‘Efraim le Manasseh thluasuah vanluh teih an um bangin, Pathian in lo thluasuah hram seh,’ an ti ding,” ti ah a ti. Cuticun Jakob in Efraim cu Manasseh hlanah a ret.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun Jakob in Josef hnenah, “Kei cu ka thi cing ding. Asinain Pathian cu na hnenah a um ding ih na pu le na pa pawl ih ram ah a lo kirter leh ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cule Amor mi pawl hnen ihsin ka li le ka nam thawn ka lakmi ram hmuahhmuah lakih ram ṭhabik Shekhem cu na unau pawl coter loin nangmah hnenah ka lo pek a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Jakob in a fapa pawl a ko ih, “Hmun khatah khawm-aw uhla hmailamah nan tlunih thil a cang dingmi ka lo sim cia hai ding,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ra uhla ngai uh, Jakob ih fapa pawl, Nan pa Israel thusimmi ngai uh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Reuben, ka fatir, Nang cu ka thazaang na si, Patling ka si hnu ih ka neih hmaisa bik na si, Ka fapa pawl lakah a cak bik le a hngal bik;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang cu tilian bangin mi thinsahlap na si, Mi thupi bik na si dah lo ding, Ziangahtile na pa ih nusun rori na sualpi, Na pa ih ihkhun parah na kai ih na baalter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Simeon le Levi cu unau an si, An hriamhrei cu mi-ih thisen luannak ah an hmang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An thuthup relnak ah ka tel lo pei, An khawkhannakah siarcih ka si lo pei, Ziangahtile an ai a thok tikah mi an that, Nomnak menah cawcang kaiza an sat cat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An thinhengnak parah camriamnak um seh, Ziangahtile an thinhengnak a luar tuk. An thinlingnak par khalah camriamnak um seh, Ziangahtile a siakha tuk. Jakob ram sungah ka ṭhekdarh thluh hai ding, Israel mi lakah ka ṭhekdarh thluh hai ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Judah, nang cu na unau pawl in an lo thangṭhat ding, Na ral pawl an hngawng in na kai ding ih, Na hmaiah na unau pawl an kuun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judah cu kiosa no bangtuk a si, Sa a deh thluh in a rolnak ah a kir sal, ka fapa, Judah cu kiosa vek a si; A dok aw ṭhunṭho ih a vung bok sal, Zohman in an ṭhang ngam lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A siangpahrang fung a keng ih, A tesinfa pawl cu uktu an si ringring ding. Miphun tampi in ngunkhuai an pe ding ih, Upatnak in a hmaiah an kuun ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A laak no cu sabit kuangah a hren, Sabit kuang ṭha bikah. A hnipuan cu sabitti in a sawp, Thii bangin a senmi sabitti ah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sabitti a in nakah a mit cu thii bangin a sen hreihrei, Cawhnawi a in ruangah a ha cu vur bangin a vaar fiahfiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Zebulun cu tifinriat kapah a um ding, A tikap tla cu tangphawlawng colhnak a si ding; A ram cu Sidon tiang a kau ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Issakhar cu a cakzetmi laak a si, A phurhmi thilrit tom hnih karlakah a bok;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A colhnak hmun a ṭhatzia le, A ram a nomzia a hmuh ruangah, Thilrit phur dingah a zaang cu a tun ih, Hnaṭuan khung ṭuantu sal ah a cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Dan cu a miphun uktu a si ding, Israel miphun pawl vek thotho a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Dan cu lamzin kapih rul vek a si ding, Zintlang ih tur neimi rulha vek a si. Rang kebeu ah a cuk ih rang totu cu dunglamah a hlon.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Maw Bawipa , nangmah ih runnak ka hngak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Gad cu fifir pawl in an siim ding; Asinain a do ding ih a dawi suak ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Asher ih loram ihsin rawlṭha a suak ding, Siangpahrang ih ei tlak rawl a si ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />“Naftali cu a tlang dualdomi zuknengpi, Fano mawi zetzet neimi vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Josef cu hramlak ih laak, Cerhti kiangih a tlangmi laak bangtuk a si, Tlang parih laak note vek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Zaangfahnak nei loin a ral pawl in an hual, An li le an thal thawn an dawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Asinain Jakob ih Pathian, Ziangkimtithei ih cahnak le, Israel ih Lungpi, Israel Khaltu thawngin A li cu a kiak thei ve lo ih A baan tha cu a cak teltelzet a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na pa ih Pathian, nangmah a lo bawmtu le, A lo thluasuahtu Ziangkimtithei Pathian in, Van ihsin thlawsuahnak cu ruah bangin, Lei hnuai khalin tidai bangin, Te le fa, ṭilva sumhnam thlawsuahnak thawn,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Fangvui fual le rawlhan tlingin, Thlaithlak le rawl ṭuan thlawsuahnak; Khuahlan ihsin a rak ummi tlang ih thlawsuahnak le, Kumkhua a hmunmi tlangpar ih duhnungza thil pawl cu, A unau lakih mi hleice dingin sersiammi, Josef ih lu parah thleng thluh hram seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />“Benjamin cu a hrang zetmi cinghnia paak a si; A deh ciami cu zinglamah a ei, Zanlam ah a ngahmi sa cu a ṭhendarh ciamco,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hi pawl hi Israel miphun hleihnih an si ih an hnenah an pa ih thucahmi an si. Pakhat hnu pakhat anmah thawn a mawitawk in thluasuah a pek ciar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Cun Jakob in a fapa pawl hnenah, “Ka pu le ka pa hnenih feh ding ka si thlang. Kanaan ram Mamre ihsin nisuahnak lam Makpelah ah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hit mi pa Efron hnen ihsin ram le lungkua cu thlaan hrangah Abraham ih leimi a um. Cutawkah in run phum pei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cutawkah Abraham le a nupi Sarah phum an si. Isaak le a nupi Rebekah khal cutawkah phum an si thotho. Keimah in ka nupi Leah khal cutawkah ka phum zo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cuih ram le a sungih a ummi lungkua cu Hit mi pa hnen ihsin leimi a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A fapa pawl hnenih a thucahmi a ṭheh vete in Jakob cu a ihkhun parah a ke a com ih a thaw a cemcihta. Cuticun a pu le a pa hnenah a fehta a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cutikah Josef in a pa ih ruak cu a pom ih ṭap rero phahin a hmai a hnam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun a kuthnuai-ih hna a ṭuantu sibawi pawl cu a pa ih ruak siat loih erh dingah a fial ih a fial vekin an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Miruak siat lo dingih an tuah tikah a rei ṭheu bangtuk in ni sawmli sung an rei. Cun Izipt mi pawl in Jakob thih cu ni sawmsarih sung an ul ih an ṭah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A pa an ṭah ni a cem hnuah Josef in siangpahrang ih bawi pawl hnenah, “In zaangfah a si ahcun hiti in Faro hnenah i va sim sak uh:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Ka pa a thih hlan deuhah Kanaan ram ah amah hrang rori ih a laihmi thlaan ah keimah ih phum dingin thukamnak i tuahter ih thukamnak cu ka tuah. Curuangah ka pa va phum dingah i thlah hram aw. Zamrangte in ka ra kir sal ko ding a ti,’ ti ah in sim sak uh,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cule Faro in, “Thu na kam vekin phum dingah va feh aw,” ti ah thu a khirh sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Curuangah a pa phum dingin Josef cu a feh. Faro kuthnuai-ih bawi hmuahhmuah, a innsangih mi upa deuh le Izipt ram sungih hruaitu deuhdeuh tla in Josef cu an thlun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun Josef ih innsang hmuahhmuah, a unau pawl le a pa ih sungte pawl tla an feh thluh. An nauhak pawl le an tuu, an me le an caw pawl lawnglawng Goshen ram ah an taang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rangleeng in siseh, rangpar in siseh, an feh dutdo ih an tam ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jordan tiva ihsin nisuahnak lamih a ummi Atad ih fangcilnak rawn an thlen tikah reipi mithiphum pumkhawmnak an tuah. Cule Josef in ni sarih sung mithi zuun a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cuticun Atad hmunih an mithi ngai daan cu Kanaan mi in an hmuh tikah, “Izipt mi pawl in mithi ngainak nasazet an tuah a sihi,” ti ah an ti. Curuangah cuih hmun cu Abel Mizraim ti ah an ko ih Jordan tiva ihsin nisuahnak lamah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cuticun Jakob ih thupek vekin a fapa pawl in an tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kanaan ram ahcun a ruak cu an phur ih Hit mi pa Efron hnen ihsin thlaan hrangah Abraham in a rak leimi ram, Mamre ihsin nisuahnak lamih a ummi Makpelah-ih lungkua ah an phum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A pa a phum ṭheh tikah Josef cu a unau pawl le a pa phum dingih a fehmi hmuahhmuah tla thawn Izipt ah an kir.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An pa a thih hnuah Josef ih unau pawl in, “Josef in in rak hua ziar laiin a tlunih harsatnak kan thlentermi hmuahhmuah ruangah in lehrul tum sehla ziangtinso kan ti ding? ti ah an ti-aw ih an thin a phang ngaingai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Curuangah Josef hnenah, “Na pa in a thih hlanah thu in cahta:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />‘Josef rak sim uhla, thil ṭha lo a tlunih nan tuahmi sualnak le siatnak cu lo ngaithiam seh,’ a ti. Curuangah kannih na pa ih Pathian ih siahhlawh pawl hi in ngaithiam hram aw,” ti ah thu an cah. A cuih thu an sim tikah Josef cu a ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun a unau pawl cu an ra ih a hmaiah an kuun ih, “Na hmaiah na sal kan si ko,” ti ah an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Asinain Josef in, “Phang hlah uh. Pathian ai cu ka awh thei lo ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keimah siatsuah dingah khua nan khang naón Pathian in thil ṭha-ah a canter a si. Cucu tuih sunih kan hmuh vekin mi tampi humhimnak dingah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Curuangah nan thin phang hlah uh. Nanmah siseh, nan faate pawl siseh, ka lo cawm hai ding,” ti ah a ti. Cuticun Josef in ṭong thlum in a hneem hai ih an hna a ngam sal.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Josef cu Izipt ramah a pa ih sungkhat pawl thawn an um ih kum za le kum hra a ti ah a thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A thih hlanah Efraim ih faate pawl suan thum tiang a hmuta. Manasseh ih fapa Makhir in faate a neih tikah Josef in a sungkhat ah a siarcih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cun a unau pawl hnenah, “Kei cu ka thi thlang ding. Asinain Pathian in a lo kilkhawi ding ih hi ram ihsin a lo suah hai ding; Abraham, Isaak le Jakob hnenih a kam ciami ramah a lo hruai tengteng hai ding a si,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Cule Josef in Israel ih fapa pawl cu siatcam in thu a kamter ih, “Pathian in a lo veh caan a thlen ih hi ram ihsin a lo suahpi hai tikah ka ruh nan lak pei ih nan fehpi pei,” ti ah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cuticun Josef cu kum za le kum hra a ti ah Izipt ram ahcun a thi. Siat thei lo dingin an erh ih ruak kuang sungah Izipt ramah cun an ret.
  </para>
</usx>
